(43,23,10,2,'2023-09-27 09:34:27','<h1>Eliminar clave SSH <span id=\"eliminar-clave-ssh-en-Stackbill-portal-de-administración-de-la-nube\"></span></h1>\n<h2>Eliminar clave SSH en el portal de administración de la nube Stackbill</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Haga clic en el botón desplegable <strong>Recursos virtuales</strong> debajo del ícono del panel, que está disponible en la esquina superior izquierda. En el menú desplegable, haga clic en <strong>Clave SSH</strong> para crear una nueva clave SSH.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/SSH-Keymanager/d8d2da47563f49ecbb4c899844d6cd17.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>Aparece la pantalla <strong>Clave SSH</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/uploadssh/fc981cfd871349e2b678aa1e08df3fa4.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>En el lado derecho del panel, el usuario puede ver la opción llamada <strong>Eliminar</strong>.</li>\n<li>Haz click en eso.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/uploadssh/5226412294074081846da4d92f24e1f1.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>Aparece la pantalla <strong>Confirmación de eliminación</strong></li>\n<li>Haga clic en el botón <strong>Eliminar</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/uploadssh/bf37ee97f9144da1b9bf7b7ce44b5f58.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>Ahora la clave SSH se ha eliminado correctamente.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de gestión de la nube</a> intuitivo y de autoservicio completo con amplias funciones que aprovechan Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia de última generación.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Eliminar clave SSH <span id=\"eliminar-clave-ssh-en-Stackbill-portal-de-administración-de-la-nube\"></span>\n\n\n## Eliminar clave SSH en el portal de administración de la nube Stackbill\n\n- Haga clic en el botón desplegable **Recursos virtuales** debajo del ícono del panel, que está disponible en la esquina superior izquierda. En el menú desplegable, haga clic en **Clave SSH** para crear una nueva clave SSH.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/SSH-Keymanager/d8d2da47563f49ecbb4c899844d6cd17.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n\n- Aparece la pantalla **Clave SSH**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/uploadssh/fc981cfd871349e2b678aa1e08df3fa4.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n\n- En el lado derecho del panel, el usuario puede ver la opción llamada **Eliminar**.\n- Haz click en eso.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/uploadssh/5226412294074081846da4d92f24e1f1.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n\n- Aparece la pantalla **Confirmación de eliminación**\n- Haga clic en el botón **Eliminar**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/uploadssh/bf37ee97f9144da1b9bf7b7ce44b5f58.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n\n- Ahora la clave SSH se ha eliminado correctamente.\n\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] es un [Portal de gestión de la nube](https://localhost:8080/) intuitivo y de autoservicio completo con amplias funciones que aprovechan Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia de última generación.**','\0','Eliminar clave SSH','guía-del-usuario/administrador-de-claves-ssh/eliminar-clave-ssh',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',42,'2083488b-346b-4565-8cd0-5b2991324de5',NULL,5,NULL,175,0,'cms_324de5'),
(44,24,10,2,'2023-09-27 09:35:32','<h1>Excluir chave SSH <span id =\"delete-ssh-key-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h1>\n<h2>Excluir chave SSH no portal de gerenciamento de nuvem Stackbill</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Clique no botão suspenso <strong>Recursos Virtuais</strong> abaixo do ícone do painel, que está disponível no canto superior esquerdo. no menu suspenso, clique em <strong>Chave SSH</strong> para criar uma nova chave SSH.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/SSH-Keymanager/d8d2da47563f49ecbb4c899844d6cd17.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>A tela <strong>chave SSH</strong> é exibida.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/uploadssh/fc981cfd871349e2b678aa1e08df3fa4.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>No lado direito do painel o usuário pode ver a opção chamada <strong>Excluir</strong>.</li>\n<li>Clique nisso.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/uploadssh/5226412294074081846da4d92f24e1f1.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>A tela <strong>Confirmação de exclusão</strong> é exibida</li>\n<li>Clique no botão <strong>Excluir</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/uploadssh/bf37ee97f9144da1b9bf7b7ce44b5f58.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>Agora a chave SSH foi excluída com sucesso.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Sobre Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de gerenciamento de nuvem</a> completo e intuitivo de autoatendimento com amplos recursos que aproveitam Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência de última geração.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Excluir chave SSH <span id =\"delete-ssh-key-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n\n## Excluir chave SSH no portal de gerenciamento de nuvem Stackbill\n\n- Clique no botão suspenso **Recursos Virtuais** abaixo do ícone do painel, que está disponível no canto superior esquerdo. no menu suspenso, clique em **Chave SSH** para criar uma nova chave SSH.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/SSH-Keymanager/d8d2da47563f49ecbb4c899844d6cd17.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n\n- A tela **chave SSH** é exibida.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/uploadssh/fc981cfd871349e2b678aa1e08df3fa4.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n\n- No lado direito do painel o usuário pode ver a opção chamada **Excluir**.\n- Clique nisso.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/uploadssh/5226412294074081846da4d92f24e1f1.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n\n- A tela **Confirmação de exclusão** é exibida\n- Clique no botão **Excluir**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/uploadssh/bf37ee97f9144da1b9bf7b7ce44b5f58.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n\n- Agora a chave SSH foi excluída com sucesso.\n\n**Sobre Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] é um [Portal de gerenciamento de nuvem](https://localhost:8080/) completo e intuitivo de autoatendimento com amplos recursos que aproveitam Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência de última geração.**','\0','Excluir chave SSH','guia-de-usuario/gerenciador-de-chaves-ssh/excluir-chave-ssh',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',42,'ea5fa52c-0018-4520-9f17-cc29b0f6ba56',NULL,5,NULL,175,0,'cms_f6ba56'),
(45,3,1,2,'2023-09-27 09:44:41','<h1>Bem-vindo à Documentação Stackbill</h1>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</strong></a> é um portal que oferece uma interface de usuário baseada na web simples e intuitiva. O <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/Stackbill-overview.html#compute\"><strong>Stackbill </strong></a> permite que você</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gerencie recursos de computação</strong> - Acesse e gerencie facilmente suas instâncias virtuais, Balanceador de Carga e Kubernetes.</li>\n<li>Você pode <strong>criar uma rede isolada, VPC, VPN Gateway, grupos de segurança, Gerenciador de IP e muito mais.</strong></li>\n<li>O <strong>Stackbill Marketplace</strong> permite que os usuários <strong>iniciem suas aplicações favoritas em formato pré-construído.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong></strong> Para <strong>Datacenters | Empresas | Provedores de Telecomunicações e Cloud</strong>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Stackbill</strong></a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo de <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Gerenciamento de Nuvem</strong></a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o <strong>Apache CloudStack®</strong> com anos de expertise em tecnologia de ponta.</p>\n<h2>Começando com o Stackbill  <span id=\"Iniciando-com-o-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<p>A página de <strong>cadastro de conta</strong> do <strong>Stackbill </strong> permite que você crie <strong>uma nova conta no Stackbill</strong> se você ainda não tiver uma. O portal de gerenciamento de nuvem do Stackbill permite que você acesse e gerencie seus recursos de nuvem por meio de uma interface de usuário simples e intuitiva baseada na web.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Você pode criar uma conta no Stackbill  seguindo as instruções abaixo.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/d2f19272a54047888dbf2f7ee05f53f5.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Clique na opção <strong>criar uma conta.</strong></li>\n<li>A página de criação de conta aparecerá na tela.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/bf56f2d290b24f0ea6caea3b5a2e352a.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Preencha o formulário com as seguintes informações: <strong>E-mail, País &amp; Código, Número de Celular e Senha.</strong></li>\n<li>Clique no botão <strong>Registrar</strong>.</li>\n<li>O Stackbill enviará um e-mail de boas-vindas para o endereço de e-mail registrado.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/617114c2ef384c29af3276a3f0bcb28f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Para <strong>ativar</strong> sua <strong>conta do Stackbill</strong>, clique no botão <strong>Ativar e Configurar sua Conta</strong> no e-mail de boas-vindas.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/90728e8fba2f45a4bc01f206b349482a.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Insira os <strong>detalhes necessários.</strong></li>\n<li>Clique no botão <strong>Avançar</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/fed454d2a467487699a41ce2d2da9335.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Insira seus detalhes de endereço aqui.</li>\n<li>E clique no botão <strong>Registrar</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ad5e3824a5244919b5ea3e0a9a8a49ab.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Agora a conta foi criada com sucesso.</li>\n<li>Insira seu <strong>endereço de e-mail</strong> e <strong>senha</strong> e clique em Login para explorar o <strong>Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem do Stackbill</strong>.</li>\n<li>Agora você pode explorar o <strong>Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem do Stackbill</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Como Fazer Login no Stackbill  <span id=\"Como-fazer-login-no-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Para acessar o <strong>portal de gerenciamento de nuvem do Stackbill</strong>, digite a URL em seu navegador e pressione Enter.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Geralmente, a URL padrão será <strong>https://seudominio/login</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Depois de acessar a URL, você será solicitado a inserir sua conta de e-mail e senha.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/cb1f750fdf8e469bbd78ed446e9d6fdc.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Forneça suas credenciais correspondentes e clique no botão Login.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>O <strong>portal de gerenciamento de nuvem do Stackbill</strong> permitirá que você faça login assim que suas credenciais de login forem validadas.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Como Recuperar a Senha da Conta Stackbill <span id=\"Como-recuperar-a-senha-da-conta-do-Stackbill\"></span></h2>\n<p>Você pode recuperar sua conta se esquecer sua senha no Stackbill .</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Acesse sua URL do <strong>Stackbill </strong> e clique em <strong>esqueceu a senha.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/f736e69d14b84151af992247fa6824fc.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Forneça o <strong>endereço de e-mail</strong> que você usou para criar sua conta e clique no botão <strong>Enviar E-mail.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/8e804eb496e74a718e57bec77a98e983.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Você receberá um link de redefinição de senha em sua conta de e-mail especificada.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/eda6d819aaa24dcba0ec80aa762bf067.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Ao clicar no link, <strong>uma nova tela de senha será exibida</strong>. Insira a nova senha e clique no botão <strong>&quot;Enviar&quot;</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/a9902518397d4e3993f0cd91c2d10545.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>A senha da conta foi redefinida com sucesso.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre o Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens</a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Bem-vindo à Documentação Stackbill\r\n\r\n[**Stackbill**] é um portal que oferece uma interface de usuário baseada na web simples e intuitiva. O [**Stackbill **](https://localhost:8080/Stackbill-overview.html#compute) permite que você\r\n\r\n- **Gerencie recursos de computação** - Acesse e gerencie facilmente suas instâncias virtuais, Balanceador de Carga e Kubernetes.\r\n- Você pode **criar uma rede isolada, VPC, VPN Gateway, grupos de segurança, Gerenciador de IP e muito mais.**\r\n- O **Stackbill Marketplace** permite que os usuários **iniciem suas aplicações favoritas em formato pré-construído.**\r\n\r\n**** Para **Datacenters | Empresas | Provedores de Telecomunicações e Cloud**.\r\n\r\n[**Stackbill**](https://localhost:8080/) é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo de [**Gerenciamento de Nuvem**](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o **Apache CloudStack®** com anos de expertise em tecnologia de ponta.\r\n\r\n## Começando com o Stackbill  <span id=\"Iniciando-com-o-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\nA página de **cadastro de conta** do **Stackbill ** permite que você crie **uma nova conta no Stackbill** se você ainda não tiver uma. O portal de gerenciamento de nuvem do Stackbill permite que você acesse e gerencie seus recursos de nuvem por meio de uma interface de usuário simples e intuitiva baseada na web.\r\n\r\n- **Você pode criar uma conta no Stackbill  seguindo as instruções abaixo.**\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/d2f19272a54047888dbf2f7ee05f53f5.png\" width=\"70%\" />\r\n\r\n- Clique na opção **criar uma conta.**\r\n- A página de criação de conta aparecerá na tela.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/bf56f2d290b24f0ea6caea3b5a2e352a.png\" width=\"60%\" />\r\n\r\n- Preencha o formulário com as seguintes informações: **E-mail, País & Código, Número de Celular e Senha.**\r\n- Clique no botão **Registrar**.\r\n- O Stackbill enviará um e-mail de boas-vindas para o endereço de e-mail registrado.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/617114c2ef384c29af3276a3f0bcb28f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n- Para **ativar** sua **conta do Stackbill**, clique no botão **Ativar e Configurar sua Conta** no e-mail de boas-vindas.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/90728e8fba2f45a4bc01f206b349482a.png\" width=\"60%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Insira os **detalhes necessários.**\r\n- Clique no botão **Avançar**.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/fed454d2a467487699a41ce2d2da9335.png\" width=\"60%\" />\r\n\r\n- Insira seus detalhes de endereço aqui.\r\n- E clique no botão **Registrar**.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ad5e3824a5244919b5ea3e0a9a8a49ab.png\" width=\"60%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Agora a conta foi criada com sucesso.\r\n- Insira seu **endereço de e-mail** e **senha** e clique em Login para explorar o **Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem do Stackbill**.\r\n- Agora você pode explorar o **Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem do Stackbill**.\r\n\r\n## Como Fazer Login no Stackbill  <span id=\"Como-fazer-login-no-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\n- Para acessar o **portal de gerenciamento de nuvem do Stackbill**, digite a URL em seu navegador e pressione Enter.\r\n\r\n\r\n- Geralmente, a URL padrão será **https://seudominio/login**\r\n\r\n- Depois de acessar a URL, você será solicitado a inserir sua conta de e-mail e senha.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/cb1f750fdf8e469bbd78ed446e9d6fdc.png\" width=\"60%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n- Forneça suas credenciais correspondentes e clique no botão Login.\r\n\r\n- O **portal de gerenciamento de nuvem do Stackbill** permitirá que você faça login assim que suas credenciais de login forem validadas.\r\n\r\n## Como Recuperar a Senha da Conta Stackbill <span id=\"Como-recuperar-a-senha-da-conta-do-Stackbill\"></span>\r\n\r\nVocê pode recuperar sua conta se esquecer sua senha no Stackbill .\r\n\r\n - Acesse sua URL do **Stackbill ** e clique em **esqueceu a senha.**\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/f736e69d14b84151af992247fa6824fc.png\" width=\"60%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n - Forneça o **endereço de e-mail** que você usou para criar sua conta e clique no botão **Enviar E-mail.**\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/8e804eb496e74a718e57bec77a98e983.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- Você receberá um link de redefinição de senha em sua conta de e-mail especificada.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/eda6d819aaa24dcba0ec80aa762bf067.png\" width=\"70%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Ao clicar no link, **uma nova tela de senha será exibida**. Insira a nova senha e clique no botão **\"Enviar\"**.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/a9902518397d4e3993f0cd91c2d10545.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- A senha da conta foi redefinida com sucesso.\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n\r\n**Sobre o Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo [Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.**','\0','Inscrição na conta','guia-de-usuario/começando/inscri-o-na-conta',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',16,'06e523ab-4cae-420d-b2fe-2aefb429be7f',NULL,2,NULL,175,0,'cms_29be7f'),
(46,12,12,2,'2023-09-27 09:44:45','<h1>What is Affinity Group</h1>\n<h3>Affinity group On Stackbill Cloud Management Portal.</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>A positive rule tries to run the virtual machines together on a single host; a negative affinity rule tries to run the virtual machines apart on separate hosts</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Affinity group is a feature that allows users to group the resources together so that we can work together more efficiently. Affinity groups can be used to ensure that resources are located in the same data center or region, which can improve network latency and reduce data transfer costs.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When you create an affinity group, you can specify a geographic location for the group, and then add resources to the group. The resources that are added to the group will be located in the same data center or region as the affinity group. This can be useful for applications that require low latency or high availability, as resources that are located closer together can communicate more quickly and reliably.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# What is Affinity Group\n\n\n### Affinity group On Stackbill Cloud Management Portal.\n\n- **A positive rule tries to run the virtual machines together on a single host; a negative affinity rule tries to run the virtual machines apart on separate hosts**.\n\n- Affinity group is a feature that allows users to group the resources together so that we can work together more efficiently. Affinity groups can be used to ensure that resources are located in the same data center or region, which can improve network latency and reduce data transfer costs.\n\n- When you create an affinity group, you can specify a geographic location for the group, and then add resources to the group. The resources that are added to the group will be located in the same data center or region as the affinity group. This can be useful for applications that require low latency or high availability, as resources that are located closer together can communicate more quickly and reliably.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------\n\n\n**About Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**\n\n\n\n\n\n','\0','What is Affinity Group','user-guide/affinity-group/what-is-affinity-group',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',46,'431fdcf6-49b6-4572-9bf2-cd2a9df39e19',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_f39e19'),
(47,25,12,2,'2023-09-27 09:46:45','<h1>¿Qué es el grupo de afinidad?</h1>\n<h3>Grupo de afinidad en el portal de administración de la nube Stackbill.</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Una regla positiva intenta ejecutar las máquinas virtuales juntas en un único host; una regla de afinidad negativa intenta ejecutar las máquinas virtuales en hosts separados</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>El grupo de afinidad es una función que permite a los usuarios agrupar los recursos para que podamos trabajar juntos de manera más eficiente. Se pueden utilizar grupos de afinidad para garantizar que los recursos estén ubicados en el mismo centro de datos o región, lo que puede mejorar la latencia de la red y reducir los costos de transferencia de datos.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Cuando crea un grupo de afinidad, puede especificar una ubicación geográfica para el grupo y luego agregar recursos al grupo. Los recursos que se agreguen al grupo estarán ubicados en el mismo centro de datos o región que el grupo de afinidad. Esto puede resultar útil para aplicaciones que requieren baja latencia o alta disponibilidad, ya que los recursos que están ubicados más cerca unos de otros pueden comunicarse de manera más rápida y confiable.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de gestión de la nube</a> intuitivo y de autoservicio completo con amplias funciones que aprovechan Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia de última generación.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# ¿Qué es el grupo de afinidad?\n\n\n### Grupo de afinidad en el portal de administración de la nube Stackbill.\n\n- **Una regla positiva intenta ejecutar las máquinas virtuales juntas en un único host; una regla de afinidad negativa intenta ejecutar las máquinas virtuales en hosts separados**.\n\n- El grupo de afinidad es una función que permite a los usuarios agrupar los recursos para que podamos trabajar juntos de manera más eficiente. Se pueden utilizar grupos de afinidad para garantizar que los recursos estén ubicados en el mismo centro de datos o región, lo que puede mejorar la latencia de la red y reducir los costos de transferencia de datos.\n\n- Cuando crea un grupo de afinidad, puede especificar una ubicación geográfica para el grupo y luego agregar recursos al grupo. Los recursos que se agreguen al grupo estarán ubicados en el mismo centro de datos o región que el grupo de afinidad. Esto puede resultar útil para aplicaciones que requieren baja latencia o alta disponibilidad, ya que los recursos que están ubicados más cerca unos de otros pueden comunicarse de manera más rápida y confiable.\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] es un [Portal de gestión de la nube](https://localhost:8080/) intuitivo y de autoservicio completo con amplias funciones que aprovechan Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia de última generación.**','\0','¿Qué es el grupo de afinidad?','guía-del-usuario/grupo-de-afinidad/qu-es-el-grupo-de-afinidad',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',46,'eedcaf82-9d0e-40ed-8afb-9f99e109b302',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_09b302'),
(48,26,12,2,'2023-09-27 09:47:04','<h1>O que é grupo de afinidade</h1>\n<h3>Grupo de afinidade no Stackbill Cloud Management Portal.</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Uma regra positiva tenta rodar as máquinas virtuais juntas em um único host; uma regra de afinidade negativa tenta executar as máquinas virtuais separadamente em hosts separados</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Grupo de afinidade é um recurso que permite aos usuários agrupar os recursos para que possamos trabalhar juntos com mais eficiência. Os grupos de afinidade podem ser usados para garantir que os recursos estejam localizados no mesmo data center ou região, o que pode melhorar a latência da rede e reduzir os custos de transferência de dados.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Ao criar um grupo de afinidades, você pode especificar uma localização geográfica para o grupo e, em seguida, adicionar recursos ao grupo. Os recursos adicionados ao grupo estarão localizados no mesmo data center ou região que o grupo de afinidade. Isso pode ser útil para aplicativos que exigem baixa latência ou alta disponibilidade, pois os recursos localizados mais próximos podem se comunicar de maneira mais rápida e confiável.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de gerenciamento de nuvem</a> completo e intuitivo de autoatendimento com amplos recursos que aproveitam Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência de última geração.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# O que é grupo de afinidade\n\n\n### Grupo de afinidade no Stackbill Cloud Management Portal.\n\n- **Uma regra positiva tenta rodar as máquinas virtuais juntas em um único host; uma regra de afinidade negativa tenta executar as máquinas virtuais separadamente em hosts separados**.\n\n- Grupo de afinidade é um recurso que permite aos usuários agrupar os recursos para que possamos trabalhar juntos com mais eficiência. Os grupos de afinidade podem ser usados para garantir que os recursos estejam localizados no mesmo data center ou região, o que pode melhorar a latência da rede e reduzir os custos de transferência de dados.\n\n- Ao criar um grupo de afinidades, você pode especificar uma localização geográfica para o grupo e, em seguida, adicionar recursos ao grupo. Os recursos adicionados ao grupo estarão localizados no mesmo data center ou região que o grupo de afinidade. Isso pode ser útil para aplicativos que exigem baixa latência ou alta disponibilidade, pois os recursos localizados mais próximos podem se comunicar de maneira mais rápida e confiável.\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Sobre Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] é um [Portal de gerenciamento de nuvem](https://localhost:8080/) completo e intuitivo de autoatendimento com amplos recursos que aproveitam Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência de última geração.**','\0','O que é grupo de afinidade','guia-de-usuario/grupo-de-afinidade/o-que-grupo-de-afinidade',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',46,'6e529e2d-a9cd-41ec-aeb9-3c700ec4a0a1',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_c4a0a1'),
(49,12,12,2,'2023-09-27 09:58:07','<h1>Creating an Affinity Group</h1>\n<p><strong>Affinity group</strong> On <strong><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Stackbill Cloud Management Portal.</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>A positive rule tries to run the virtual machines together on a single host; a negative affinity rule tries to run the virtual machines apart on separate hosts.</strong></p>\n<p>The following guide will help you to <strong>affiniate instances</strong> in the <strong>Stackbill Cloud Management Portal</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The <strong>virtual option</strong> is displayed on the left side menu. To access the submenu, click on it.</li>\n<li>Select the seventh option , which is named as <strong>Affinity group</strong>to affinate the instances.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/6bf937ea217743eeb7c3c25420c967b9.png\" width=\"80%\" /> \n<ul>\n<li>Now the Affinity group option appears on the screen.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/710e0b78b8f148ed9dbac6ba33668431.png\" width=\"90%\" /> \n<ul>\n<li>Click on <strong>Add</strong> button.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/6b74af6e08824a7a97b5d15ceeef3cf6.png\" width=\"50%\" /> \n<ul>\n<li><strong>Name</strong> - Give a <strong>name for the affinity group</strong> you are creating.</li>\n<li><strong>Description</strong> - Short Notes about the affinity group.</li>\n<li><strong>Type</strong> - Here you wants to <strong>select the type of the affinity</strong>.</li>\n<li>Finally click <strong>Ok</strong> button.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/a997176a6f6a4bbeb4efde40ce908d3d.png\" width=\"100%\" /> \n<ul>\n<li>Now the <strong>Affinity group</strong> has been created succesfully.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Creating an Affinity Group\n\n\n**Affinity group** On **[Stackbill Cloud Management Portal.](https://localhost:8080/)**\n\n**A positive rule tries to run the virtual machines together on a single host; a negative affinity rule tries to run the virtual machines apart on separate hosts.**\n\nThe following guide will help you to **affiniate instances** in the **Stackbill Cloud Management Portal**\n\n-  The **virtual option** is displayed on the left side menu. To access the submenu, click on it.\n- Select the seventh option , which is named as **Affinity group**to affinate the instances.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/6bf937ea217743eeb7c3c25420c967b9.png\" width=\"80%\" /> \n\n- Now the Affinity group option appears on the screen.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/710e0b78b8f148ed9dbac6ba33668431.png\" width=\"90%\" /> \n\n- Click on **Add** button.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/6b74af6e08824a7a97b5d15ceeef3cf6.png\" width=\"50%\" /> \n\n- **Name** - Give a **name for the affinity group** you are creating.\n- **Description** - Short Notes about the affinity group.\n- **Type** - Here you wants to **select the type of the affinity**.\n- Finally click **Ok** button.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/a997176a6f6a4bbeb4efde40ce908d3d.png\" width=\"100%\" /> \n\n- Now the **Affinity group** has been created succesfully.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------\n\n\n**About Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**\n\n','\0','Creating an Affinity Group','user-guide/affinity-group/creating-an-affinity-group',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',49,'a5cdb4bd-0abd-4d5b-b9ca-b0456bb11f1f',NULL,2,NULL,175,0,'cms_b11f1f'),
(50,25,12,2,'2023-09-27 09:59:42','<h1>Creando un grupo de afinidad</h1>\n<p><strong>Grupo de afinidad</strong> En <strong><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de administración de la nube de Stackbill.</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Una regla positiva intenta ejecutar las máquinas virtuales juntas en un único host; una regla de afinidad negativa intenta ejecutar las máquinas virtuales en hosts separados.</strong></p>\n<p>La siguiente guía le ayudará a <strong>afiliar instancias</strong> en el <strong>Portal de gestión de la nube de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>La <strong>opción virtual</strong> se muestra en el menú del lado izquierdo. Para acceder al submenú, haga clic en él.</li>\n<li>Seleccione la séptima opción, que se denomina <strong>Grupo de afinidad</strong> para afinar las instancias.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/6bf937ea217743eeb7c3c25420c967b9.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Ahora aparece en pantalla la opción Grupo de afinidad.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/710e0b78b8f148ed9dbac6ba33668431.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Haga clic en el botón <strong>Agregar</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/6b74af6e08824a7a97b5d15ceeef3cf6.png\" width=\"50%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Nombre</strong>: proporcione un <strong>nombre para el grupo de afinidad</strong> que está creando.</li>\n<li><strong>Descripción</strong> - Notas breves sobre el grupo de afinidad.</li>\n<li><strong>Tipo</strong> - Aquí desea <strong>seleccionar el tipo de afinidad</strong>.</li>\n<li>Finalmente haga clic en el botón <strong>Aceptar</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/a997176a6f6a4bbeb4efde40ce908d3d.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Ahora el <strong>grupo de afinidad</strong> se ha creado correctamente.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de gestión de la nube</a> intuitivo y de autoservicio completo con amplias funciones que aprovechan Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia de última generación.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Creando un grupo de afinidad\n\n\n**Grupo de afinidad** En **[Portal de administración de la nube de Stackbill.](https://localhost:8080/)**\n\n**Una regla positiva intenta ejecutar las máquinas virtuales juntas en un único host; una regla de afinidad negativa intenta ejecutar las máquinas virtuales en hosts separados.**\n\nLa siguiente guía le ayudará a **afiliar instancias** en el **Portal de gestión de la nube de Stackbill**\n\n- La **opción virtual** se muestra en el menú del lado izquierdo. Para acceder al submenú, haga clic en él.\n- Seleccione la séptima opción, que se denomina **Grupo de afinidad** para afinar las instancias.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/6bf937ea217743eeb7c3c25420c967b9.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Ahora aparece en pantalla la opción Grupo de afinidad.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/710e0b78b8f148ed9dbac6ba33668431.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Haga clic en el botón **Agregar**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/6b74af6e08824a7a97b5d15ceeef3cf6.png\" width=\"50%\" />\n\n- **Nombre**: proporcione un **nombre para el grupo de afinidad** que está creando.\n- **Descripción** - Notas breves sobre el grupo de afinidad.\n- **Tipo** - Aquí desea **seleccionar el tipo de afinidad**.\n- Finalmente haga clic en el botón **Aceptar**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/a997176a6f6a4bbeb4efde40ce908d3d.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- Ahora el **grupo de afinidad** se ha creado correctamente.\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] es un [Portal de gestión de la nube](https://localhost:8080/) intuitivo y de autoservicio completo con amplias funciones que aprovechan Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia de última generación.**','\0','Creando un grupo de afinidad','guía-del-usuario/grupo-de-afinidad/creando-un-grupo-de-afinidad',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',49,'807bc30b-2f36-4742-9717-c0485975e785',NULL,2,NULL,175,0,'cms_75e785'),
(51,26,12,2,'2023-09-27 10:00:38','<h1>Criando um Grupo de Afinidade</h1>\n<p><strong>Grupo de afinidade</strong> No <strong><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Stackbill Cloud Management Portal.</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Uma regra positiva tenta executar as máquinas virtuais juntas em um único host; uma regra de afinidade negativa tenta executar as máquinas virtuais separadamente em hosts separados.</strong></p>\n<p>O guia a seguir ajudará você a <strong>afiliar instâncias</strong> no <strong>Stackbill Cloud Management Portal</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A <strong>opção virtual</strong> é exibida no menu lateral esquerdo. Para acessar o submenu, clique nele.</li>\n<li>Selecione a sétima opção, que se chama <strong>Grupo de afinidade</strong>para afinar as instâncias.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/6bf937ea217743eeb7c3c25420c967b9.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Agora a opção Grupo de afinidade aparece na tela.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/710e0b78b8f148ed9dbac6ba33668431.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Clique no botão <strong>Adicionar</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/6b74af6e08824a7a97b5d15ceeef3cf6.png\" width=\"50%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Nome</strong> - Dê um <strong>nome para o grupo de afinidade</strong> que você está criando.</li>\n<li><strong>Descrição</strong> - Breves notas sobre o grupo de afinidade.</li>\n<li><strong>Tipo</strong> - Aqui você deseja <strong>selecionar o tipo de afinidade</strong>.</li>\n<li>Por fim, clique no botão <strong>Ok</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/a997176a6f6a4bbeb4efde40ce908d3d.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Agora o <strong>Grupo de afinidade</strong> foi criado com sucesso.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de gerenciamento de nuvem</a> completo e intuitivo de autoatendimento com amplos recursos que aproveitam Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência de última geração.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Criando um Grupo de Afinidade\n\n\n**Grupo de afinidade** No **[Stackbill Cloud Management Portal.](https://localhost:8080/)**\n\n**Uma regra positiva tenta executar as máquinas virtuais juntas em um único host; uma regra de afinidade negativa tenta executar as máquinas virtuais separadamente em hosts separados.**\n\nO guia a seguir ajudará você a **afiliar instâncias** no **Stackbill Cloud Management Portal**\n\n- A **opção virtual** é exibida no menu lateral esquerdo. Para acessar o submenu, clique nele.\n- Selecione a sétima opção, que se chama **Grupo de afinidade**para afinar as instâncias.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/6bf937ea217743eeb7c3c25420c967b9.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Agora a opção Grupo de afinidade aparece na tela.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/710e0b78b8f148ed9dbac6ba33668431.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Clique no botão **Adicionar**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/6b74af6e08824a7a97b5d15ceeef3cf6.png\" width=\"50%\" />\n\n- **Nome** - Dê um **nome para o grupo de afinidade** que você está criando.\n- **Descrição** - Breves notas sobre o grupo de afinidade.\n- **Tipo** - Aqui você deseja **selecionar o tipo de afinidade**.\n- Por fim, clique no botão **Ok**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/a997176a6f6a4bbeb4efde40ce908d3d.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- Agora o **Grupo de afinidade** foi criado com sucesso.\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Sobre Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] é um [Portal de gerenciamento de nuvem](https://localhost:8080/) completo e intuitivo de autoatendimento com amplos recursos que aproveitam Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência de última geração.**','\0','Criando um Grupo de Afinidade','guia-de-usuario/grupo-de-afinidade/criando-um-grupo-de-afinidade',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',49,'7a7be73f-36c9-44ce-9059-fc2f49ddf9fc',NULL,2,NULL,175,0,'cms_ddf9fc'),
(53,46,46,2,'2023-09-27 10:47:25','<h1>Plugins Intro</h1>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/plugins/6313475709a648c8adeeff702d410c25.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<p><strong>The Stackbill </strong> platform offers comprehensive documentation for <strong>all plugins</strong>, conveniently accessible through the <strong>Plugin section.</strong> In addition to its current live version featuring <strong>Kubernetes as a service</strong>, <strong>Stackbill</strong> continues to introduce new plugins in upcoming releases, providing a constantly evolving and expanding set of capabilities. As a result, users can expect frequent updates and enhancements across various categories.</p>\n','',1,'\n# Plugins Intro\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/plugins/6313475709a648c8adeeff702d410c25.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n\n**The Stackbill ** platform offers comprehensive documentation for **all plugins**, conveniently accessible through the **Plugin section.** In addition to its current live version featuring **Kubernetes as a service**, **Stackbill** continues to introduce new plugins in upcoming releases, providing a constantly evolving and expanding set of capabilities. As a result, users can expect frequent updates and enhancements across various categories.','\0','Introduction','plugins/plugins-documentation/introduction',1,4,4,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',53,'a0223b7b-5f0a-488a-9a3b-de3bfed75420',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_d75420'),
(54,1,1,2,'2023-09-27 10:48:24','<h1><strong>Setup Profile</strong></h1>\n<h2>Setting up user profile in Stackbill  <span id=\"setting-up-user-profile-in-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<p><strong>Stackbill </strong>\'s Profile feature allows users to change their password and set up payment settings for their convenience. In addition, users can view their credits, promocodes. The Profile feature in <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Stackbill </strong></a>  provides a comprehensive view of a user\'s account.</p>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/1eb6e2181c124aa88c445b8c8776d568.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Once you enter into the <strong>Stackbill</strong> portal, you will see the <strong>My Profile option</strong>, where you can update your information and upload images.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/e1730f37d0c4464faf31ea237bc7fe6e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>User credit limit</strong> <strong>(a limit that the admin allocates to the user to use the resource)</strong> - in this option, the user can view their admin-allocated credit limit.</li>\n<li>Once every <strong>changes got completed</strong>, click the <strong>Save Changes</strong> button.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Change password for User Account in Stackbill Portal <span id=\"change-password-for-user-account-in-Stackbill-portal\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>To <strong>change your account password</strong>, click on the <strong>Change Password option</strong> located under My Profile.</li>\n<li><strong>Password change</strong> menu apperas on the screen.</li>\n<li>To change your account password, click on the <strong>Change Password</strong> option placed under My Profile.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/6fc407ca8f484624904d421433735059.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Now Change Password menu appears on the screen.</li>\n<li><strong>Enter the Old Password</strong> and then <strong>enter the New Password</strong> and confirm it.</li>\n<li>Then, Click on the Update button.</li>\n<li>Now the <strong>New Password has been updated successfully</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Choose your Payment Method in User Account <span id=\"choose-your-payment-method-in-user-account\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>To <strong>Select your payment</strong>, click on the <strong>Payment setting option</strong> placed under the Change Password option.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/e7faed0425eb448d8be109eabaf8e838.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Payment settings</strong> menu apperas on the screen.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Select the <strong>required payment gateways</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>It is possible to integrate the <strong>user\'s own country\'s payment gateway</strong> into the <strong>Stackbill CloudStack Billing Portal</strong>, but this should be communicated to <strong>Stackbill Admin</strong> beforehand.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::info\n<strong>The Stackbill CloudStack Billing Portal can be customised to accept payments through the user\'s home country\'s payment gateway, however this must first be approved by Stackbill Admin.</strong>\n:::</p>\n<h2>Credits &amp; Promocode for User in Stackbill  <span id=\"credits-&-promocode-for-user-in-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under the <strong>Payment setting option</strong>, click on <strong>Credits &amp; Promo codes</strong> to check your credit limits and offers.</li>\n<li>Now the Credits &amp; Promo code option appears on the screen.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ade282d717ee46ebac092fa0da0f46bd.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Total Credit Limit will display the number of credits available for the user.</li>\n<li>Under the Used Credit Limit, the user can view their used credit limit.</li>\n<li>Balance Available Credit Limit will display the available credit limits.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>API Access Settings in Stackbill  <span id=\"api-access-settings-in-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under the <strong>Credit &amp; Promocode</strong>, click on <strong>Request API Access option</strong> to access API setting.</li>\n<li>Now <strong>API Access</strong> option appears on the screen.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/41e03efb5cc8460799a4ee25cd2b508f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Stackbill API</strong> allows you to <strong>manage</strong> your <strong>Instances</strong> and <strong>other resources</strong> programmatically using <strong>conventional HTTP request</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Stackbill\'s API</strong> allows you to perform any action you can perform through the Control Panel (except creating personal access tokens).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Notification Settings in Stackbill  <span id=\"notification-settings-in-theCloud-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under the <strong>Manage API Access</strong>, click on <strong>Notification Settings</strong> option to set notification alerts.</li>\n<li>Now <strong>Notification Settings</strong> option appears on the screen.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/778f5afdbd3b42cea34896b4eb92c71f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Maintenance and outage notification</strong> - To receive notifications about outages and maintenance, the user can enable the Outage and maintenance notification option.</li>\n<li><strong>Invoice prefrence</strong> - When the invoice reminder option is enabled, the user will receive a notification about the bill payment three days before the end of the month.</li>\n<li><strong>Payments Overdue</strong> - By enabling the Payment Overdue option, users can receive notifications regarding overdue payments.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>The process of removing an account from the Stackbill  <span id=\"the-process-of-removing-an-account-from-the-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under the <strong>Notification settings</strong>, click on <strong>Access Delete Request</strong> option to delete account from the portal.</li>\n<li>Now Account delete request screen appears.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/846b439bce90420d84b5938db4222ccb.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Kindly follow the procedure to <strong>delete your account</strong> from <strong>Stackbill.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# **Setup Profile**\r\n\r\n## Setting up user profile in Stackbill  <span id=\"setting-up-user-profile-in-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\n**Stackbill **\'s Profile feature allows users to change their password and set up payment settings for their convenience. In addition, users can view their credits, promocodes. The Profile feature in [**Stackbill **](https://localhost:8080/)  provides a comprehensive view of a user\'s account.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/1eb6e2181c124aa88c445b8c8776d568.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n \r\n- Once you enter into the **Stackbill** portal, you will see the **My Profile option**, where you can update your information and upload images.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/e1730f37d0c4464faf31ea237bc7fe6e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n- **User credit limit** **(a limit that the admin allocates to the user to use the resource)** - in this option, the user can view their admin-allocated credit limit.\r\n- Once every **changes got completed**, click the **Save Changes** button.\r\n\r\n## Change password for User Account in Stackbill Portal <span id=\"change-password-for-user-account-in-Stackbill-portal\"></span>\r\n\r\n- To **change your account password**, click on the **Change Password option** located under My Profile.\r\n- **Password change** menu apperas on the screen.\r\n- To change your account password, click on the **Change Password** option placed under My Profile.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/6fc407ca8f484624904d421433735059.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- Now Change Password menu appears on the screen.\r\n- **Enter the Old Password** and then **enter the New Password** and confirm it.\r\n- Then, Click on the Update button.\r\n- Now the **New Password has been updated successfully**.\r\n\r\n## Choose your Payment Method in User Account <span id=\"choose-your-payment-method-in-user-account\"></span>\r\n\r\n- To **Select your payment**, click on the **Payment setting option** placed under the Change Password option.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/e7faed0425eb448d8be109eabaf8e838.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Payment settings** menu apperas on the screen.\r\n- Select the **required payment gateways**\r\n\r\n- It is possible to integrate the **user\'s own country\'s payment gateway** into the **Stackbill CloudStack Billing Portal**, but this should be communicated to **Stackbill Admin** beforehand.\r\n\r\n:::info\r\n**The Stackbill CloudStack Billing Portal can be customised to accept payments through the user\'s home country\'s payment gateway, however this must first be approved by Stackbill Admin.**\r\n:::\r\n\r\n## Credits & Promocode for User in Stackbill  <span id=\"credits-&-promocode-for-user-in-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\n- Under the **Payment setting option**, click on **Credits & Promo codes** to check your credit limits and offers.\r\n- Now the Credits & Promo code option appears on the screen.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ade282d717ee46ebac092fa0da0f46bd.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- Total Credit Limit will display the number of credits available for the user.\r\n- Under the Used Credit Limit, the user can view their used credit limit.\r\n- Balance Available Credit Limit will display the available credit limits.\r\n\r\n## API Access Settings in Stackbill  <span id=\"api-access-settings-in-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\n- Under the **Credit & Promocode**, click on **Request API Access option** to access API setting.\r\n- Now **API Access** option appears on the screen.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/41e03efb5cc8460799a4ee25cd2b508f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Stackbill API** allows you to **manage** your **Instances** and **other resources** programmatically using **conventional HTTP request**.\r\n- **Stackbill\'s API** allows you to perform any action you can perform through the Control Panel (except creating personal access tokens).\r\n\r\n## Notification Settings in Stackbill  <span id=\"notification-settings-in-theCloud-\"></span>\r\n\r\n- Under the **Manage API Access**, click on **Notification Settings** option to set notification alerts.\r\n- Now **Notification Settings** option appears on the screen.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/778f5afdbd3b42cea34896b4eb92c71f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Maintenance and outage notification** - To receive notifications about outages and maintenance, the user can enable the Outage and maintenance notification option.\r\n- **Invoice prefrence** - When the invoice reminder option is enabled, the user will receive a notification about the bill payment three days before the end of the month.\r\n- **Payments Overdue** - By enabling the Payment Overdue option, users can receive notifications regarding overdue payments.\r\n\r\n## The process of removing an account from the Stackbill  <span id=\"the-process-of-removing-an-account-from-the-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\n- Under the **Notification settings**, click on **Access Delete Request** option to delete account from the portal.\r\n- Now Account delete request screen appears.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/846b439bce90420d84b5938db4222ccb.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- Kindly follow the procedure to **delete your account** from **Stackbill.**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**About Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**','\0','Setup Profile','user-guide/getting-started/setup-profile',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',54,'6e92720c-5ac0-47e2-ac27-f22fdbc4eb6c',NULL,3,NULL,175,0,'cms_c4eb6c'),
(55,47,46,2,'2023-09-27 10:55:13','<h1>Introducción a los complementos</h1>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/plugins/6313475709a648c8adeeff702d410c25.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<p><strong>La plataforma Stackbill </strong> ofrece documentación completa para <strong>todos los complementos</strong>, a la que se puede acceder cómodamente a través de la <strong>sección Complementos.</strong> Además de su versión actual que incluye <strong>Kubernetes como servicio</strong>, **Stackbill ** continúa introduciendo nuevos complementos en próximas versiones, proporcionando un conjunto de capacidades en constante evolución y expansión. Como resultado, los usuarios pueden esperar actualizaciones y mejoras frecuentes en varias categorías.</p>\n','',2,'#  Introducción a los complementos\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/plugins/6313475709a648c8adeeff702d410c25.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n\n**La plataforma Stackbill ** ofrece documentación completa para **todos los complementos**, a la que se puede acceder cómodamente a través de la **sección Complementos.** Además de su versión actual que incluye **Kubernetes como servicio**, **Stackbill ** continúa introduciendo nuevos complementos en próximas versiones, proporcionando un conjunto de capacidades en constante evolución y expansión. Como resultado, los usuarios pueden esperar actualizaciones y mejoras frecuentes en varias categorías.','\0','Introducción a los complementos','complementos/documentación-de-complementos/introducci-n-a-los-complementos',1,5,4,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',53,'4ea40bcd-26e0-4811-8db1-6e6b0578e460',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_78e460'),
(56,4,4,2,'2023-09-27 10:55:31','<h2>Network Administrator in Stackbill  <span id=\"Network-Manager-in-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Stackbill</strong></a> provides private networks, traffic filtering, and load balancing to help you protect and control the traffic of your applications.</p>\n  <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/961f0c3ab2dd40dc9e95ad62b82644fe.png\">\n<p><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Stackbill</strong></a> provides private networks, traffic filtering, and load balancing to help you protect and control the traffic of your applications.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>There are two types of networks available in <strong>Stackbill </strong>: <strong>L2 network</strong> and <strong>Isolated network</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>L2 Network in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal <span id=\"l2-network-on-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the <strong>Network</strong> dropdown below the virtual resources icon, available in the top left corner. From the dropdown, click on <strong>Basic Network</strong> to create a new network.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/e1e10e6d5cae4712a641f1d45421402e.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <strong>Basic Network</strong> screen appears.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>On the right side of the panel, the user can see an option called <strong>ADD NETWORK</strong>, click on it.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/dd9ea413089c42b09ca8d421e2970cbf.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Then, once you click on the Add Network button, select the type of network required according to your needs.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::info\n<strong>The following document shows the flow of L2 Network.</strong>\n:::</p>\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/ee2935d5b42e47ebb29a6a5f37c2b5a5.png\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Name</strong>: Specify a <strong>name</strong> for the network.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Network Offering</strong> - Select the <strong>Network Offering</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Attach Network to Instance</strong>: The user can <strong>attach the network</strong> to their <strong>required instance</strong> using this option.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Finally, click on the <strong>Create</strong> button.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/ff90a5241b3e43e08e5a1042ab520a36.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Now the <strong>L2 Network</strong> has been successfully created.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Creating an Isolated Network in Stackbill  <span id=\"Creating-Isolated-Network-in-Stackbill-\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>An isolated network can only be accessed</strong> through virtual machines from a single account.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the <strong>Network</strong> dropdown below the virtual resources icon, available in the top left corner. From the dropdown, click on <strong>Basic Network</strong> to create a new network.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/e1e10e6d5cae4712a641f1d45421402e.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <strong>Basic Network</strong> screen appears.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>On the right side of the panel, the user can see an option called <strong>ADD NETWORK</strong>, click on it.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/195c66bdfb3c43b49dbefa18c0a37c13.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Once you click on the <strong>Add Network</strong> button, select the option <strong>Isolated Network</strong> to create an <strong>isolated network</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::info\n<strong>The following document shows the flow of Isolated Network.</strong>\n:::</p>\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/ee2935d5b42e47ebb29a6a5f37c2b5a5.png\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Name</strong>: Specify a <strong>name</strong> for the network.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Network Offering</strong> - Select the <strong>Network Offering</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Attach Network to Instance</strong>: The user can <strong>attach the network</strong> to their <strong>required instance</strong> using this option.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Finally, click on the <strong>Create</strong> button.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/ff90a5241b3e43e08e5a1042ab520a36.png\">\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::success</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Now the <strong>Isolated Network</strong> has been successfully created.\n:::</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Adding Network to Instance in Stackbill  <span id=\"Adding-Network-to-Instance-in-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/f28eba50cee64207a350846cb8eeade7.png\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the <strong>Virtual Resources</strong> dropdown below the panel icon, available in the top left corner. From the dropdown, click on the <strong>Instance</strong> option.</p>\n<img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/3b063f9d1143418cbc9ad9baaac7b13b.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The instance screen appears.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the specific instance.</p>\n<img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/dc2f1b77dee14859b50286566ad9522c.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Now the instance summary page appears. Select the <strong>Network and Firewall</strong> option in the summary.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The Network and Firewall option appears.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>On the right side of the panel, click on <strong>Add Network to VM</strong>.</p>\n<img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/4f00410b844d41ed9ab17fe3adc76b42.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Select the Network and click on the <strong>Add</strong> button.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>IMG</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Now the virtual machine is successfully connected to the network.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Adding Security Groups in Stackbill  <span id=\"Adding-Security-Groups-in-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/356906f0b2dc416cb1b5d8dead973820.png\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the <strong>Network</strong> dropdown below the calculation icon, available in the top left corner. From the dropdown, click on the <strong>Security Groups</strong> option.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/5e1fa416a8c54c37bd4eafebda4f6cb8.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <strong>Security Group</strong> option appears on the screen.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>On the right side of the panel, the user can see an option called <strong>Add</strong>. Click on it to <strong>create new security groups</strong>.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/d3948eeff1664982afea92ba65a9d63d.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Name</strong>: Specify a <strong>name</strong> for the security group being created.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Description</strong> - Provide brief notes about the security group.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Status</strong>: Specify the IP version.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Finally, click on the <strong>Add</strong> button.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/35665f9b0b4b45718b82e202e530eb41.png\">\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::success\n<strong>- Now the security group has been created successfully.</strong>\n:::</p>\n<h3>What is Network Address Translation (NAT)? <span id=\"What-is-Network-Address-Translation\"></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>NAT</strong> stands for <strong>Network Address Translation</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>It will translate a set of IP addresses to another set of IP addresses.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>In other words, as explained by Wikipedia, &quot;<strong>Network Address Translation is a method of mapping an IP address space into another by modifying network address information in the IP header of packets while they are in transit across a traffic routing device</strong>.&quot;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>In <strong>Stackbill </strong>, there are two types of NAT available. They are: <strong>Source NAT</strong> and <strong>Static NAT</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Source NAT</strong> - It will be used as shared NAT, meaning, using this Source NAT IP, we will be able to access multiple virtual machines.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Static NAT</strong> - It will be the dedicated NAT. In other words, this NAT IP will be connected to a single virtual machine. It\'s like a one-to-one communication.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Configuring Port Forwarding  <span id=\"creating-egress-rule-on-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Port Forwarding</strong> allows a computer over the Internet to connect to a specific computer (or) service within a private network.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A port number will have an IP address, and based on the port number, it will determine what the purpose is.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the <strong>Network</strong> dropdown below the virtual resources icon, available in the top left corner. From the dropdown, click on <strong>Basic Network</strong>, <strong>to configure port forwarding</strong>.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/7d99bf3a45634b4da7391297dc3c4f75.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <strong>Basic Network</strong> screen appears.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the <strong>network</strong> you want to configure port forwarding for.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/7c41b40316bb421a94bc5defcfecb1e8.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The network details screen appears. Select the <strong>Public IP</strong> section on the details screen.</p>\n<img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/577951fbdd6b4da4aa385fff08e990f6.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the <strong>NAT Source</strong> option.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/4cefe1fbcd85459ba5fb2eadc132e701.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>IP address screen opens.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Before setting up port forwarding, the user must set up the firewall.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>To configure the Firewall, click on the <strong>Firewall</strong> option and set it up.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/1e753b66def94b0fa76848534f8ef4a6.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Once the firewall is configured, go to the <strong>Port Forwarding</strong> option.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Click on <strong>Add VM</strong>.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/e22e6e24effc4d3bb7bd21f5b7be17cb.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Configure the required port and select the protocol.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Finally, click on <strong>Add VM and Configure</strong>.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/b53d640853a54f8a89562cffe8ed5573.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Now the port forwarding has been configured successfully.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Creating an Egress Rule in Stackbill  <span id=\"Creating-Egress-Rule-on-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>The <strong>egress rule</strong> will be used to allow your virtual instance to access the external network, i.e., the <strong>Internet</strong>.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/b2db66fcabef4afc85e7a9d5dac89df6.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the <strong>specific security group where the egress rule should be created</strong>.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/c233282b9175418bb33307911ef53a18.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Now the egress rule creation menu appears.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The user can see an option called <strong>Add Rule</strong> on the right side of the panel.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Click on that.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/6ba08e07ed9141578e8553bac40b0859.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Select the <strong>protocol</strong> according to your preference.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Specify the <strong>starting and ending port number.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Finally, click on the <strong>Add Rule</strong> button.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/d584b7fc141c440394f4ed589c0a4681.png\">\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::success</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The egress rule has now been successfully created.\n:::</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>IP Manager Overview in Stackbill  <span id=\"ip-manager-overview-on-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<p><strong>An IP address in Stackbill </strong> is a static <strong>publicly accessible IP address</strong> that you can assign to an <strong>instance</strong> and later <strong>reassign</strong> to <strong>another instance</strong>. To create a high availability infrastructure, you can implement a failover mechanism using reserved IP addresses.</p>\n<h2>Obtaining a New Public IP Address</h2>\n<img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/4c1d542f863444439e234f91a2afad7b.png\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the <strong>Network</strong> dropdown below the calculation icon, available in the top left corner. From the dropdown, click on the <strong>IP Manager</strong> option.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/6d3dc841b9df4947b59617cada724e36.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <strong>IP Manager</strong> screen appears.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the option <strong>Acquire new public IP</strong>.</p>\n<img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/278c989941d1414d876a73660e523287.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><em>Choose Your Network</em> - To acquire a public IP address, choose the network.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::note\n<em>Load balancing and port forwarding functions can be enabled by disabling Static NAT while acquiring a new public IP address.</em>\n:::\n<img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/db41f4ab420d4904949e35f9f64f9267.png\"></p>\n<p>:::note\n<em>Load balancing and port forwarding functions can be disabled by enabling Static NAT while acquiring a new public IP address.</em>\n:::</p>\n<ul>\n<li>To confirm the acquisition of the new IP address, click on the checkbox.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::note\n<em>- The administrator charges a fee for acquiring a new IP address.</em>\n:::</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Finally, click on the <em>Acquire</em> button.</p>\n<img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/b1600fda1c8c40eaa0e8ce2df65d6087.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Now the <em>IP address</em> has been successfully created.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Releasing Public IP Address</h2>\n<img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/dae0db59c00f43f6a034616e103540ac.png\">\n<p>:::note\n<em>Load balancing and port forwarding functions can be disabled by enabling Static NAT while acquiring a new public IP address.</em>\n:::</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>To release a public IP, click on the <em>release icon</em> available in the <em>Action menu</em>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You will receive a confirmation notification in the portal once you click on it.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/6452ae7f8ad848c5b427f10446722e30.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>To release the IP address, click on Accept.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/eb43eee245d04d788e5a4c64724a37ef.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Now your <em>IP</em> has been <em>successfully removed</em>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Virtual Private Cloud <span id=\"vpc-virtual-private-cloud-in-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<p><em>INTRODUCTION</em></p>\n<p>VPC (Virtual Private Cloud) is a network feature in the cloud control panel that allows users to create isolated and logically defined private cloud environments within a public cloud infrastructure. VPC enables users to have full control over their network topology and allows them to configure a private network space with multiple levels of virtual machines, routers, firewalls, and load balancers.</p>\n<p><em>VPC FEATURES</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Isolated Network Environment: VPC allows users to create an isolated network environment with its own private IP address space. This isolation provides increased security and separation from other VPCs and the public cloud.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Multiple Levels: Within a VPC, users can create multiple levels or subnets to efficiently organize their network infrastructure. Each level can have its own set of virtual machines and network services such as routers, load balancers, and firewalls.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Virtual Router: The VPC uses a virtual router to provide essential routing capabilities between different levels within the VPC and also between the VPC and the external network (public cloud or Internet). The virtual router handles network traffic and ensures that packets are correctly forwarded to their destination.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Network ACLs and Security Groups: VPC allows users to define Network Access Control Lists (ACLs) and security groups to control incoming and outgoing network traffic to and from the virtual machines in the VPC. This helps improve security and access control to VPC resources.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>VPN Connectivity: VPC supports the creation of Virtual Private Network (VPN) connections, allowing users to establish secure communication between their on-premises infrastructure and the VPC in the public cloud. This feature enables hybrid cloud scenarios and facilitates secure data transfer.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Load Balancing: Users can configure load balancers within the VPC to distribute incoming traffic among multiple virtual machines at a level. This ensures high availability and scalability for applications running within the VPC.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Network Offering: VPC offers multiple network offerings that define the specifications and capabilities of the VPC, such as the number of subnets, IP address ranges, and supported services. Users can select the appropriate network offering based on their requirements.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Elastic IP Addresses: VPC provides Elastic IP (EIP) addresses that can be associated with virtual machines to allow them to have a static and public IP address. This enables the virtual machines to be accessed from the Internet without changing their IP addresses.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>STEPS TO CREATE A VIRTUAL PRIVATE CLOUD</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Log in to your control panel.</li>\n<li>Go to Network and click on VPC.</li>\n</ul>\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/7a8a7e384a884acb9b977cf08af336cc.jpg\">\n- Then click on Add VPC.\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/87834a874c8b47d886a4770488d04362.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Provide the name, description, and specify the IP address range for the VPC in CIDR notation (e.g., 10.0.0.0/16). This range should not overlap with other networks in your Stackbill environment. Also, choose the appropriate VPC offering that defines the specifications and capabilities of the VPC. Then click on the Add button.\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/34a2b109586b4fcbaebba1b17bb810f8.jpg\" alt=\"VPC Configuration\" /></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>VPC created successfully.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n  <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/3560b9da11234ec6bbe1d4dc9a825250.jpg\">\n<p><em>ADD YOUR VPC LEVEL NETWORK</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>After creating your VPC network, click on the configure button.</li>\n</ul>\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/69a1f86064ae4b26bc13988b52e3dd1d.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>Then click on create network.</li>\n</ul>\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/a6005c5e9256470f873c2413a2f3a552.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>Specify the name of your level (e.g., &quot;DMZ&quot;, &quot;Application&quot;, etc.)</li>\n<li>Select the appropriate ACL to allow or deny access to your network.</li>\n<li>Then provide the gateway, netmask, select the network offering for your level, and click on the Add button.</li>\n</ul>\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/050e8a0d325d4afbaebcf8875f0b3533.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>Your new level network has been created successfully.</li>\n</ul>\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/03fc61ed5c464011b38bd51bba6bc90d.jpg\">\n<p><em>ADDING VIRTUAL MACHINES</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>To create a new virtual machine, click on the virtual machines link.</li>\n<li>Then click on Add instance.</li>\n<li><em><a href=\"/docs/virtualresources/Instance#quick-deploy-in-Stackbill-\">Steps to create an instance</a></em></li>\n</ul>\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/ad27adfc14a642cd9d92c90f28aca144.jpg\">\n  - When creating the VM, make sure to have selected your VPC level from the network list.\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/9e2d6a7c9fe84342a5ec0abbae1fc634.jpg\">\n<p><em>CONFIGURING VPC TO VPC VPN IN THECLOUD</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>To explain VPC to VPC VPN, refer to the image below for demonstration.</li>\n</ul>\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/4b3448ce085e42d684cdf6d63a569c51.jpg\">\n<p><em>VPN Gateway</em>: The VPN gateway is the term used for the local VPN endpoint. This is simply enabled on the NAT source IP address of the VPC virtual router and allows the local VR to accept incoming VPN connections.</p>\n<p><em>VPN Client Gateway</em>: The VPN client gateway is the remote endpoint that we target when setting up the VPN connection. When setting these up, we must specify all details for this VPN connection.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Name: user-friendly name for the gateway</li>\n<li>Gateway: public IP address of the remote VPC virtual router.</li>\n<li>CIDR List: this is a list of CIDR networks that can be reached at the remote end of the tunnel. Multiple CIDR ranges can be specified, separated by commas.</li>\n<li>Pre-Shared IPsec Key: this is effectively the VPN password phrase used when negotiating the VPN connection and as such should follow standard password best practices in a production environment.</li>\n<li>IKE/ESP encryption details for the VPN tunnels.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>VPN Connection</em></p>\n<p>The VPN connection is the pairing from the originating (or local) VPN gateway to the remote VPN client gateway. This is configured in one of two modes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Active: the connection that initiates the VPN tunnel, typically from the VPC hosting the virtual machines consuming resources in the remote VPC.</li>\n<li>Passive: this connection waits for the opposite VPC VR to initiate the connection and is typically in the VPC hosting the resources to be consumed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Note that for both connections, resources at both ends must be reachable via the CIDR list configured for the VPN client gateway.</p>\n<p><em>STEPS TO CREATE A VPN GATEWAY</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Log in to the cloud control panel.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Then click on Network and select VPN Gateway.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/912c3c0017a54eab9381d635e56e4456.jpg\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Then click on the ADD VPN button.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/c6d15c53c0fc4307907f0534463730ec.jpg\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>In this example, we assume that the virtual machines from VPC1 Level 1 and 2 will consume resources in VPC2. Note that in this case, we only configure the name, public gateway, CIDR list, and pre-shared IPsec key; all other fields are left as default.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/a4a51103d31247caae8d068496de737e.jpg\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Repeat this step for the client gateway in VPC2:</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/1dae39a6d3f94557933c97ba4fdcd89f.jpg\">\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Enabling Site-to-Site VPN</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Log in to your cloud control panel.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Then click on the VPC menu.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the corresponding VPC from the list.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Then click on configure.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the Site-to-Site VPN list menu.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/09a4342f55d34889993abea4ee03edff.jpg\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Click Accept to confirm the creation.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/debbf11e601c4cd0b38c536e03d90501.jpg\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Once the Site-to-Site VPN is enabled, click on the VPN Connection tab. Click on the Add button.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/c3861c8511c7400687dea9fa514c8262.jpg\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Then select the VPN Gateway from the dropdown list and click Accept.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/4907cd5aa90044978e168b59c41445a3.jpg\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Repeat this step for the passive connection from VPC2 to VPC1, but for this one, check the &quot;passive&quot; checkbox.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Once both VPN connections are configured, refresh the screen and ensure that the VPN Connection status is &quot;connected&quot;.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If the VPN connection does not appear automatically, simply go back to the active connection (from VPC1 to VPC2) and click the &quot;Reset&quot; button.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/ba05897ff41d407783980e087d5e8ad4.jpg\">\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Overview of Load Balancer in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal<span id=\"load-balancer-overview-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<p>A <em>load balancer</em> can be deployed as <em>software or hardware</em> on a device that <em>distributes client connections</em> among a set of servers. A load balancer acts as a &quot;<strong>reverse proxy</strong>&quot; to represent the application servers to the client through a virtual IP address (VIP). This technology is known as <em>Server Load Balancing (SLB)</em>. SLB is designed for groups of application servers within a single site or local area network (LAN).</p>\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/df028ef5b2d144798681b71edf7b57c3.png\">\n<h3>Add a load balancer to an instance in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal<span id=\"add-a-load-balancer-to-an-instance-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Click on the <em>Network</em> dropdown button below the <em>Compute icon</em>, which is available in the top-left corner. In the dropdown menu, click on <em>Load Balancer</em> to create a new Load Balancer.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <em>Load Balancer</em> screen appears.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/dae82a39ffb743eaa431d755494e4fe9.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>On the right side of the panel, you can see an option called <em>Create Load Balancer</em>, click on it.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/2405d1922c934a4da76bddd8f035e6b3.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The option to <em>Add Load Balancer</em> appears on the screen.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/adefaa514c384a36893d5757634c9a4f.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>As a first step, enter a <em>name and description</em> for the load balancer you create.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/9a24fc742d8040bbb00be5c367652eaf.png\">\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Network and IP Address</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Here you select the network and IP address for the Load Balancer.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><em>Create Forwarding Policy and Algorithm</em></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><em>Policy Name</em>: provide a policy name.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Select the protocol and assign a port number for both the load balancer and the instance.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/0d947126e9ac47fdb338f55ab5e20b79.png\">\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Choose Algorithm and Sticky Sessions</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Choose your Load Balancer algorithm for traffic distribution.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Select the sticky session as per requirement.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/21f23239a893482eabbc1acd1c1950e8.png\">\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Attach Instance</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Attach the policy to the required instance and click the <em>Save Policy</em> button below.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/be0a859da301480db5449bb9c8dc42cb.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Now the <em>Load Balancer Policy</em> has been created successfully.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Once the policy is created successfully, click on the <em>Create Load Balancer</em> button available below.</p>\n <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/6cd0b4d309244882a3b925d2d9640c53.png\">\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <em>load balancer is successfully configured on the instance.</em></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Now you can see the created policy in the Load Balancer panel.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p>About The Cloud</p>\n<p>Stackbill is an intuitive and full-featured self-service cloud management portal with extensive capabilities leveraging Apache CloudStack® and years of cutting-edge technology experience.</p>\n','',1,'## Network Administrator in Stackbill  <span id=\"Network-Manager-in-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n[**Stackbill**](https://localhost:8080/) provides private networks, traffic filtering, and load balancing to help you protect and control the traffic of your applications.\n\n  <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/961f0c3ab2dd40dc9e95ad62b82644fe.png\">\n\n[**Stackbill**](https://localhost:8080/) provides private networks, traffic filtering, and load balancing to help you protect and control the traffic of your applications.\n\n- There are two types of networks available in **Stackbill **: **L2 network** and **Isolated network**.\n\n### L2 Network in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal <span id=\"l2-network-on-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n- Click on the **Network** dropdown below the virtual resources icon, available in the top left corner. From the dropdown, click on **Basic Network** to create a new network.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/e1e10e6d5cae4712a641f1d45421402e.png\">\n\n- The **Basic Network** screen appears.\n- On the right side of the panel, the user can see an option called **ADD NETWORK**, click on it.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/dd9ea413089c42b09ca8d421e2970cbf.png\">\n\n- Then, once you click on the Add Network button, select the type of network required according to your needs.\n\n:::info\n   **The following document shows the flow of L2 Network.**\n:::\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/ee2935d5b42e47ebb29a6a5f37c2b5a5.png\">\n\n- **Name**: Specify a **name** for the network.\n- **Network Offering** - Select the **Network Offering**.\n- **Attach Network to Instance**: The user can **attach the network** to their **required instance** using this option.\n- Finally, click on the **Create** button.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/ff90a5241b3e43e08e5a1042ab520a36.png\">\n\n- Now the **L2 Network** has been successfully created.\n\n### Creating an Isolated Network in Stackbill  <span id=\"Creating-Isolated-Network-in-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n**An isolated network can only be accessed** through virtual machines from a single account.\n\n- Click on the **Network** dropdown below the virtual resources icon, available in the top left corner. From the dropdown, click on **Basic Network** to create a new network.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/e1e10e6d5cae4712a641f1d45421402e.png\">\n\n- The **Basic Network** screen appears.\n- On the right side of the panel, the user can see an option called **ADD NETWORK**, click on it.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/195c66bdfb3c43b49dbefa18c0a37c13.png\">\n\n- Once you click on the **Add Network** button, select the option **Isolated Network** to create an **isolated network**.\n\n:::info\n   **The following document shows the flow of Isolated Network.**\n:::\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/ee2935d5b42e47ebb29a6a5f37c2b5a5.png\">\n\n- **Name**: Specify a **name** for the network.\n- **Network Offering** - Select the **Network Offering**.\n- **Attach Network to Instance**: The user can **attach the network** to their **required instance** using this option.\n- Finally, click on the **Create** button.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/ff90a5241b3e43e08e5a1042ab520a36.png\">\n\n:::success\n- Now the **Isolated Network** has been successfully created.\n:::\n\n## Adding Network to Instance in Stackbill  <span id=\"Adding-Network-to-Instance-in-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/virtualresources/f28eba50cee64207a350846cb8eeade7.png\">\n\n- Click on the **Virtual Resources** dropdown below the panel icon, available in the top left corner. From the dropdown, click on the **Instance** option.\n\n  <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/3b063f9d1143418cbc9ad9baaac7b13b.png\">\n\n- The instance screen appears.\n- Click on the specific instance.\n\n  <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/dc2f1b77dee14859b50286566ad9522c.png\">\n\n- Now the instance summary page appears. Select the **Network and Firewall** option in the summary.\n- The Network and Firewall option appears.\n- On the right side of the panel, click on **Add Network to VM**.\n\n  <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Network/4f00410b844d41ed9ab17fe3adc76b42.png\">\n\n- Select the Network and click on the **Add** button.\n\n\n**IMG**\n\n- Now the virtual machine is successfully connected to the network.\n\n## Adding Security Groups in Stackbill  <span id=\"Adding-Security-Groups-in-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/356906f0b2dc416cb1b5d8dead973820.png\">\n\n- Click on the **Network** dropdown below the calculation icon, available in the top left corner. From the dropdown, click on the **Security Groups** option.\n\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/5e1fa416a8c54c37bd4eafebda4f6cb8.png\">\n\n- The **Security Group** option appears on the screen.\n- On the right side of the panel, the user can see an option called **Add**. Click on it to **create new security groups**.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/d3948eeff1664982afea92ba65a9d63d.png\">\n\n- **Name**: Specify a **name** for the security group being created.\n- **Description** - Provide brief notes about the security group.\n- **Status**: Specify the IP version.\n- Finally, click on the **Add** button.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/35665f9b0b4b45718b82e202e530eb41.png\">\n\n:::success\n**- Now the security group has been created successfully.**\n:::\n\n### What is Network Address Translation (NAT)? <span id=\"What-is-Network-Address-Translation\"></span>\n\n- **NAT** stands for **Network Address Translation**.\n\n- It will translate a set of IP addresses to another set of IP addresses.\n\n- In other words, as explained by Wikipedia, \"**Network Address Translation is a method of mapping an IP address space into another by modifying network address information in the IP header of packets while they are in transit across a traffic routing device**.\"\n\n- In **Stackbill **, there are two types of NAT available. They are: **Source NAT** and **Static NAT**.\n\n- **Source NAT** - It will be used as shared NAT, meaning, using this Source NAT IP, we will be able to access multiple virtual machines.\n\n- **Static NAT** - It will be the dedicated NAT. In other words, this NAT IP will be connected to a single virtual machine. It\'s like a one-to-one communication.\n\n## Configuring Port Forwarding  <span id=\"creating-egress-rule-on-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n- **Port Forwarding** allows a computer over the Internet to connect to a specific computer (or) service within a private network.\n\n- A port number will have an IP address, and based on the port number, it will determine what the purpose is.\n\n- Click on the **Network** dropdown below the virtual resources icon, available in the top left corner. From the dropdown, click on **Basic Network**, **to configure port forwarding**.\n\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/7d99bf3a45634b4da7391297dc3c4f75.png\">\n\n- The **Basic Network** screen appears.\n- Click on the **network** you want to configure port forwarding for.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/7c41b40316bb421a94bc5defcfecb1e8.png\">\n\n- The network details screen appears. Select the **Public IP** section on the details screen.\n\n\n  <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/577951fbdd6b4da4aa385fff08e990f6.png\">\n\n- Click on the **NAT Source** option.\n\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/4cefe1fbcd85459ba5fb2eadc132e701.png\">\n\n- IP address screen opens.\n- Before setting up port forwarding, the user must set up the firewall.\n- To configure the Firewall, click on the **Firewall** option and set it up.\n\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/1e753b66def94b0fa76848534f8ef4a6.png\">\n\n- Once the firewall is configured, go to the **Port Forwarding** option.\n- Click on **Add VM**.\n\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/e22e6e24effc4d3bb7bd21f5b7be17cb.png\">\n\n- Configure the required port and select the protocol.\n- Finally, click on **Add VM and Configure**.\n\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/b53d640853a54f8a89562cffe8ed5573.png\">\n  \n- Now the port forwarding has been configured successfully.\n## Creating an Egress Rule in Stackbill  <span id=\"Creating-Egress-Rule-on-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n- The **egress rule** will be used to allow your virtual instance to access the external network, i.e., the **Internet**.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/b2db66fcabef4afc85e7a9d5dac89df6.png\">\n\n- Click on the **specific security group where the egress rule should be created**.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/c233282b9175418bb33307911ef53a18.png\">\n\n- **Now the egress rule creation menu appears.**\n- The user can see an option called **Add Rule** on the right side of the panel.\n- Click on that.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/6ba08e07ed9141578e8553bac40b0859.png\">\n- Select the **protocol** according to your preference.\n- Specify the **starting and ending port number.**\n- Finally, click on the **Add Rule** button.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/secutity-groups/d584b7fc141c440394f4ed589c0a4681.png\">\n\n:::success\n- The egress rule has now been successfully created.\n:::\n\n## IP Manager Overview in Stackbill  <span id=\"ip-manager-overview-on-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n**An IP address in Stackbill ** is a static **publicly accessible IP address** that you can assign to an **instance** and later **reassign** to **another instance**. To create a high availability infrastructure, you can implement a failover mechanism using reserved IP addresses.\n\n## Obtaining a New Public IP Address\n<img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/4c1d542f863444439e234f91a2afad7b.png\">\n\n- Click on the **Network** dropdown below the calculation icon, available in the top left corner. From the dropdown, click on the **IP Manager** option.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/6d3dc841b9df4947b59617cada724e36.png\">\n\n- The **IP Manager** screen appears.\n- Click on the option **Acquire new public IP**.\n\n  <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/278c989941d1414d876a73660e523287.png\">\n\n- *Choose Your Network* - To acquire a public IP address, choose the network.\n\n:::note\n*Load balancing and port forwarding functions can be enabled by disabling Static NAT while acquiring a new public IP address.*\n:::\n<img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/db41f4ab420d4904949e35f9f64f9267.png\">\n\n:::note\n*Load balancing and port forwarding functions can be disabled by enabling Static NAT while acquiring a new public IP address.*\n:::\n\n- To confirm the acquisition of the new IP address, click on the checkbox.\n\n:::note\n*- The administrator charges a fee for acquiring a new IP address.*\n:::\n\n- Finally, click on the *Acquire* button.\n\n  <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/b1600fda1c8c40eaa0e8ce2df65d6087.png\">\n\n- Now the *IP address* has been successfully created.\n\n## Releasing Public IP Address\n<img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/dae0db59c00f43f6a034616e103540ac.png\">\n\n:::note\n*Load balancing and port forwarding functions can be disabled by enabling Static NAT while acquiring a new public IP address.*\n:::\n\n- To release a public IP, click on the *release icon* available in the *Action menu*.\n- You will receive a confirmation notification in the portal once you click on it.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/6452ae7f8ad848c5b427f10446722e30.png\">\n\n- To release the IP address, click on Accept.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ip-manager/eb43eee245d04d788e5a4c64724a37ef.png\">\n\n- Now your *IP* has been *successfully removed*.\n\n## Virtual Private Cloud <span id=\"vpc-virtual-private-cloud-in-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n*INTRODUCTION*\n\nVPC (Virtual Private Cloud) is a network feature in the cloud control panel that allows users to create isolated and logically defined private cloud environments within a public cloud infrastructure. VPC enables users to have full control over their network topology and allows them to configure a private network space with multiple levels of virtual machines, routers, firewalls, and load balancers.\n\n*VPC FEATURES*\n\n  - Isolated Network Environment: VPC allows users to create an isolated network environment with its own private IP address space. This isolation provides increased security and separation from other VPCs and the public cloud.\n\n  - Multiple Levels: Within a VPC, users can create multiple levels or subnets to efficiently organize their network infrastructure. Each level can have its own set of virtual machines and network services such as routers, load balancers, and firewalls.\n\n  - Virtual Router: The VPC uses a virtual router to provide essential routing capabilities between different levels within the VPC and also between the VPC and the external network (public cloud or Internet). The virtual router handles network traffic and ensures that packets are correctly forwarded to their destination.\n\n  - Network ACLs and Security Groups: VPC allows users to define Network Access Control Lists (ACLs) and security groups to control incoming and outgoing network traffic to and from the virtual machines in the VPC. This helps improve security and access control to VPC resources.\n\n  - VPN Connectivity: VPC supports the creation of Virtual Private Network (VPN) connections, allowing users to establish secure communication between their on-premises infrastructure and the VPC in the public cloud. This feature enables hybrid cloud scenarios and facilitates secure data transfer.\n\n  - Load Balancing: Users can configure load balancers within the VPC to distribute incoming traffic among multiple virtual machines at a level. This ensures high availability and scalability for applications running within the VPC.\n\n  - Network Offering: VPC offers multiple network offerings that define the specifications and capabilities of the VPC, such as the number of subnets, IP address ranges, and supported services. Users can select the appropriate network offering based on their requirements.\n\n  - Elastic IP Addresses: VPC provides Elastic IP (EIP) addresses that can be associated with virtual machines to allow them to have a static and public IP address. This enables the virtual machines to be accessed from the Internet without changing their IP addresses.\n\n*STEPS TO CREATE A VIRTUAL PRIVATE CLOUD*\n\n  - Log in to your control panel.\n  - Go to Network and click on VPC.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/7a8a7e384a884acb9b977cf08af336cc.jpg\">\n- Then click on Add VPC.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/87834a874c8b47d886a4770488d04362.jpg\">\n\n  - Provide the name, description, and specify the IP address range for the VPC in CIDR notation (e.g., 10.0.0.0/16). This range should not overlap with other networks in your Stackbill environment. Also, choose the appropriate VPC offering that defines the specifications and capabilities of the VPC. Then click on the Add button.\n  ![VPC Configuration](https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/34a2b109586b4fcbaebba1b17bb810f8.jpg)\n\n  - VPC created successfully.\n\n  <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/3560b9da11234ec6bbe1d4dc9a825250.jpg\">\n\n*ADD YOUR VPC LEVEL NETWORK*\n\n  - After creating your VPC network, click on the configure button.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/69a1f86064ae4b26bc13988b52e3dd1d.jpg\">\n\n  - Then click on create network.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/a6005c5e9256470f873c2413a2f3a552.jpg\">\n\n  - Specify the name of your level (e.g., \"DMZ\", \"Application\", etc.)\n  - Select the appropriate ACL to allow or deny access to your network.\n  - Then provide the gateway, netmask, select the network offering for your level, and click on the Add button.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/050e8a0d325d4afbaebcf8875f0b3533.jpg\">\n\n  - Your new level network has been created successfully.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/03fc61ed5c464011b38bd51bba6bc90d.jpg\">\n\n*ADDING VIRTUAL MACHINES*\n\n  - To create a new virtual machine, click on the virtual machines link.\n  - Then click on Add instance.\n  - *[Steps to create an instance](/docs/virtualresources/Instance#quick-deploy-in-Stackbill-)*\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/ad27adfc14a642cd9d92c90f28aca144.jpg\">\n  - When creating the VM, make sure to have selected your VPC level from the network list.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/9e2d6a7c9fe84342a5ec0abbae1fc634.jpg\">\n\n*CONFIGURING VPC TO VPC VPN IN THECLOUD*\n\n  - To explain VPC to VPC VPN, refer to the image below for demonstration.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/4b3448ce085e42d684cdf6d63a569c51.jpg\">\n\n*VPN Gateway*: The VPN gateway is the term used for the local VPN endpoint. This is simply enabled on the NAT source IP address of the VPC virtual router and allows the local VR to accept incoming VPN connections.\n\n*VPN Client Gateway*: The VPN client gateway is the remote endpoint that we target when setting up the VPN connection. When setting these up, we must specify all details for this VPN connection.\n- Name: user-friendly name for the gateway\n- Gateway: public IP address of the remote VPC virtual router.\n- CIDR List: this is a list of CIDR networks that can be reached at the remote end of the tunnel. Multiple CIDR ranges can be specified, separated by commas.\n- Pre-Shared IPsec Key: this is effectively the VPN password phrase used when negotiating the VPN connection and as such should follow standard password best practices in a production environment.\n- IKE/ESP encryption details for the VPN tunnels.\n\n*VPN Connection*\n\nThe VPN connection is the pairing from the originating (or local) VPN gateway to the remote VPN client gateway. This is configured in one of two modes:\n\n- Active: the connection that initiates the VPN tunnel, typically from the VPC hosting the virtual machines consuming resources in the remote VPC.\n- Passive: this connection waits for the opposite VPC VR to initiate the connection and is typically in the VPC hosting the resources to be consumed.\n\nNote that for both connections, resources at both ends must be reachable via the CIDR list configured for the VPN client gateway.\n\n*STEPS TO CREATE A VPN GATEWAY*\n\n- Log in to the cloud control panel.\n- Then click on Network and select VPN Gateway.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/912c3c0017a54eab9381d635e56e4456.jpg\">\n\n- Then click on the ADD VPN button.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/c6d15c53c0fc4307907f0534463730ec.jpg\">\n\n- In this example, we assume that the virtual machines from VPC1 Level 1 and 2 will consume resources in VPC2. Note that in this case, we only configure the name, public gateway, CIDR list, and pre-shared IPsec key; all other fields are left as default.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/a4a51103d31247caae8d068496de737e.jpg\">\n\n- Repeat this step for the client gateway in VPC2:\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/1dae39a6d3f94557933c97ba4fdcd89f.jpg\">\n*Enabling Site-to-Site VPN*\n\n- Log in to your cloud control panel.\n- Then click on the VPC menu.\n- Click on the corresponding VPC from the list.\n- Then click on configure.\n- Click on the Site-to-Site VPN list menu.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/09a4342f55d34889993abea4ee03edff.jpg\">\n\n- Click Accept to confirm the creation.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/debbf11e601c4cd0b38c536e03d90501.jpg\">\n\n- Once the Site-to-Site VPN is enabled, click on the VPN Connection tab. Click on the Add button.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/c3861c8511c7400687dea9fa514c8262.jpg\">\n\n- Then select the VPN Gateway from the dropdown list and click Accept.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/4907cd5aa90044978e168b59c41445a3.jpg\">\n\n- Repeat this step for the passive connection from VPC2 to VPC1, but for this one, check the \"passive\" checkbox.\n\n- Once both VPN connections are configured, refresh the screen and ensure that the VPN Connection status is \"connected\".\n- If the VPN connection does not appear automatically, simply go back to the active connection (from VPC1 to VPC2) and click the \"Reset\" button.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/VPC2/ba05897ff41d407783980e087d5e8ad4.jpg\">\n\n## Overview of Load Balancer in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal<span id=\"load-balancer-overview-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\nA *load balancer* can be deployed as *software or hardware* on a device that *distributes client connections* among a set of servers. A load balancer acts as a \"**reverse proxy**\" to represent the application servers to the client through a virtual IP address (VIP). This technology is known as *Server Load Balancing (SLB)*. SLB is designed for groups of application servers within a single site or local area network (LAN).\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/df028ef5b2d144798681b71edf7b57c3.png\">\n\n### Add a load balancer to an instance in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal<span id=\"add-a-load-balancer-to-an-instance-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n- Click on the *Network* dropdown button below the *Compute icon*, which is available in the top-left corner. In the dropdown menu, click on *Load Balancer* to create a new Load Balancer.\n- The *Load Balancer* screen appears.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/dae82a39ffb743eaa431d755494e4fe9.png\">\n\n- On the right side of the panel, you can see an option called *Create Load Balancer*, click on it.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/2405d1922c934a4da76bddd8f035e6b3.png\">\n\n- The option to *Add Load Balancer* appears on the screen.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/adefaa514c384a36893d5757634c9a4f.png\">\n\n- As a first step, enter a *name and description* for the load balancer you create.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/9a24fc742d8040bbb00be5c367652eaf.png\">\n\n*Network and IP Address*\n- Here you select the network and IP address for the Load Balancer.\n- *Create Forwarding Policy and Algorithm*\n- *Policy Name*: provide a policy name.\n- Select the protocol and assign a port number for both the load balancer and the instance.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/0d947126e9ac47fdb338f55ab5e20b79.png\">\n\n*Choose Algorithm and Sticky Sessions*\n- Choose your Load Balancer algorithm for traffic distribution.\n- Select the sticky session as per requirement.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/21f23239a893482eabbc1acd1c1950e8.png\">\n\n*Attach Instance*\n\n- Attach the policy to the required instance and click the *Save Policy* button below.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/be0a859da301480db5449bb9c8dc42cb.png\">\n\n- Now the *Load Balancer Policy* has been created successfully.\n- Once the policy is created successfully, click on the *Create Load Balancer* button available below.\n\n   <img width=\"70%\" src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Load_Balancer/6cd0b4d309244882a3b925d2d9640c53.png\">\n\n- The *load balancer is successfully configured on the instance.*\n- Now you can see the created policy in the Load Balancer panel.\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\nAbout The Cloud\n\nStackbill is an intuitive and full-featured self-service cloud management portal with extensive capabilities leveraging Apache CloudStack® and years of cutting-edge technology experience.','','Basic Network','user-guide/network/basic-network',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',56,'155ee41d-7829-4173-856b-0b98509e5809',NULL,2,'Networking',175,0,'cms_9e5809'),
(57,48,46,2,'2023-09-27 10:56:59','<h1>Introdução aos plug-ins</h1>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/plugins/6313475709a648c8adeeff702d410c25.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<p><strong>A plataforma Stackbill </strong> oferece documentação abrangente para <strong>todos os plug-ins</strong>, convenientemente acessíveis por meio da <strong>seção de plug-ins.</strong> Além de sua versão ativa atual com <strong>Kubernetes como serviço</strong>, **Stackbill ** continua a introduzir novos plug-ins em versões futuras, fornecendo um conjunto de recursos em constante evolução e expansão. Como resultado, os usuários podem esperar atualizações e melhorias frequentes em diversas categorias.</p>\n','',3,'# Introdução aos plug-ins\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/plugins/6313475709a648c8adeeff702d410c25.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n\n**A plataforma Stackbill ** oferece documentação abrangente para **todos os plug-ins**, convenientemente acessíveis por meio da **seção de plug-ins.** Além de sua versão ativa atual com **Kubernetes como serviço**, **Stackbill ** continua a introduzir novos plug-ins em versões futuras, fornecendo um conjunto de recursos em constante evolução e expansão. Como resultado, os usuários podem esperar atualizações e melhorias frequentes em diversas categorias.','\0','Introdução aos plug-ins','plug-ins/documentação-de-plug-ins/introdu-o-aos-plug-ins',1,6,4,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',53,'6ff0d137-0f7d-427a-9813-fb0ec3a400f3',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_a400f3'),
(58,2,1,2,'2023-09-27 11:01:28','<h1><strong>Perfil de configuración</strong></h1>\n<h2>Configuración del perfil de usuario en Stackbill  <span id=\"Configuración-del-perfil-de-usuario-en-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<p>La característica de perfil de <strong>Stackbill </strong> permite a los usuarios cambiar su contraseña y configurar la información de pago para su conveniencia. Además, los usuarios pueden ver sus créditos y códigos promocionales. La característica de perfil en <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Stackbill </strong></a> proporciona una vista completa de la cuenta de un usuario.</p>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/1eb6e2181c124aa88c445b8c8776d568.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Una vez que ingrese al portal de <strong>Stackbill</strong>, verá la opción <strong>Mi Perfil</strong>, donde puede actualizar su información y cargar imágenes.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/e1730f37d0c4464faf31ea237bc7fe6e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Límite de crédito del usuario</strong> <strong>(un límite que el administrador asigna al usuario para usar los recursos)</strong>: en esta opción, el usuario puede ver su límite de crédito asignado por el administrador.</li>\n<li>Una vez que se completen los <strong>cambios</strong>, haga clic en el botón <strong>Guardar Cambios</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Cambiar la contraseña de la cuenta de usuario en el Portal de Stackbill <span id=\"Cambiar-contraseña-de-la-cuenta-de-usuario-en-el-Portal-de-Stackbill\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Para <strong>cambiar la contraseña de su cuenta</strong>, haga clic en la opción <strong>Cambiar Contraseña</strong> ubicada en Mi Perfil.</li>\n<li>Se abrirá el menú de <strong>cambio de contraseña</strong> en la pantalla.</li>\n<li>Para cambiar la contraseña de su cuenta, haga clic en la opción <strong>Cambiar Contraseña</strong> ubicada en Mi Perfil.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/6fc407ca8f484624904d421433735059.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Ahora aparecerá el menú <strong>Cambiar Contraseña</strong> en la pantalla.</li>\n<li><strong>Ingrese la Contraseña Antigua</strong> y luego <strong>ingrese la Nueva Contraseña</strong> y confírmela.</li>\n<li>Luego, haga clic en el botón Actualizar.</li>\n<li>Ahora la <strong>Nueva Contraseña se ha actualizado con éxito</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Elija su Método de Pago en la Cuenta de Usuario <span id=\"Elegir-su-método-de-pago-en-la-cuenta-de-usuario\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Para <strong>seleccionar su método de pago</strong>, haga clic en la opción <strong>Configuración de Pago</strong> ubicada bajo la opción Cambiar Contraseña.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/e7faed0425eb448d8be109eabaf8e838.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Aparecerá el menú de <strong>configuración de pago</strong> en la pantalla.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Seleccione las <strong>pasarelas de pago necesarias</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Es posible integrar la <strong>pasarela de pago de su propio país</strong> en el <strong>Portal de Facturación de Stackbill CloudStack</strong>, pero esto debe ser comunicado previamente al <strong>Administrador de Stackbill</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::info\n<strong>El Portal de Facturación de Stackbill CloudStack se puede personalizar para aceptar pagos a través de la pasarela de pago del país de origen del usuario, sin embargo, esto debe ser aprobado primero por el Administrador de Stackbill.</strong>\n:::</p>\n<h2>Créditos y Códigos Promocionales para el Usuario en Stackbill  <span id=\"Créditos-y-códigos-promocionales-para-el-usuario-en-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bajo la opción <strong>Configuración de Pago</strong>, haga clic en <strong>Créditos y Códigos Promocionales</strong> para consultar sus límites de crédito y ofertas.</li>\n<li>Ahora aparecerá la opción de Créditos y Códigos Promocionales en la pantalla.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ade282d717ee46ebac092fa0da0f46bd.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>El Límite de Crédito Total mostrará la cantidad de créditos disponibles para el usuario.</li>\n<li>Bajo Límite de Crédito Utilizado, el usuario puede ver su límite de crédito utilizado.</li>\n<li>El Límite de Crédito Disponible mostrará los límites de crédito disponibles.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Configuración de Acceso a API en Stackbill  <span id=\"Configuraciones-de-acceso-a-la-api-en-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bajo <strong>Crédito &amp; Códigos Promocionales</strong>, haga clic en <strong>Solicitar Acceso a API</strong> para acceder a la configuración de la API.</li>\n<li>Ahora aparecerá la opción de <strong>Acceso a API</strong> en la pantalla.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/41e03efb5cc8460799a4ee25cd2b508f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>La API de Stackbill</strong> le permite <strong>administrar</strong> sus <strong>instancias</strong> y <strong>otros recursos</strong> de forma programática mediante <strong>solicitudes HTTP convencionales</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>La API de Stackbill</strong> le permite realizar cualquier acción que pueda realizar a través del Panel de Control (excepto crear tokens de acceso personal).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Configuración de Notificaciones en Stackbill  <span id=\"Configuraciones-de-notificaciones-en-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bajo <strong>Administrar Acceso a API</strong>, haga clic en <strong>Configuración de Notificaciones</strong> para configurar alertas de notificación.</li>\n<li>Ahora aparecerá la opción de <strong>Configuración de Notificaciones</strong> en la pantalla.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/778f5afdbd3b42cea34896b4eb92c71f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Notificación de Mantenimiento y Interrupción</strong> - Para recibir notificaciones sobre interrupciones y mantenimiento, el usuario puede habilitar la opción de notificación de interrupciones y mantenimiento.</li>\n<li><strong>Preferencia de Facturación</strong> - Cuando se habilita la opción de recordatorio de factura, el usuario recibirá una notificación sobre el pago de la factura tres días antes del final del mes.</li>\n<li><strong>Pagos Atrasados</strong> - Al habilitar la opción de Pagos Atrasados, los usuarios pueden recibir notificaciones sobre pagos vencidos.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Proceso de Eliminación de una Cuenta en Stackbill  <span id=\"El-proceso-para-eliminar-una-cuenta-del-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bajo <strong>Configuración de Notificaciones</strong>, haga clic en la opción <strong>Solicitar Eliminación de Cuenta</strong> para eliminar la cuenta del portal.</li>\n<li>Ahora aparecerá la pantalla de solicitud de eliminación de cuenta.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/846b439bce90420d84b5938db4222ccb.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Siga amablemente el procedimiento para <strong>eliminar su cuenta</strong> de <strong>Stackbill.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gestión de Nubes</a> con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# **Perfil de configuración**\r\n\r\n## Configuración del perfil de usuario en Stackbill  <span id=\"Configuración-del-perfil-de-usuario-en-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\nLa característica de perfil de **Stackbill ** permite a los usuarios cambiar su contraseña y configurar la información de pago para su conveniencia. Además, los usuarios pueden ver sus créditos y códigos promocionales. La característica de perfil en [**Stackbill **](https://localhost:8080/) proporciona una vista completa de la cuenta de un usuario.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/1eb6e2181c124aa88c445b8c8776d568.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Una vez que ingrese al portal de **Stackbill**, verá la opción **Mi Perfil**, donde puede actualizar su información y cargar imágenes.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/e1730f37d0c4464faf31ea237bc7fe6e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Límite de crédito del usuario** **(un límite que el administrador asigna al usuario para usar los recursos)**: en esta opción, el usuario puede ver su límite de crédito asignado por el administrador.\r\n- Una vez que se completen los **cambios**, haga clic en el botón **Guardar Cambios**.\r\n\r\n## Cambiar la contraseña de la cuenta de usuario en el Portal de Stackbill <span id=\"Cambiar-contraseña-de-la-cuenta-de-usuario-en-el-Portal-de-Stackbill\"></span>\r\n\r\n- Para **cambiar la contraseña de su cuenta**, haga clic en la opción **Cambiar Contraseña** ubicada en Mi Perfil.\r\n- Se abrirá el menú de **cambio de contraseña** en la pantalla.\r\n- Para cambiar la contraseña de su cuenta, haga clic en la opción **Cambiar Contraseña** ubicada en Mi Perfil.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/6fc407ca8f484624904d421433735059.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- Ahora aparecerá el menú **Cambiar Contraseña** en la pantalla.\r\n- **Ingrese la Contraseña Antigua** y luego **ingrese la Nueva Contraseña** y confírmela.\r\n- Luego, haga clic en el botón Actualizar.\r\n- Ahora la **Nueva Contraseña se ha actualizado con éxito**.\r\n\r\n## Elija su Método de Pago en la Cuenta de Usuario <span id=\"Elegir-su-método-de-pago-en-la-cuenta-de-usuario\"></span>\r\n\r\n- Para **seleccionar su método de pago**, haga clic en la opción **Configuración de Pago** ubicada bajo la opción Cambiar Contraseña.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/e7faed0425eb448d8be109eabaf8e838.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Aparecerá el menú de **configuración de pago** en la pantalla.\r\n- Seleccione las **pasarelas de pago necesarias**.\r\n\r\n- Es posible integrar la **pasarela de pago de su propio país** en el **Portal de Facturación de Stackbill CloudStack**, pero esto debe ser comunicado previamente al **Administrador de Stackbill**.\r\n\r\n:::info\r\n**El Portal de Facturación de Stackbill CloudStack se puede personalizar para aceptar pagos a través de la pasarela de pago del país de origen del usuario, sin embargo, esto debe ser aprobado primero por el Administrador de Stackbill.**\r\n:::\r\n\r\n## Créditos y Códigos Promocionales para el Usuario en Stackbill  <span id=\"Créditos-y-códigos-promocionales-para-el-usuario-en-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\n- Bajo la opción **Configuración de Pago**, haga clic en **Créditos y Códigos Promocionales** para consultar sus límites de crédito y ofertas.\r\n- Ahora aparecerá la opción de Créditos y Códigos Promocionales en la pantalla.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ade282d717ee46ebac092fa0da0f46bd.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- El Límite de Crédito Total mostrará la cantidad de créditos disponibles para el usuario.\r\n- Bajo Límite de Crédito Utilizado, el usuario puede ver su límite de crédito utilizado.\r\n- El Límite de Crédito Disponible mostrará los límites de crédito disponibles.\r\n\r\n## Configuración de Acceso a API en Stackbill  <span id=\"Configuraciones-de-acceso-a-la-api-en-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\n- Bajo **Crédito & Códigos Promocionales**, haga clic en **Solicitar Acceso a API** para acceder a la configuración de la API.\r\n- Ahora aparecerá la opción de **Acceso a API** en la pantalla.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/41e03efb5cc8460799a4ee25cd2b508f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- **La API de Stackbill** le permite **administrar** sus **instancias** y **otros recursos** de forma programática mediante **solicitudes HTTP convencionales**.\r\n- **La API de Stackbill** le permite realizar cualquier acción que pueda realizar a través del Panel de Control (excepto crear tokens de acceso personal).\r\n\r\n## Configuración de Notificaciones en Stackbill  <span id=\"Configuraciones-de-notificaciones-en-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\n- Bajo **Administrar Acceso a API**, haga clic en **Configuración de Notificaciones** para configurar alertas de notificación.\r\n- Ahora aparecerá la opción de **Configuración de Notificaciones** en la pantalla.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/778f5afdbd3b42cea34896b4eb92c71f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Notificación de Mantenimiento y Interrupción** - Para recibir notificaciones sobre interrupciones y mantenimiento, el usuario puede habilitar la opción de notificación de interrupciones y mantenimiento.\r\n- **Preferencia de Facturación** - Cuando se habilita la opción de recordatorio de factura, el usuario recibirá una notificación sobre el pago de la factura tres días antes del final del mes.\r\n- **Pagos Atrasados** - Al habilitar la opción de Pagos Atrasados, los usuarios pueden recibir notificaciones sobre pagos vencidos.\r\n\r\n## Proceso de Eliminación de una Cuenta en Stackbill  <span id=\"El-proceso-para-eliminar-una-cuenta-del-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\n- Bajo **Configuración de Notificaciones**, haga clic en la opción **Solicitar Eliminación de Cuenta** para eliminar la cuenta del portal.\r\n- Ahora aparecerá la pantalla de solicitud de eliminación de cuenta.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/846b439bce90420d84b5938db4222ccb.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- Siga amablemente el procedimiento para **eliminar su cuenta** de **Stackbill.**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo [Portal de Gestión de Nubes](https://localhost:8080/) con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.**\r\n','\0','Perfil de configuración','guía-del-usuario/empezando/perfil-de-configuraci-n',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',54,'ea7bed7d-943e-4aba-a26b-61994782c071',NULL,3,NULL,175,0,'cms_82c071'),
(59,34,34,2,'2023-09-27 11:04:01','<h1>Introduction</h1>\n<p><strong>Secure payment and chargeback options integrated with Stackbill cloudstack billing portal</strong> which enable customers to chargeback their customers with popular payment gateways like PayPal, RazorPay, etc.</p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill is a cloud billing platform</strong> that enables  to offer their customers the convenience of paying in their preferred currency. With <strong>Stackbill\'s multi-currency support</strong>, businesses can seamlessly bill their customers in their respective regional currencies. This feature helps businesses to streamline their billing process and provide a better customer experience by eliminating currency conversion complexities and allowing customers to pay in their familiar currency.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/billing/Overview#billing-system-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Billing Overview</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/billing/Cost-Explorer#cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Cost Explorer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/billing/Saving-Plans#savings-plan-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Savings Plan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/billing/invoice#invoice-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Invoice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/billing/Reporting#cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Reporting</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Introduction\n\n\n**Secure payment and chargeback options integrated with Stackbill cloudstack billing portal** which enable customers to chargeback their customers with popular payment gateways like PayPal, RazorPay, etc.\n\n**Stackbill is a cloud billing platform** that enables  to offer their customers the convenience of paying in their preferred currency. With **Stackbill\'s multi-currency support**, businesses can seamlessly bill their customers in their respective regional currencies. This feature helps businesses to streamline their billing process and provide a better customer experience by eliminating currency conversion complexities and allowing customers to pay in their familiar currency.\n\n- [Billing Overview](/help/docs/user-guide/billing/Overview#billing-system-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n- [Cost Explorer](/help/docs/user-guide/billing/Cost-Explorer#cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n- [Savings Plan](/help/docs/user-guide/billing/Saving-Plans#savings-plan-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n- [Invoice](/help/docs/user-guide/billing/invoice#invoice-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n- [Reporting](/help/docs/user-guide/billing/Reporting#cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n\n-----------------------------------------------------\n\n\n**About Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**','\0','Introduction','user-guide/billing/introduction',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',59,'e4e305bd-6a78-4b2e-b755-b6a2396f3329',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_6f3329'),
(60,35,34,2,'2023-09-27 11:05:25','<h1>Introducción</h1>\n<p><strong>Opciones de pago seguro y devolución de cargo integradas con el portal de facturación Stackbill Cloudstack</strong> que permiten a los clientes realizar devolución de cargo a sus clientes con pasarelas de pago populares como PayPal, RazorPay, etc.</p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill es una plataforma de facturación en la nube</strong> que permite ofrecer a sus clientes la comodidad de pagar en su moneda preferida. Con <strong>el soporte multidivisa de Stackbill</strong>, las empresas pueden facturar a sus clientes sin problemas en sus respectivas monedas regionales. Esta función ayuda a las empresas a optimizar su proceso de facturación y brindar una mejor experiencia al cliente al eliminar las complejidades de conversión de moneda y permitir a los clientes pagar en su moneda familiar.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/facturación/descripción-general#billing-system-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Descripción general de facturación</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/facturación/explorador-de-costos#cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Explorador de costos</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/facturación/planes-de-ahorro#plan-de-ahorro-en-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Plan de ahorro</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/facturación/factura#factura-en-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Factura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/facturación/informes#cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Informes</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gestión de Nubes</a> con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Introducción\n\n\n**Opciones de pago seguro y devolución de cargo integradas con el portal de facturación Stackbill Cloudstack** que permiten a los clientes realizar devolución de cargo a sus clientes con pasarelas de pago populares como PayPal, RazorPay, etc.\n\n**Stackbill es una plataforma de facturación en la nube** que permite ofrecer a sus clientes la comodidad de pagar en su moneda preferida. Con **el soporte multidivisa de Stackbill**, las empresas pueden facturar a sus clientes sin problemas en sus respectivas monedas regionales. Esta función ayuda a las empresas a optimizar su proceso de facturación y brindar una mejor experiencia al cliente al eliminar las complejidades de conversión de moneda y permitir a los clientes pagar en su moneda familiar.\n\n- [Descripción general de facturación](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/facturación/descripción-general#billing-system-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n- [Explorador de costos](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/facturación/explorador-de-costos#cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n- [Plan de ahorro](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/facturación/planes-de-ahorro#plan-de-ahorro-en-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n- [Factura](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/facturación/factura#factura-en-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n- [Informes](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/facturación/informes#cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo [Portal de Gestión de Nubes](https://localhost:8080/) con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.**','\0','Introducción','guía-del-usuario/facturación/introducci-n',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',59,'f02d32b9-6039-47cb-9cf5-90d027bd8501',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_bd8501'),
(61,36,34,2,'2023-09-27 11:07:11','<h1>Introdução</h1>\n<p><strong>Opções seguras de pagamento e estorno integradas ao portal de cobrança Stackbill cloudstack</strong> que permitem aos clientes estornar seus clientes com gateways de pagamento populares como PayPal, RazorPay, etc.</p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill é uma plataforma de faturamento na nuvem</strong> que permite oferecer aos seus clientes a conveniência de pagar na moeda de sua preferência. Com o <strong>suporte multimoedas do Stackbill</strong>, as empresas podem cobrar seus clientes de forma integrada em suas respectivas moedas regionais. Esse recurso ajuda as empresas a agilizar seu processo de cobrança e proporcionar uma melhor experiência ao cliente, eliminando complexidades de conversão de moeda e permitindo que os clientes paguem na moeda que conhecem.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/cobrança/visão-geral#billing-system-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Visão geral do faturamento</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/cobrança/explorador-de-custos#cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Explorador de custos</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/cobrança/planos-de-economia#plano-de-poupança-no-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Plano de poupança</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/cobrança/fatura#invoice-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Fatura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/cobrança/comunicando#cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">Relatórios</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens</a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Introdução\n\n\n**Opções seguras de pagamento e estorno integradas ao portal de cobrança Stackbill cloudstack** que permitem aos clientes estornar seus clientes com gateways de pagamento populares como PayPal, RazorPay, etc.\n\n**Stackbill é uma plataforma de faturamento na nuvem** que permite oferecer aos seus clientes a conveniência de pagar na moeda de sua preferência. Com o **suporte multimoedas do Stackbill**, as empresas podem cobrar seus clientes de forma integrada em suas respectivas moedas regionais. Esse recurso ajuda as empresas a agilizar seu processo de cobrança e proporcionar uma melhor experiência ao cliente, eliminando complexidades de conversão de moeda e permitindo que os clientes paguem na moeda que conhecem.\n\n- [Visão geral do faturamento](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/cobrança/visão-geral#billing-system-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n- [Explorador de custos](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/cobrança/explorador-de-custos#cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n- [Plano de poupança](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/cobrança/planos-de-economia#plano-de-poupança-no-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n- [Fatura](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/cobrança/fatura#invoice-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n- [Relatórios](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/cobrança/comunicando#cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal)\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Sobre Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo [Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.**','\0','Introdução','guia-de-usuario/cobrança/introdu-o',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',59,'06b4d285-8f88-4237-970c-f119f9ab5077',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_ab5077'),
(63,3,1,2,'2023-09-27 11:13:14','<h1><strong>Perfil de configuração</strong></h1>\n<h2>Configurando o perfil de usuário no Stackbill </h2>\n<p>A funcionalidade de Perfil do <strong>Stackbill </strong> permite aos usuários alterar sua senha e configurar as opções de pagamento para sua conveniência. Além disso, os usuários podem visualizar seus créditos e códigos promocionais. A funcionalidade de Perfil no <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Stackbill </strong></a> fornece uma visão abrangente da conta do usuário.</p>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/1eb6e2181c124aa88c445b8c8776d568.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Assim que você entrar no portal do <strong>Stackbill</strong>, verá a opção <strong>Meu Perfil</strong>, onde poderá atualizar suas informações e fazer upload de imagens.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/e1730f37d0c4464faf31ea237bc7fe6e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Limite de crédito do usuário</strong> <strong>(um limite alocado pelo administrador para o uso dos recursos)</strong> - nesta opção, o usuário pode visualizar o limite de crédito alocado pelo administrador.</li>\n<li>Após todas as <strong>alterações serem concluídas</strong>, clique no botão <strong>Salvar Alterações</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Alterar senha da conta de usuário no Portal Stackbill</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Para <strong>alterar a senha da sua conta</strong>, clique na opção <strong>Alterar Senha</strong> localizada em Meu Perfil.</li>\n<li>Um menu de <strong>alteração de senha</strong> aparecerá na tela.</li>\n<li>Para alterar a senha da sua conta, clique na opção <strong>Alterar Senha</strong> localizada em Meu Perfil.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/6fc407ca8f484624904d421433735059.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Agora o menu de Alteração de Senha aparecerá na tela.</li>\n<li><strong>Digite a Senha Antiga</strong> e depois <strong>digite a Nova Senha</strong> e confirme-a.</li>\n<li>Em seguida, clique no botão Atualizar.</li>\n<li>Agora a <strong>Nova Senha foi atualizada com sucesso</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Escolher seu Método de Pagamento na Conta de Usuário</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Para <strong>Selecionar seu método de pagamento</strong>, clique na opção <strong>Configurações de Pagamento</strong> localizada abaixo da opção Alterar Senha.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/e7faed0425eb448d8be109eabaf8e838.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Um menu de <strong>configurações de pagamento</strong> aparecerá na tela.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Selecione as <strong>pasarelas de pagamento necessárias</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>É possível integrar a <strong>pasarela de pagamento do próprio país do usuário</strong> no <strong>Portal de Cobrança do Stackbill CloudStack</strong>, mas isso deve ser comunicado ao <strong>Administrador do Stackbill</strong> com antecedência.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::info\n<strong>O Portal de Cobrança do Stackbill CloudStack pode ser personalizado para aceitar pagamentos através da pasarela de pagamento do país de origem do usuário, no entanto, isso deve ser aprovado primeiro pelo Administrador do Stackbill.</strong>\n:::</p>\n<h2>Créditos e Códigos Promocionais para o Usuário no Stackbill </h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sob a opção <strong>Configurações de Pagamento</strong>, clique em <strong>Créditos e Códigos Promocionais</strong> para verificar seus limites de crédito e ofertas.</li>\n<li>Agora a opção Créditos e Códigos Promocionais aparece na tela.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ade282d717ee46ebac092fa0da0f46bd.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>O Limite de Crédito Total exibirá a quantidade de créditos disponíveis para o usuário.</li>\n<li>Sob Limite de Crédito Utilizado, o usuário pode visualizar seu limite de crédito utilizado.</li>\n<li>O Saldo do Limite de Crédito Disponível exibirá os limites de crédito disponíveis.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Configurações de Acesso à API no Stackbill </h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sob a opção <strong>Crédito &amp; Códigos Promocionais</strong>, clique na opção <strong>Solicitar Acesso à API</strong> para acessar a configuração da API.</li>\n<li>Agora a opção <strong>Acesso à API</strong> aparece na tela.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/41e03efb5cc8460799a4ee25cd2b508f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>A API do <strong>Stackbill</strong> permite que você <strong>gerencie</strong> suas <strong>Instâncias</strong> e <strong>outros recursos</strong> programaticamente usando <strong>solicitações HTTP convencionais</strong>.</li>\n<li>A API do <strong>Stackbill</strong> permite que você execute qualquer ação que pode ser realizada através do Painel de Controle (exceto a criação de tokens de acesso pessoal).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Configurações de Notificação no Stackbill </h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sob a opção <strong>Gerenciar Acesso à API</strong>, clique na opção <strong>Configurações de Notificação</strong> para definir alertas de notificação.</li>\n<li>Agora a opção <strong>Configurações de Notificação</strong> aparece na tela.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/778f5afdbd3b42cea34896b4eb92c71f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Notificação de Manutenção e Interrupção</strong> - Para receber notificações sobre interrupções e manutenções, o usuário pode habilitar a opção de notificação de interrupções e manutenções.</li>\n<li><strong>Preferência de Fatura</strong> - Quando a opção de lembrete de fatura está habilitada, o usuário receberá uma notificação sobre o pagamento da fatura três dias antes do final do mês.</li>\n<li><strong>Pagamentos em Atraso</strong> - Habilitando a opção de Pagamentos em Atraso, os usuários podem receber notificações sobre pagamentos em atraso.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>O processo de remoção de uma conta do Stackbill </h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sob as <strong>Configurações de Notificação</strong>, clique na opção <strong>Solicitar Exclusão de Acesso</strong> para excluir a conta do portal.</li>\n<li>Agora a tela de solicitação de exclusão de conta aparece.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/846b439bce90420d84b5938db4222ccb.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Siga gentilmente o procedimento para <strong>excluir sua conta</strong> do <strong>Stackbill.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre o Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens</a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# **Perfil de configuração**\r\n\r\n## Configurando o perfil de usuário no Stackbill \r\n\r\nA funcionalidade de Perfil do **Stackbill ** permite aos usuários alterar sua senha e configurar as opções de pagamento para sua conveniência. Além disso, os usuários podem visualizar seus créditos e códigos promocionais. A funcionalidade de Perfil no [**Stackbill **](https://localhost:8080/) fornece uma visão abrangente da conta do usuário.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/1eb6e2181c124aa88c445b8c8776d568.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- Assim que você entrar no portal do **Stackbill**, verá a opção **Meu Perfil**, onde poderá atualizar suas informações e fazer upload de imagens.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/e1730f37d0c4464faf31ea237bc7fe6e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- **Limite de crédito do usuário** **(um limite alocado pelo administrador para o uso dos recursos)** - nesta opção, o usuário pode visualizar o limite de crédito alocado pelo administrador.\r\n- Após todas as **alterações serem concluídas**, clique no botão **Salvar Alterações**.\r\n\r\n## Alterar senha da conta de usuário no Portal Stackbill\r\n\r\n- Para **alterar a senha da sua conta**, clique na opção **Alterar Senha** localizada em Meu Perfil.\r\n- Um menu de **alteração de senha** aparecerá na tela.\r\n- Para alterar a senha da sua conta, clique na opção **Alterar Senha** localizada em Meu Perfil.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/6fc407ca8f484624904d421433735059.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Agora o menu de Alteração de Senha aparecerá na tela.\r\n- **Digite a Senha Antiga** e depois **digite a Nova Senha** e confirme-a.\r\n- Em seguida, clique no botão Atualizar.\r\n- Agora a **Nova Senha foi atualizada com sucesso**.\r\n\r\n## Escolher seu Método de Pagamento na Conta de Usuário\r\n\r\n- Para **Selecionar seu método de pagamento**, clique na opção **Configurações de Pagamento** localizada abaixo da opção Alterar Senha.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/e7faed0425eb448d8be109eabaf8e838.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- Um menu de **configurações de pagamento** aparecerá na tela.\r\n- Selecione as **pasarelas de pagamento necessárias**.\r\n\r\n- É possível integrar a **pasarela de pagamento do próprio país do usuário** no **Portal de Cobrança do Stackbill CloudStack**, mas isso deve ser comunicado ao **Administrador do Stackbill** com antecedência.\r\n\r\n:::info\r\n**O Portal de Cobrança do Stackbill CloudStack pode ser personalizado para aceitar pagamentos através da pasarela de pagamento do país de origem do usuário, no entanto, isso deve ser aprovado primeiro pelo Administrador do Stackbill.**\r\n:::\r\n\r\n## Créditos e Códigos Promocionais para o Usuário no Stackbill \r\n\r\n- Sob a opção **Configurações de Pagamento**, clique em **Créditos e Códigos Promocionais** para verificar seus limites de crédito e ofertas.\r\n- Agora a opção Créditos e Códigos Promocionais aparece na tela.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/ade282d717ee46ebac092fa0da0f46bd.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- O Limite de Crédito Total exibirá a quantidade de créditos disponíveis para o usuário.\r\n- Sob Limite de Crédito Utilizado, o usuário pode visualizar seu limite de crédito utilizado.\r\n- O Saldo do Limite de Crédito Disponível exibirá os limites de crédito disponíveis.\r\n\r\n## Configurações de Acesso à API no Stackbill \r\n\r\n- Sob a opção **Crédito & Códigos Promocionais**, clique na opção **Solicitar Acesso à API** para acessar a configuração da API.\r\n- Agora a opção **Acesso à API** aparece na tela.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/41e03efb5cc8460799a4ee25cd2b508f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- A API do **Stackbill** permite que você **gerencie** suas **Instâncias** e **outros recursos** programaticamente usando **solicitações HTTP convencionais**.\r\n- A API do **Stackbill** permite que você execute qualquer ação que pode ser realizada através do Painel de Controle (exceto a criação de tokens de acesso pessoal).\r\n\r\n## Configurações de Notificação no Stackbill \r\n\r\n- Sob a opção **Gerenciar Acesso à API**, clique na opção **Configurações de Notificação** para definir alertas de notificação.\r\n- Agora a opção **Configurações de Notificação** aparece na tela.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/778f5afdbd3b42cea34896b4eb92c71f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Notificação de Manutenção e Interrupção** - Para receber notificações sobre interrupções e manutenções, o usuário pode habilitar a opção de notificação de interrupções e manutenções.\r\n- **Preferência de Fatura** - Quando a opção de lembrete de fatura está habilitada, o usuário receberá uma notificação sobre o pagamento da fatura três dias antes do final do mês.\r\n- **Pagamentos em Atraso** - Habilitando a opção de Pagamentos em Atraso, os usuários podem receber notificações sobre pagamentos em atraso.\r\n\r\n## O processo de remoção de uma conta do Stackbill \r\n\r\n- Sob as **Configurações de Notificação**, clique na opção **Solicitar Exclusão de Acesso** para excluir a conta do portal.\r\n- Agora a tela de solicitação de exclusão de conta aparece.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/846b439bce90420d84b5938db4222ccb.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Siga gentilmente o procedimento para **excluir sua conta** do **Stackbill.**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Sobre o Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo [Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.**\r\n','\0','Perfil de configuração','guia-de-usuario/começando/perfil-de-configura-o',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',54,'2bf89223-7d5f-4010-ac6b-a92dd8539066',NULL,3,NULL,175,0,'cms_539066'),
(64,1,1,2,'2023-09-27 11:16:18','<h1>Release notes</h1>\n<h2>Stackbill Cloud Management Portal Version Overview</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Stackbill</strong></a> is a complete self-service intuitive Cloud Management Portal with extensive features leveraging <strong>Apache CloudStack®</strong> with state of art years of expertise.</p>\n<p><strong></strong> For <strong>Datacenters</strong> | <strong>Enterprises</strong> | <strong>Telecom and Cloud Service</strong> Providers.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Stackbill</strong> cloud platform release notes track incremental improvements and major releases.</p>\n<h3>Stackbill Cloud Management Portal 3.1.1 Version Overview</h3>\n<p>Stackbill 3.1.1 - August 3rd, 2023</p>\n<p><strong>Whats New</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Notifications email sends to the admin whenever a new user signs up.</li>\n<li>Notifications email sends the admin when a user creates or deletes a virtual machine (VM).</li>\n<li>Integrated a helpdesk system to provide support and assistance to the users.</li>\n<li>Provided the option to display their social media links in the footer.</li>\n<li>Provided the option to display their footer links.</li>\n<li>SubDomain feature added</li>\n<li>FAQ</li>\n<li>Login Page Slider</li>\n<li>Billing for Marketplace apps</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Improvements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Instance Creation Screen UI Improvements</li>\n<li>Admin NewUI Screens</li>\n<li>List Pages Improvement</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Payment Setting Link Wrongly Displayed in Dashboard Page issue fixed</li>\n<li>Billing - Purchase Savings Plans Back menu not working issue fixed</li>\n<li>Breadcrumb - Home navigation getting Blank page issue fixed</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Stackbill Cloud Management Portal 3.02 Version Overview</strong> <span id=\"Stackbill-cloud-management-portal-3.02-version-overview\"></span></h3>\n<p>Stackbill 3.02 - September 15th, 2022</p>\n<p><strong>What’s New</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>New UI - Dashboard improvement, Left side menu re-organize, VM summary page and User profile design changes</li>\n<li>Mobbex and Acqio payment integration</li>\n<li>Download option added for draft invoices</li>\n<li>Option to export client details</li>\n<li>Notification mail added for VM failed action</li>\n<li>Email unique validation check added in ACS user manual sync</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Improvements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Language translation upgrade</li>\n<li>Signup new user without payment configuration</li>\n<li>Mobile number duplicate validation</li>\n<li>Cloudstack error message changed to a human-readable format</li>\n<li>Profile image upload</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Prepaid account dashboard cost issue fixed</li>\n<li>Decimal place round-off issue fix added</li>\n<li>Enable advanced monitoring no reference object issue is fixed</li>\n<li>Reserved instance savings plan design issue fixed</li>\n<li>Volume usage metrics mismatch from ACS</li>\n<li>CPU utilization issue fixed in VM list page</li>\n<li>Unable to create VM using ISO template</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Stackbill 3.01 Version Overview <span id=\"Stackbill-3.01-version-overview\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Stackbill 3.01</strong>\nAugust 6th, 2022</p>\n<p><strong>What’s New</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>ACS 4.16 upgrade and compatibility verification in <strong>Stackbill</strong></li>\n<li>VM settings integration</li>\n<li>Vault HashiCorp integration for user key complaints</li>\n<li>Advanced monitoring auto upgrade</li>\n<li>Client budget alert configuration</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Improvements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Port forwarding rule creation slowness</li>\n<li>Report generation slowness problem</li>\n<li>Exclude daily usage for a suspended account</li>\n<li>External usage API upgrade</li>\n<li>Websocket communication issue for slow network connection</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Duplicate VM display issue fixed</li>\n<li>Account deletion flow issue fixed</li>\n<li>The recurring snapshot policy failed to delete the older snapshot</li>\n<li>VM already exists issue when creating an instance from an external API</li>\n<li>Time zone issue fixed in VM schedule configuration</li>\n<li>Error when resizing root volume through external API</li>\n<li>Disable the primary email edit option</li>\n<li>VM loader issue fixed</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Stackbill 3.00 Version Overview <span id=\"Stackbill-3.00-version-overview\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Stackbill 3.00</strong>\nJune 10th, 2022\n<strong>What’s New</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>New UI User Panel – Beta version</li>\n<li>Snapshot Policy API</li>\n<li>Tags API</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Improvements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Change the translation to &quot;borrar&quot; instead of Eliminar in Admin and user panel</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Template name not updated on instances list</li>\n<li>Volume list action buttons not showing</li>\n<li>Delete volume snapshot issue</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Stackbill 2.04 Version Overview <span id=\"Stackbill-2.04-version-overview\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Stackbill 2.04</strong>\nApril 28th, 2022\n<strong>What’s New</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Invoices do not reflect Stopped Resources.</li>\n<li>Fixed payment or Pay as you go Based on User.</li>\n<li>Recurring Snapshot API</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Improvements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Action button panel on secondary NICs</li>\n<li>Remove the &quot;Make redundant&quot; option</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bugs</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>VM detach and static NAT disable failed when deleted the corresponding VM</li>\n<li>Create Volume Price displayed NAN value</li>\n<li>PF and LB &quot;VIEW&quot; buttons on VPC not working</li>\n<li>Error in the Template filter (Spanish only)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Stackbill 2.03 Version Overview <span id=\"Stackbill-2.03-version-overview\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Stackbill 2.03</strong>\nFebruary 27th, 2022\n<strong>What’s New</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Reserved Instance Integration in Stackbill</li>\n<li>Farsi Language Support</li>\n<li>Role Privileges for Admin Users</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Improvements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>API changes to Regenerate Tax Pending Status.</li>\n<li>Custom field with search filter.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Release notes\r\n\r\n## Stackbill Cloud Management Portal Version Overview\r\n\r\n[**Stackbill**](https://localhost:8080/) is a complete self-service intuitive Cloud Management Portal with extensive features leveraging **Apache CloudStack®** with state of art years of expertise.\r\n\r\n**** For **Datacenters** | **Enterprises** | **Telecom and Cloud Service** Providers.\r\n\r\nThe **Stackbill** cloud platform release notes track incremental improvements and major releases.\r\n\r\n### Stackbill Cloud Management Portal 3.1.1 Version Overview \r\n\r\nStackbill 3.1.1 - August 3rd, 2023\r\n\r\n**Whats New**\r\n- Notifications email sends to the admin whenever a new user signs up.\r\n- Notifications email sends the admin when a user creates or deletes a virtual machine (VM).\r\n- Integrated a helpdesk system to provide support and assistance to the users.\r\n- Provided the option to display their social media links in the footer.\r\n- Provided the option to display their footer links.\r\n- SubDomain feature added\r\n- FAQ\r\n- Login Page Slider\r\n- Billing for Marketplace apps\r\n\r\n**Improvements**\r\n- Instance Creation Screen UI Improvements\r\n- Admin NewUI Screens\r\n- List Pages Improvement\r\n\r\n**Bug Fixes**\r\n- Payment Setting Link Wrongly Displayed in Dashboard Page issue fixed\r\n- Billing - Purchase Savings Plans Back menu not working issue fixed\r\n- Breadcrumb - Home navigation getting Blank page issue fixed\r\n \r\n### **Stackbill Cloud Management Portal 3.02 Version Overview** <span id=\"Stackbill-cloud-management-portal-3.02-version-overview\"></span>\r\n\r\nStackbill 3.02 - September 15th, 2022\r\n\r\n**What’s New**\r\n- New UI - Dashboard improvement, Left side menu re-organize, VM summary page and User profile design changes\r\n- Mobbex and Acqio payment integration\r\n- Download option added for draft invoices\r\n- Option to export client details\r\n- Notification mail added for VM failed action\r\n- Email unique validation check added in ACS user manual sync\r\n\r\n**Improvements**\r\n- Language translation upgrade\r\n- Signup new user without payment configuration\r\n- Mobile number duplicate validation\r\n- Cloudstack error message changed to a human-readable format\r\n- Profile image upload \r\n\r\n**Bug Fixes**\r\n- Prepaid account dashboard cost issue fixed\r\n- Decimal place round-off issue fix added\r\n- Enable advanced monitoring no reference object issue is fixed\r\n- Reserved instance savings plan design issue fixed\r\n- Volume usage metrics mismatch from ACS\r\n- CPU utilization issue fixed in VM list page\r\n- Unable to create VM using ISO template\r\n\r\n### Stackbill 3.01 Version Overview <span id=\"Stackbill-3.01-version-overview\"></span>\r\n\r\n**Stackbill 3.01**\r\nAugust 6th, 2022\r\n\r\n**What’s New**\r\n- ACS 4.16 upgrade and compatibility verification in **Stackbill**\r\n- VM settings integration\r\n- Vault HashiCorp integration for user key complaints\r\n- Advanced monitoring auto upgrade\r\n- Client budget alert configuration\r\n\r\n**Improvements**\r\n- Port forwarding rule creation slowness\r\n- Report generation slowness problem\r\n- Exclude daily usage for a suspended account\r\n- External usage API upgrade\r\n- Websocket communication issue for slow network connection\r\n \r\n\r\n**Bug Fixes**\r\n- Duplicate VM display issue fixed\r\n- Account deletion flow issue fixed\r\n- The recurring snapshot policy failed to delete the older snapshot\r\n- VM already exists issue when creating an instance from an external API\r\n- Time zone issue fixed in VM schedule configuration\r\n- Error when resizing root volume through external API\r\n- Disable the primary email edit option\r\n- VM loader issue fixed\r\n\r\n\r\n### Stackbill 3.00 Version Overview <span id=\"Stackbill-3.00-version-overview\"></span>\r\n\r\n\r\n**Stackbill 3.00** \r\nJune 10th, 2022 \r\n**What’s New** \r\n- New UI User Panel – Beta version \r\n- Snapshot Policy API \r\n- Tags API \r\n \r\n**Improvements** \r\n- Change the translation to \"borrar\" instead of Eliminar in Admin and user panel \r\n \r\n**Bug Fixes** \r\n- Template name not updated on instances list \r\n- Volume list action buttons not showing \r\n- Delete volume snapshot issue \r\n\r\n### Stackbill 2.04 Version Overview <span id=\"Stackbill-2.04-version-overview\"></span>\r\n\r\n**Stackbill 2.04**\r\nApril 28th, 2022 \r\n**What’s New** \r\n- Invoices do not reflect Stopped Resources. \r\n- Fixed payment or Pay as you go Based on User. \r\n- Recurring Snapshot API \r\n \r\n**Improvements** \r\n- Action button panel on secondary NICs \r\n- Remove the \"Make redundant\" option \r\n \r\n**Bugs** \r\n- VM detach and static NAT disable failed when deleted the corresponding VM \r\n- Create Volume Price displayed NAN value \r\n- PF and LB \"VIEW\" buttons on VPC not working \r\n- Error in the Template filter (Spanish only) \r\n\r\n\r\n### Stackbill 2.03 Version Overview <span id=\"Stackbill-2.03-version-overview\"></span>\r\n\r\n**Stackbill 2.03** \r\nFebruary 27th, 2022 \r\n**What’s New**\r\n- Reserved Instance Integration in Stackbill \r\n- Farsi Language Support \r\n- Role Privileges for Admin Users \r\n \r\n**Improvements** \r\n- API changes to Regenerate Tax Pending Status. \r\n- Custom field with search filter.\r\n\r\n**About Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**','\0','Release Notes','user-guide/getting-started/release-notes',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',64,'f6c14635-8eb5-4faa-81f1-a7751b1274c8',NULL,4,NULL,175,0,'cms_1274c8'),
(65,34,34,2,'2023-09-27 11:18:40','<h1>Overview</h1>\n<h2>Billing System in Stackbill (Cloud Management Portal) <span id=\"billing-system-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Stackbill</a></strong> instances are running on virtualized hardware. You can use them standalone or as part of larger, cloud-based infrastructures.</p>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/7a4f18cc971643dab4191121ca1012af.png\" width=\"70%\" /> \n<p><strong>Stackbill</strong> is a <strong>usage-based billing</strong> and chargeback solution that supports both <strong>postpaid and prepaid billing</strong>. It is also possible to <strong>generate the bill amount</strong> in your <strong>regional currency</strong>.</p>\n<h3>Billing Overview in Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Billing</strong> dropdown button below the <strong>Monitoring</strong> icon, Which is available in the top left corner. from the dropdown, Click on <strong>Overview</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/3deacd5022ba4612a9d2589809f49a06.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>The <strong>Billing overview</strong> screen appears.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/cdaf765448b148c693d8dc8e545fd0b6.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>In this section, user can able to see <strong>detailed information</strong> from the right-side dashboard about <strong>how many resources have been consumed</strong>. The <strong>left side graph</strong> indicates the <strong>actual month\'s usage</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/82197baaa4974870968ba38089ac30b0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Billing notification menu, here you can see the total usage of virtual resources and due date, and the status of the payment</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>To <strong>set a budget</strong> for your virtual resource usage, use the <strong>budget alert menu</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/3b89902ec7e14cb8a15af8d930c0091e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>The Budget alert</strong> can be set by clicking the <strong>Setup alert</strong> option in the menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/4699b1edeec5450e898074c7eb6ee1a6.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<p><strong>The option to set up a budget alert screen appears</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Enter the amount</strong> - The amount to be utilized for a month for your virtual resource can be set here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Email recipients</strong> - Enter the <strong>email address of the person</strong> who should <strong>receive alerts</strong> here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Finally, Now you have set your <strong>Budget alert for your resources</strong>, by clicking on <strong>Save button</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Overview\n\n\n## Billing System in Stackbill (Cloud Management Portal) <span id=\"billing-system-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n**[Stackbill](https://localhost:8080/)** instances are running on virtualized hardware. You can use them standalone or as part of larger, cloud-based infrastructures.\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/7a4f18cc971643dab4191121ca1012af.png\" width=\"70%\" /> \n\n\n**Stackbill** is a **usage-based billing** and chargeback solution that supports both **postpaid and prepaid billing**. It is also possible to **generate the bill amount** in your **regional currency**.\n\n\n### Billing Overview in Stackbill \n\n- Click on the **Billing** dropdown button below the **Monitoring** icon, Which is available in the top left corner. from the dropdown, Click on **Overview**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/3deacd5022ba4612a9d2589809f49a06.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- The **Billing overview** screen appears.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/cdaf765448b148c693d8dc8e545fd0b6.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- In this section, user can able to see **detailed information** from the right-side dashboard about **how many resources have been consumed**. The **left side graph** indicates the **actual month\'s usage**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/82197baaa4974870968ba38089ac30b0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Billing notification menu, here you can see the total usage of virtual resources and due date, and the status of the payment**\n\n- To **set a budget** for your virtual resource usage, use the **budget alert menu**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/3b89902ec7e14cb8a15af8d930c0091e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n-  **The Budget alert** can be set by clicking the **Setup alert** option in the menu. \n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/4699b1edeec5450e898074c7eb6ee1a6.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n\n**The option to set up a budget alert screen appears**\n\n- **Enter the amount** - The amount to be utilized for a month for your virtual resource can be set here.\n\n- **Email recipients** - Enter the **email address of the person** who should **receive alerts** here.\n- Finally, Now you have set your **Budget alert for your resources**, by clicking on **Save button**.  \n\n-----------------------------------------------------\n\n\n**About Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**','','Overview','user-guide/billing/overview',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',65,'7a7665ad-e865-4c00-bc90-0f5a0fd2ff9b',NULL,2,'Cloud Billing Solution',175,0,'cms_d2ff9b'),
(66,35,34,2,'2023-09-27 11:22:14','<h1>Descripción general</h1>\n<h2>Sistema de facturación en Stackbill (Portal de gestión de la nube)<span id=\"billing-system-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Stackbill</a></strong> las instancias se ejecutan en hardware virtualizado. Puede utilizarlos de forma independiente o como parte de infraestructuras más grandes basadas en la nube.</p>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/7a4f18cc971643dab4191121ca1012af.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<p><strong>Stackbill</strong> es una solución de <strong>facturación basada en el uso</strong> y contracargo que admite <strong>facturación pospago y prepago</strong>. También es posible <strong>generar el monto de la factura</strong> en su <strong>moneda regional</strong>.</p>\n<h3>Descripción general de facturación en Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Haga clic en el botón desplegable <strong>Facturación</strong> debajo del ícono <strong>Monitoreo</strong>, que está disponible en la esquina superior izquierda. En el menú desplegable, haga clic en <strong>Descripción general</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/3deacd5022ba4612a9d2589809f49a06.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aparece la pantalla <strong>Resumen de facturación</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/cdaf765448b148c693d8dc8e545fd0b6.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>En esta sección, el usuario puede ver <strong>información detallada</strong> desde el panel del lado derecho sobre <strong>cuántos recursos se han consumido</strong>. El <strong>gráfico del lado izquierdo</strong> indica el <strong>uso mensual real</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/82197baaa4974870968ba38089ac30b0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Menú de notificación de facturación, aquí puedes ver el uso total de los recursos virtuales y la fecha de vencimiento, y el estado del pago</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Para <strong>establecer un presupuesto</strong> para el uso de sus recursos virtuales, utilice el <strong>menú de alerta de presupuesto</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/3b89902ec7e14cb8a15af8d930c0091e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>La alerta de presupuesto</strong> se puede configurar haciendo clic en la opción <strong>Configurar alerta</strong> en el menú.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/4699b1edeec5450e898074c7eb6ee1a6.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<p><strong>Aparece la opción para configurar una pantalla de alerta de presupuesto</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Ingrese el monto</strong> - El monto que se utilizará durante un mes para su recurso virtual se puede configurar aquí.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Destinatarios de correo electrónico</strong> - Introduzca aquí la <strong>dirección de correo electrónico de la persona</strong> que debe <strong>recibir alertas</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Finalmente, ahora ha configurado su <strong>Alerta de presupuesto para sus recursos</strong>, haciendo clic en el <strong>botón Guardar</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gestión de Nubes</a> con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Descripción general\n\n\n## Sistema de facturación en Stackbill (Portal de gestión de la nube)<span id=\"billing-system-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n**[Stackbill](https://localhost:8080/)** las instancias se ejecutan en hardware virtualizado. Puede utilizarlos de forma independiente o como parte de infraestructuras más grandes basadas en la nube.\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/7a4f18cc971643dab4191121ca1012af.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n\n\n**Stackbill** es una solución de **facturación basada en el uso** y contracargo que admite **facturación pospago y prepago**. También es posible **generar el monto de la factura** en su **moneda regional**.\n\n\n### Descripción general de facturación en Stackbill \n\n- Haga clic en el botón desplegable **Facturación** debajo del ícono **Monitoreo**, que está disponible en la esquina superior izquierda. En el menú desplegable, haga clic en **Descripción general**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/3deacd5022ba4612a9d2589809f49a06.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Aparece la pantalla **Resumen de facturación**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/cdaf765448b148c693d8dc8e545fd0b6.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- En esta sección, el usuario puede ver **información detallada** desde el panel del lado derecho sobre **cuántos recursos se han consumido**. El **gráfico del lado izquierdo** indica el **uso mensual real**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/82197baaa4974870968ba38089ac30b0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Menú de notificación de facturación, aquí puedes ver el uso total de los recursos virtuales y la fecha de vencimiento, y el estado del pago**\n\n- Para **establecer un presupuesto** para el uso de sus recursos virtuales, utilice el **menú de alerta de presupuesto**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/3b89902ec7e14cb8a15af8d930c0091e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- **La alerta de presupuesto** se puede configurar haciendo clic en la opción **Configurar alerta** en el menú.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/4699b1edeec5450e898074c7eb6ee1a6.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n\n**Aparece la opción para configurar una pantalla de alerta de presupuesto**\n\n- **Ingrese el monto** - El monto que se utilizará durante un mes para su recurso virtual se puede configurar aquí.\n\n- **Destinatarios de correo electrónico** - Introduzca aquí la **dirección de correo electrónico de la persona** que debe **recibir alertas**.\n- Finalmente, ahora ha configurado su **Alerta de presupuesto para sus recursos**, haciendo clic en el **botón Guardar**.\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo [Portal de Gestión de Nubes](https://localhost:8080/) con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.**','','Descripción general','guía-del-usuario/facturación/descripci-n-general',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',65,'75fcff0d-3af6-432c-a033-46f268f4617c',NULL,2,'Solución de facturación en la nube',175,0,'cms_f4617c'),
(67,36,34,2,'2023-09-27 11:23:08','<h1>Visão geral</h1>\n<h2>Sistema de faturamento no Stackbill (portal de gerenciamento de nuvem) <span id=\"billing-system-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Stackbill</a></strong> instâncias estão sendo executadas em hardware virtualizado. Você pode usá-los de forma independente ou como parte de infraestruturas maiores baseadas em nuvem.</p>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/7a4f18cc971643dab4191121ca1012af.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<p><strong>Stackbill</strong> é uma solução de <strong>faturamento com base no uso</strong> e estorno que suporta <strong>faturamento pós-pago e pré-pago</strong>. Também é possível <strong>gerar o valor da fatura</strong> na sua <strong>moeda regional</strong>.</p>\n<h3>Visão geral do faturamento no Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Clique no botão suspenso <strong>Faturamento</strong> abaixo do ícone <strong>Monitoramento</strong>, que está disponível no canto superior esquerdo. no menu suspenso, clique em <strong>Visão geral</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/3deacd5022ba4612a9d2589809f49a06.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>A tela <strong>Visão geral do faturamento</strong> é exibida.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/cdaf765448b148c693d8dc8e545fd0b6.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Nesta seção, o usuário pode ver <strong>informações detalhadas</strong> no painel do lado direito sobre <strong>quantos recursos foram consumidos</strong>. O <strong>gráfico do lado esquerdo</strong> indica o <strong>uso real do mês</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/82197baaa4974870968ba38089ac30b0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Menu de notificação de cobrança, aqui você pode ver a utilização total de recursos virtuais e data de vencimento, além do status do pagamento</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Para <strong>definir um orçamento</strong> para o uso de recursos virtuais, use o <strong>menu de alerta de orçamento</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/3b89902ec7e14cb8a15af8d930c0091e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>O alerta de orçamento</strong> pode ser definido clicando na opção <strong>Configurar alerta</strong> no menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/4699b1edeec5450e898074c7eb6ee1a6.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<p><strong>A opção para configurar uma tela de alerta de orçamento é exibida</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Insira o valor</strong> - O valor a ser utilizado por um mês para o seu recurso virtual pode ser definido aqui.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Destinatários de e-mail</strong> - Digite o <strong>endereço de e-mail da pessoa</strong> que deve <strong>receber alertas</strong> aqui.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Por fim, agora você definiu seu <strong>Alerta de orçamento para seus recursos</strong>, clicando no <strong>Botão Salvar</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens</a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Visão geral\n\n\n## Sistema de faturamento no Stackbill (portal de gerenciamento de nuvem) <span id=\"billing-system-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n**[Stackbill](https://localhost:8080/)** instâncias estão sendo executadas em hardware virtualizado. Você pode usá-los de forma independente ou como parte de infraestruturas maiores baseadas em nuvem.\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/7a4f18cc971643dab4191121ca1012af.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n\n\n**Stackbill** é uma solução de **faturamento com base no uso** e estorno que suporta **faturamento pós-pago e pré-pago**. Também é possível **gerar o valor da fatura** na sua **moeda regional**.\n\n\n### Visão geral do faturamento no Stackbill \n\n- Clique no botão suspenso **Faturamento** abaixo do ícone **Monitoramento**, que está disponível no canto superior esquerdo. no menu suspenso, clique em **Visão geral**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/3deacd5022ba4612a9d2589809f49a06.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- A tela **Visão geral do faturamento** é exibida.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/cdaf765448b148c693d8dc8e545fd0b6.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Nesta seção, o usuário pode ver **informações detalhadas** no painel do lado direito sobre **quantos recursos foram consumidos**. O **gráfico do lado esquerdo** indica o **uso real do mês**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/82197baaa4974870968ba38089ac30b0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Menu de notificação de cobrança, aqui você pode ver a utilização total de recursos virtuais e data de vencimento, além do status do pagamento**\n\n- Para **definir um orçamento** para o uso de recursos virtuais, use o **menu de alerta de orçamento**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/3b89902ec7e14cb8a15af8d930c0091e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- **O alerta de orçamento** pode ser definido clicando na opção **Configurar alerta** no menu.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/4699b1edeec5450e898074c7eb6ee1a6.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n\n**A opção para configurar uma tela de alerta de orçamento é exibida**\n\n- **Insira o valor** - O valor a ser utilizado por um mês para o seu recurso virtual pode ser definido aqui.\n\n- **Destinatários de e-mail** - Digite o **endereço de e-mail da pessoa** que deve **receber alertas** aqui.\n- Por fim, agora você definiu seu **Alerta de orçamento para seus recursos**, clicando no **Botão Salvar**.\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Sobre Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo [Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.**','','Visão geral','guia-de-usuario/cobrança/vis-o-geral',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',65,'e1ca12c2-277f-4608-a1e1-4feb65fa4dcf',NULL,2,'Solução de faturamento na nuvem',175,0,'cms_fa4dcf'),
(68,2,1,2,'2023-09-27 11:24:20','<h1>Notas de la Versión</h1>\n<h2>Resumen de la Versión del Portal de Gestión en la Nube Stackbill</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Stackbill</strong></a> es un Portal de Gestión en la Nube completo y autoservicio con amplias características que aprovecha <strong>Apache CloudStack®</strong> con años de experiencia de vanguardia.</p>\n<p><strong></strong> Para <strong>Centros de Datos</strong> | <strong>Empresas</strong> | <strong>Proveedores de Telecomunicaciones y Servicios en la Nube</strong>.</p>\n<p>Las notas de lanzamiento de la plataforma en la nube Stackbill rastrean mejoras incrementales y lanzamientos importantes.</p>\n<h3>Resumen de la Versión 3.1.1 del Portal de Gestión en la Nube Stackbill</h3>\n<p>Stackbill 3.1.1 - 3 de agosto de 2023</p>\n<p><strong>Novedades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Envío de correos electrónicos de notificación al administrador cada vez que un nuevo usuario se registra.</li>\n<li>Envío de correos electrónicos de notificación al administrador cuando un usuario crea o elimina una máquina virtual (VM).</li>\n<li>Integración de un sistema de servicio de asistencia para brindar soporte y ayuda a los usuarios.</li>\n<li>Opción de mostrar sus enlaces de redes sociales en el pie de página.</li>\n<li>Opción de mostrar sus enlaces en el pie de página.</li>\n<li>Función de Subdominio añadida.</li>\n<li>Preguntas frecuentes.</li>\n<li>Slider en la página de inicio de sesión.</li>\n<li>Facturación para aplicaciones del mercado.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mejoras</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mejoras en la interfaz de usuario de la pantalla de creación de instancias.</li>\n<li>Nuevas pantallas de administrador en la Nueva IU.</li>\n<li>Mejoras en las páginas de lista.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Correcciones de Errores</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Se corrigió el problema de visualización incorrecta del enlace de configuración de pago en la página del panel de control.</li>\n<li>Se solucionó el problema de que el menú de retroceso en la facturación para las aplicaciones del mercado no funcionaba.</li>\n<li>Se solucionó el problema de la página en blanco en la navegación de inicio del breadcrumb.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Resumen de la Versión 3.02 del Portal de Gestión en la Nube Stackbill <span id=\"Visión-general-de-la-versión-3.02-del-Portal-de-Gestión-en-la-Nube-de-Stackbill\"></span></h3>\n<p>Stackbill 3.02 - 15 de septiembre de 2022</p>\n<p><strong>Novedades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Nueva IU: mejoras en el panel de control, reorganización del menú lateral, cambios en la página de resumen de VM y diseño del perfil de usuario.</li>\n<li>Integración de pagos Mobbex y Acqio.</li>\n<li>Opción de descarga añadida para facturas en borrador.</li>\n<li>Opción de exportar detalles de clientes.</li>\n<li>Correo de notificación añadido para acciones fallidas de VM.</li>\n<li>Validación única de correo electrónico añadida en la sincronización manual de usuarios de ACS.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mejoras</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Actualización de la traducción de idiomas.</li>\n<li>Registro de nuevos usuarios sin configuración de pago.</li>\n<li>Validación duplicada de números de teléfono móvil.</li>\n<li>Cambio del mensaje de error de Cloudstack a un formato legible por humanos.</li>\n<li>Carga de imagen de perfil.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Correcciones de Errores</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Se solucionó el problema de costo en el panel de control de cuentas prepagadas.</li>\n<li>Se corrigió el problema de redondeo de lugares decimales.</li>\n<li>Se solucionó el problema de referencia de objeto inexistente al habilitar el monitoreo avanzado.</li>\n<li>Se corrigió el problema de desajuste de métricas de uso de volumen en ACS.</li>\n<li>Se solucionó el problema de utilización de CPU en la página de lista de VM.</li>\n<li>No se puede crear una VM utilizando una plantilla ISO.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Resumen de la Versión 3.01 del Portal de Gestión en la Nube Stackbill <span id=\"Visión-general-de-la-versión-3.01-de-Stackbill\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Stackbill 3.01</strong>\n6 de agosto de 2022</p>\n<p><strong>Novedades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Actualización de ACS 4.16 y verificación de compatibilidad en <strong>Stackbill</strong>.</li>\n<li>Integración de configuración de VM.</li>\n<li>Integración de Vault HashiCorp para quejas sobre claves de usuario.</li>\n<li>Actualización automática de monitoreo avanzado.</li>\n<li>Configuración de alerta de presupuesto del cliente.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mejoras</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lentitud en la creación de reglas de reenvío de puertos.</li>\n<li>Problema de lentitud en la generación de informes.</li>\n<li>Exclusión de uso diario para una cuenta suspendida.</li>\n<li>Actualización de API de uso externo.</li>\n<li>Problema de comunicación de WebSocket en conexiones de red lentas.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Correcciones de Errores</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Se solucionó el problema de visualización duplicada de VM.</li>\n<li>Se corrigió el problema de flujo de eliminación de cuenta.</li>\n<li>La política de instantáneas recurrentes no pudo eliminar la instantánea más antigua.</li>\n<li>Problema de VM que ya existe al crear una instancia desde una API externa.</li>\n<li>Se solucionó el problema de zona horaria en la configuración de programación de VM.</li>\n<li>Error al redimensionar el volumen raíz a través de una API externa.</li>\n<li>Deshabilitar la opción de edición de correo electrónico principal.</li>\n<li>Problema de cargador de VM solucionado.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Resumen de la Versión 3.00 del Portal de Gestión en la Nube Stackbill <span id=\"Visión-general-de-la-versión-3.00-de-Stackbill\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Stackbill 3.00</strong>\n10 de junio de 2022</p>\n<p><strong>Novedades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Panel de usuario de nueva IU - Versión beta.</li>\n<li>API de política de instantáneas.</li>\n<li>API de etiquetas.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mejoras</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cambio de la traducción a &quot;borrar&quot; en lugar de &quot;Eliminar&quot; en el panel de administración y usuario.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Correcciones de Errores</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>El nombre de la plantilla no se actualizó en la lista de instancias.</li>\n<li>Los botones de acción de lista de volúmenes no se muestran.</li>\n<li>Problema de eliminación de instantánea de volumen solucionado.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Resumen de la Versión Stackbill 2.04 <span id=\"Visión-general-de-la-versión-2.04-de-Stackbill\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Stackbill 2.04</strong>\n28 de abril de 2022\n<strong>Novedades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Las facturas no reflejan Recursos Detenidos.</li>\n<li>Corrección de pago basado en el usuario o Pago por Uso.</li>\n<li>API de Instantáneas Recurrentes.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mejoras</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Panel de botones de acción en NICs secundarias.</li>\n<li>Eliminada la opción &quot;Hacer redundante&quot;.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Errores</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Falla al desvincular una VM y deshabilitar NAT estático al eliminar la VM correspondiente.</li>\n<li>Valor &quot;NAN&quot; mostrado al crear un Volumen de Precio.</li>\n<li>Los botones &quot;VER&quot; de PF y LB en VPC no funcionan.</li>\n<li>Error en el filtro de plantillas (solo en español).</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Resumen de la Versión Stackbill 2.03 <span id=\"Visión-general-de-la-versión-2.03-de-Stackbill\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Stackbill 2.03</strong>\n27 de febrero de 2022\n<strong>Novedades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Integración de Instancias Reservadas en Stackbill.</li>\n<li>Soporte de idioma Farsi.</li>\n<li>Privilegios de Rol para Usuarios Administradores.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mejoras</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cambios en la API para Regenerar el Estado de Impuestos Pendientes.</li>\n<li>Campo personalizado con filtro de búsqueda.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gestión de Nubes</a> con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.</strong></p>\n','',2,'\r\n# Notas de la Versión\r\n\r\n## Resumen de la Versión del Portal de Gestión en la Nube Stackbill\r\n\r\n[**Stackbill**](https://localhost:8080/) es un Portal de Gestión en la Nube completo y autoservicio con amplias características que aprovecha **Apache CloudStack®** con años de experiencia de vanguardia.\r\n\r\n**** Para **Centros de Datos** | **Empresas** | **Proveedores de Telecomunicaciones y Servicios en la Nube**.\r\n\r\nLas notas de lanzamiento de la plataforma en la nube Stackbill rastrean mejoras incrementales y lanzamientos importantes.\r\n\r\n### Resumen de la Versión 3.1.1 del Portal de Gestión en la Nube Stackbill\r\n\r\nStackbill 3.1.1 - 3 de agosto de 2023\r\n\r\n**Novedades**\r\n- Envío de correos electrónicos de notificación al administrador cada vez que un nuevo usuario se registra.\r\n- Envío de correos electrónicos de notificación al administrador cuando un usuario crea o elimina una máquina virtual (VM).\r\n- Integración de un sistema de servicio de asistencia para brindar soporte y ayuda a los usuarios.\r\n- Opción de mostrar sus enlaces de redes sociales en el pie de página.\r\n- Opción de mostrar sus enlaces en el pie de página.\r\n- Función de Subdominio añadida.\r\n- Preguntas frecuentes.\r\n- Slider en la página de inicio de sesión.\r\n- Facturación para aplicaciones del mercado.\r\n\r\n**Mejoras**\r\n- Mejoras en la interfaz de usuario de la pantalla de creación de instancias.\r\n- Nuevas pantallas de administrador en la Nueva IU.\r\n- Mejoras en las páginas de lista.\r\n\r\n**Correcciones de Errores**\r\n- Se corrigió el problema de visualización incorrecta del enlace de configuración de pago en la página del panel de control.\r\n- Se solucionó el problema de que el menú de retroceso en la facturación para las aplicaciones del mercado no funcionaba.\r\n- Se solucionó el problema de la página en blanco en la navegación de inicio del breadcrumb.\r\n\r\n### Resumen de la Versión 3.02 del Portal de Gestión en la Nube Stackbill <span id=\"Visión-general-de-la-versión-3.02-del-Portal-de-Gestión-en-la-Nube-de-Stackbill\"></span>\r\n\r\nStackbill 3.02 - 15 de septiembre de 2022\r\n\r\n**Novedades**\r\n- Nueva IU: mejoras en el panel de control, reorganización del menú lateral, cambios en la página de resumen de VM y diseño del perfil de usuario.\r\n- Integración de pagos Mobbex y Acqio.\r\n- Opción de descarga añadida para facturas en borrador.\r\n- Opción de exportar detalles de clientes.\r\n- Correo de notificación añadido para acciones fallidas de VM.\r\n- Validación única de correo electrónico añadida en la sincronización manual de usuarios de ACS.\r\n\r\n**Mejoras**\r\n- Actualización de la traducción de idiomas.\r\n- Registro de nuevos usuarios sin configuración de pago.\r\n- Validación duplicada de números de teléfono móvil.\r\n- Cambio del mensaje de error de Cloudstack a un formato legible por humanos.\r\n- Carga de imagen de perfil.\r\n\r\n**Correcciones de Errores**\r\n- Se solucionó el problema de costo en el panel de control de cuentas prepagadas.\r\n- Se corrigió el problema de redondeo de lugares decimales.\r\n- Se solucionó el problema de referencia de objeto inexistente al habilitar el monitoreo avanzado.\r\n- Se corrigió el problema de desajuste de métricas de uso de volumen en ACS.\r\n- Se solucionó el problema de utilización de CPU en la página de lista de VM.\r\n- No se puede crear una VM utilizando una plantilla ISO.\r\n\r\n### Resumen de la Versión 3.01 del Portal de Gestión en la Nube Stackbill <span id=\"Visión-general-de-la-versión-3.01-de-Stackbill\"></span>\r\n\r\n**Stackbill 3.01**\r\n6 de agosto de 2022\r\n\r\n**Novedades**\r\n- Actualización de ACS 4.16 y verificación de compatibilidad en **Stackbill**.\r\n- Integración de configuración de VM.\r\n- Integración de Vault HashiCorp para quejas sobre claves de usuario.\r\n- Actualización automática de monitoreo avanzado.\r\n- Configuración de alerta de presupuesto del cliente.\r\n\r\n**Mejoras**\r\n- Lentitud en la creación de reglas de reenvío de puertos.\r\n- Problema de lentitud en la generación de informes.\r\n- Exclusión de uso diario para una cuenta suspendida.\r\n- Actualización de API de uso externo.\r\n- Problema de comunicación de WebSocket en conexiones de red lentas.\r\n\r\n**Correcciones de Errores**\r\n- Se solucionó el problema de visualización duplicada de VM.\r\n- Se corrigió el problema de flujo de eliminación de cuenta.\r\n- La política de instantáneas recurrentes no pudo eliminar la instantánea más antigua.\r\n- Problema de VM que ya existe al crear una instancia desde una API externa.\r\n- Se solucionó el problema de zona horaria en la configuración de programación de VM.\r\n- Error al redimensionar el volumen raíz a través de una API externa.\r\n- Deshabilitar la opción de edición de correo electrónico principal.\r\n- Problema de cargador de VM solucionado.\r\n\r\n### Resumen de la Versión 3.00 del Portal de Gestión en la Nube Stackbill <span id=\"Visión-general-de-la-versión-3.00-de-Stackbill\"></span>\r\n\r\n**Stackbill 3.00**\r\n10 de junio de 2022\r\n\r\n**Novedades**\r\n- Panel de usuario de nueva IU - Versión beta.\r\n- API de política de instantáneas.\r\n- API de etiquetas.\r\n\r\n**Mejoras**\r\n- Cambio de la traducción a \"borrar\" en lugar de \"Eliminar\" en el panel de administración y usuario.\r\n\r\n**Correcciones de Errores**\r\n- El nombre de la plantilla no se actualizó en la lista de instancias.\r\n- Los botones de acción de lista de volúmenes no se muestran.\r\n- Problema de eliminación de instantánea de volumen solucionado.\r\n\r\n### Resumen de la Versión Stackbill 2.04 <span id=\"Visión-general-de-la-versión-2.04-de-Stackbill\"></span>\r\n\r\n**Stackbill 2.04**\r\n28 de abril de 2022\r\n**Novedades**\r\n- Las facturas no reflejan Recursos Detenidos.\r\n- Corrección de pago basado en el usuario o Pago por Uso.\r\n- API de Instantáneas Recurrentes.\r\n\r\n**Mejoras**\r\n- Panel de botones de acción en NICs secundarias.\r\n- Eliminada la opción \"Hacer redundante\".\r\n\r\n**Errores**\r\n- Falla al desvincular una VM y deshabilitar NAT estático al eliminar la VM correspondiente.\r\n- Valor \"NAN\" mostrado al crear un Volumen de Precio.\r\n- Los botones \"VER\" de PF y LB en VPC no funcionan.\r\n- Error en el filtro de plantillas (solo en español).\r\n\r\n### Resumen de la Versión Stackbill 2.03 <span id=\"Visión-general-de-la-versión-2.03-de-Stackbill\"></span>\r\n\r\n**Stackbill 2.03**\r\n27 de febrero de 2022\r\n**Novedades**\r\n- Integración de Instancias Reservadas en Stackbill.\r\n- Soporte de idioma Farsi.\r\n- Privilegios de Rol para Usuarios Administradores.\r\n\r\n**Mejoras**\r\n- Cambios en la API para Regenerar el Estado de Impuestos Pendientes.\r\n- Campo personalizado con filtro de búsqueda.\r\n\r\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo [Portal de Gestión de Nubes](https://localhost:8080/) con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.**','\0','Notas de lanzamiento','guía-del-usuario/empezando/notas-de-lanzamiento',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',64,'40e01af7-2e5a-4900-98ac-d7f029deeadc',NULL,4,NULL,175,0,'cms_deeadc'),
(69,34,34,2,'2023-09-27 11:32:22','<h1>Cost Explorer</h1>\n<h2>Cost &amp; Usage Reports in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal <span id=\"cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Billing</strong> dropdown button below the <strong>Monitoring</strong> icon, Which is available in the top left corner. from the dropdown, Click on <strong>Cost explorer</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/6390b1233d324e17a7d6cb33a9477ca9.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cost explorer</strong> option appears on the screen.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/1072ba57a2c84678a10e89556ba085a8.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Usage Explorer</strong> - A detailed view of the usage of a particular month can be accessed here.</li>\n<li>At the right side of the panel there is a option to download the usage report.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/8b3bf9054cb04743906b6d75df45901f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>An overview of the particular resources used by the user is displayed here.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Cost Explorer\n\n\n## Cost & Usage Reports in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal <span id=\"cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n- Click on the **Billing** dropdown button below the **Monitoring** icon, Which is available in the top left corner. from the dropdown, Click on **Cost explorer**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/6390b1233d324e17a7d6cb33a9477ca9.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Cost explorer** option appears on the screen.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/1072ba57a2c84678a10e89556ba085a8.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Usage Explorer** - A detailed view of the usage of a particular month can be accessed here.\n- At the right side of the panel there is a option to download the usage report.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/8b3bf9054cb04743906b6d75df45901f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- An overview of the particular resources used by the user is displayed here.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------\n\n\n**About Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**','\0','Cost Explorer','user-guide/billing/cost-explorer',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',69,'fd153f0a-fc84-401f-a604-e322ab115b1f',NULL,3,NULL,175,0,'cms_115b1f'),
(70,3,1,2,'2023-09-27 11:32:35','<h1>Notas de Lançamento</h1>\n<h2>Visão Geral da Versão do Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem Stackbill</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Stackbill</strong></a> é um Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem auto-serviço completo e intuitivo com recursos extensivos que aproveitam o <strong>Apache CloudStack®</strong> com anos de expertise em estado da arte.</p>\n<p><strong></strong> para <strong>Datacenters</strong> | <strong>Empresas</strong> | <strong>Provedores de Telecomunicações e Serviços de Nuvem</strong>.</p>\n<p>As notas de lançamento da plataforma de nuvem Stackbill acompanham as melhorias incrementais e os principais lançamentos.</p>\n<h3>Visão Geral da Versão Stackbill Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem 3.1.1</h3>\n<p>Stackbill 3.1.1 - 3 de agosto de 2023</p>\n<p><strong>Novidades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Envio de e-mails de notificação para o administrador sempre que um novo usuário se cadastra.</li>\n<li>Envio de e-mails de notificação para o administrador quando um usuário cria ou exclui uma máquina virtual (VM).</li>\n<li>Integração de um sistema de helpdesk para fornecer suporte e assistência aos usuários.</li>\n<li>Opção de exibir os links das redes sociais no rodapé.</li>\n<li>Opção de exibir os links do rodapé.</li>\n<li>Recurso de Subdomínio adicionado.</li>\n<li>FAQ (Perguntas Frequentes).</li>\n<li>Slider na Página de Login.</li>\n<li>Faturamento para aplicativos de Marketplace.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Melhorias</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Melhorias na interface da tela de criação de instâncias.</li>\n<li>Telas Admin NewUI.</li>\n<li>Melhorias nas páginas de lista.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Correções de Bugs</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corrigido o problema em que o link de Configuração de Pagamento estava sendo exibido erroneamente na página do Painel.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o problema do menu de retrocesso não funcionando na página de Compra de Planos de Economia de Faturamento.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o problema de navegação em branco na página inicial ao clicar em &quot;Home&quot;.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Visão Geral da Versão Stackbill Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem 3.02 <span id=\"Visão-geral-da-versão-3.02-do-Portal-de-Gerenciamento-de-Nuvem-do-Stackbill\"></span></h3>\n<p>Stackbill 3.02 - 15 de setembro de 2022</p>\n<p><strong>Novidades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Nova IU - Melhoria no Painel, reorganização do menu à esquerda, alterações no design da página de resumo de VM e perfil do usuário.</li>\n<li>Integração de pagamento Mobbex e Acqio.</li>\n<li>Adição da opção de download para faturas em rascunho.</li>\n<li>Opção de exportar detalhes do cliente.</li>\n<li>Adição de e-mail de notificação para ação falha na VM.</li>\n<li>Validação única de e-mail adicionada na sincronização manual do usuário ACS.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Melhorias</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Atualização da tradução de idiomas.</li>\n<li>Cadastro de novo usuário sem configuração de pagamento.</li>\n<li>Validação de número de celular duplicado.</li>\n<li>Mensagem de erro do Cloudstack alterada para um formato legível.</li>\n<li>Upload de imagem de perfil.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Correções de Bugs</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corrigido o problema de custo no painel de conta pré-paga.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o problema de arredondamento de casas decimais.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o problema de referência ausente ao habilitar o monitoramento avançado.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o problema de design de plano de economia de instância reservada.</li>\n<li>Corrigida a inconsistência nas métricas de uso de volume do ACS.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o problema de utilização da CPU na página de lista de VM.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o problema de criação de VM usando um modelo ISO.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Visão Geral da Versão Stackbill 3.01 <span id=\"Visão-geral-da-versão-3.01-do-Stackbill\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Stackbill 3.01</strong>\n6 de agosto de 2022</p>\n<p><strong>Novidades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Atualização para ACS 4.16 e verificação de compatibilidade no <strong>Stackbill</strong>.</li>\n<li>Integração de configurações da VM.</li>\n<li>Integração do HashiCorp Vault para reclamações de chave de usuário.</li>\n<li>Atualização automática do monitoramento avançado.</li>\n<li>Configuração de alerta de orçamento do cliente.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Melhorias</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lentidão na criação de regras de encaminhamento de portas.</li>\n<li>Problema de lentidão na geração de relatórios.</li>\n<li>Exclusão do uso diário para uma conta suspensa.</li>\n<li>Atualização da API de uso externo.</li>\n<li>Problema de comunicação WebSocket em conexões de rede lentas.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Correções de Bugs</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corrigido o problema de exibição duplicada de VM.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o problema no fluxo de exclusão de conta.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o problema em que a política de instantâneo recorrente falhava ao excluir o instantâneo mais antigo.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o problema de &quot;VM já existe&quot; ao criar uma instância a partir de uma API externa.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o problema de fuso horário na configuração do agendamento de VM.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o erro ao redimensionar o volume raiz por meio de uma API externa.</li>\n<li>Desativada a opção de edição do e-mail principal.</li>\n<li>Corrigido o problema de carregamento de VM.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Visão Geral da Versão Stackbill 3.00 <span id=\"Visão-geral-da-versão-3.00-do-Stackbill\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Stackbill 3.00</strong>\n10 de junho de 2022</p>\n<p><strong>Novidades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Nova IU Painel do Usuário - Versão Beta.</li>\n<li>API de Política de Instantâneo.</li>\n<li>API de Tags.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Melhorias</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Alteração da tradução para &quot;borrar&quot; em vez de &quot;Eliminar&quot; no painel de administração e do usuário.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Correções de Bugs</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Nome do modelo não atualizado na lista de instâncias.</li>\n<li>Botões de ação da lista de volumes não sendo exibidos.</li>\n<li>Problema de exclusão de instantâneo de volume corrigido.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Visão Geral da Versão Stackbill 2.04 <span id=\"notas-de-versão#Visão-geral-da-versão-2.04-do-Stackbill\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Stackbill 2.04</strong>\n28 de abril de 2022\n<strong>Novidades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Faturas não refletem Recursos Parados.</li>\n<li>Pagamento Fixo ou Pague Conforme o Uso com Base no Usuário.</li>\n<li>API de Instantâneas Recorrentes</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Melhorias</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Painel de botões de ação em NICs secundárias</li>\n<li>Remoção da opção &quot;Tornar redundante&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bugs</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Falha na desvinculação de VM e desativação de NAT estático ao excluir a VM correspondente</li>\n<li>Valor &quot;NAN&quot; exibido ao criar o Preço do Volume</li>\n<li>Botões &quot;VER&quot; de PF e LB em VPC não funcionam</li>\n<li>Erro no filtro de Modelos (Apenas em Espanhol)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Visão Geral da Versão Stackbill 2.03 <span id=\"Visão-geral-da-versão-2.03-do-Stackbill\"></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Stackbill 2.03</strong>\n27 de fevereiro de 2022\n<strong>Novidades</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Integração de Instâncias Reservadas no Stackbill</li>\n<li>Suporte ao Idioma Farsi</li>\n<li>Privilégios de Função para Usuários Administradores</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Melhorias</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mudanças na API para Regenerar o Status Pendente de Impostos.</li>\n<li>Campo Personalizado com Filtro de Pesquisa.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Sobre o Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens</a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'\r\n\r\n# Notas de Lançamento\r\n\r\n## Visão Geral da Versão do Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem Stackbill\r\n\r\n[**Stackbill**](https://localhost:8080/) é um Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem auto-serviço completo e intuitivo com recursos extensivos que aproveitam o **Apache CloudStack®** com anos de expertise em estado da arte.\r\n\r\n**** para **Datacenters** | **Empresas** | **Provedores de Telecomunicações e Serviços de Nuvem**.\r\n\r\nAs notas de lançamento da plataforma de nuvem Stackbill acompanham as melhorias incrementais e os principais lançamentos.\r\n\r\n### Visão Geral da Versão Stackbill Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem 3.1.1\r\n\r\nStackbill 3.1.1 - 3 de agosto de 2023\r\n\r\n**Novidades**\r\n- Envio de e-mails de notificação para o administrador sempre que um novo usuário se cadastra.\r\n- Envio de e-mails de notificação para o administrador quando um usuário cria ou exclui uma máquina virtual (VM).\r\n- Integração de um sistema de helpdesk para fornecer suporte e assistência aos usuários.\r\n- Opção de exibir os links das redes sociais no rodapé.\r\n- Opção de exibir os links do rodapé.\r\n- Recurso de Subdomínio adicionado.\r\n- FAQ (Perguntas Frequentes).\r\n- Slider na Página de Login.\r\n- Faturamento para aplicativos de Marketplace.\r\n\r\n**Melhorias**\r\n- Melhorias na interface da tela de criação de instâncias.\r\n- Telas Admin NewUI.\r\n- Melhorias nas páginas de lista.\r\n\r\n**Correções de Bugs**\r\n- Corrigido o problema em que o link de Configuração de Pagamento estava sendo exibido erroneamente na página do Painel.\r\n- Corrigido o problema do menu de retrocesso não funcionando na página de Compra de Planos de Economia de Faturamento.\r\n- Corrigido o problema de navegação em branco na página inicial ao clicar em \"Home\".\r\n\r\n### Visão Geral da Versão Stackbill Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem 3.02 <span id=\"Visão-geral-da-versão-3.02-do-Portal-de-Gerenciamento-de-Nuvem-do-Stackbill\"></span>\r\n\r\nStackbill 3.02 - 15 de setembro de 2022\r\n\r\n**Novidades**\r\n- Nova IU - Melhoria no Painel, reorganização do menu à esquerda, alterações no design da página de resumo de VM e perfil do usuário.\r\n- Integração de pagamento Mobbex e Acqio.\r\n- Adição da opção de download para faturas em rascunho.\r\n- Opção de exportar detalhes do cliente.\r\n- Adição de e-mail de notificação para ação falha na VM.\r\n- Validação única de e-mail adicionada na sincronização manual do usuário ACS.\r\n\r\n**Melhorias**\r\n- Atualização da tradução de idiomas.\r\n- Cadastro de novo usuário sem configuração de pagamento.\r\n- Validação de número de celular duplicado.\r\n- Mensagem de erro do Cloudstack alterada para um formato legível.\r\n- Upload de imagem de perfil.\r\n\r\n**Correções de Bugs**\r\n- Corrigido o problema de custo no painel de conta pré-paga.\r\n- Corrigido o problema de arredondamento de casas decimais.\r\n- Corrigido o problema de referência ausente ao habilitar o monitoramento avançado.\r\n- Corrigido o problema de design de plano de economia de instância reservada.\r\n- Corrigida a inconsistência nas métricas de uso de volume do ACS.\r\n- Corrigido o problema de utilização da CPU na página de lista de VM.\r\n- Corrigido o problema de criação de VM usando um modelo ISO.\r\n\r\n### Visão Geral da Versão Stackbill 3.01 <span id=\"Visão-geral-da-versão-3.01-do-Stackbill\"></span>\r\n\r\n**Stackbill 3.01**\r\n6 de agosto de 2022\r\n\r\n**Novidades**\r\n- Atualização para ACS 4.16 e verificação de compatibilidade no **Stackbill**.\r\n- Integração de configurações da VM.\r\n- Integração do HashiCorp Vault para reclamações de chave de usuário.\r\n- Atualização automática do monitoramento avançado.\r\n- Configuração de alerta de orçamento do cliente.\r\n\r\n**Melhorias**\r\n- Lentidão na criação de regras de encaminhamento de portas.\r\n- Problema de lentidão na geração de relatórios.\r\n- Exclusão do uso diário para uma conta suspensa.\r\n- Atualização da API de uso externo.\r\n- Problema de comunicação WebSocket em conexões de rede lentas.\r\n\r\n**Correções de Bugs**\r\n- Corrigido o problema de exibição duplicada de VM.\r\n- Corrigido o problema no fluxo de exclusão de conta.\r\n- Corrigido o problema em que a política de instantâneo recorrente falhava ao excluir o instantâneo mais antigo.\r\n- Corrigido o problema de \"VM já existe\" ao criar uma instância a partir de uma API externa.\r\n- Corrigido o problema de fuso horário na configuração do agendamento de VM.\r\n- Corrigido o erro ao redimensionar o volume raiz por meio de uma API externa.\r\n- Desativada a opção de edição do e-mail principal.\r\n- Corrigido o problema de carregamento de VM.\r\n\r\n### Visão Geral da Versão Stackbill 3.00 <span id=\"Visão-geral-da-versão-3.00-do-Stackbill\"></span>\r\n\r\n**Stackbill 3.00**\r\n10 de junho de 2022\r\n\r\n**Novidades**\r\n- Nova IU Painel do Usuário - Versão Beta.\r\n- API de Política de Instantâneo.\r\n- API de Tags.\r\n\r\n**Melhorias**\r\n- Alteração da tradução para \"borrar\" em vez de \"Eliminar\" no painel de administração e do usuário.\r\n\r\n**Correções de Bugs**\r\n- Nome do modelo não atualizado na lista de instâncias.\r\n- Botões de ação da lista de volumes não sendo exibidos.\r\n- Problema de exclusão de instantâneo de volume corrigido.\r\n\r\n### Visão Geral da Versão Stackbill 2.04 <span id=\"notas-de-versão#Visão-geral-da-versão-2.04-do-Stackbill\"></span>\r\n\r\n**Stackbill 2.04**\r\n28 de abril de 2022 \r\n**Novidades** \r\n- Faturas não refletem Recursos Parados. \r\n- Pagamento Fixo ou Pague Conforme o Uso com Base no Usuário. \r\n- API de Instantâneas Recorrentes \r\n \r\n**Melhorias** \r\n- Painel de botões de ação em NICs secundárias \r\n- Remoção da opção \"Tornar redundante\" \r\n \r\n**Bugs** \r\n- Falha na desvinculação de VM e desativação de NAT estático ao excluir a VM correspondente \r\n- Valor \"NAN\" exibido ao criar o Preço do Volume \r\n- Botões \"VER\" de PF e LB em VPC não funcionam \r\n- Erro no filtro de Modelos (Apenas em Espanhol) \r\n\r\n\r\n### Visão Geral da Versão Stackbill 2.03 <span id=\"Visão-geral-da-versão-2.03-do-Stackbill\"></span>\r\n \r\n**Stackbill 2.03** \r\n27 de fevereiro de 2022 \r\n**Novidades**\r\n- Integração de Instâncias Reservadas no Stackbill \r\n- Suporte ao Idioma Farsi \r\n- Privilégios de Função para Usuários Administradores \r\n \r\n**Melhorias** \r\n- Mudanças na API para Regenerar o Status Pendente de Impostos. \r\n- Campo Personalizado com Filtro de Pesquisa.\r\n\r\n**Sobre o Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo [Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.**','\0','Notas de versão','guia-de-usuario/começando/notas-de-vers-o',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',64,'dff55171-1d8a-4a8a-9012-4a2adf83d19d',NULL,4,NULL,175,0,'cms_83d19d'),
(71,35,34,2,'2023-09-27 11:33:13','<h1>Explorador de costos</h1>\n<h2>Informes de costo y uso en el portal de administración de la nube Stackbill <span id=\"cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Haga clic en el botón desplegable <strong>Facturación</strong> debajo del ícono <strong>Monitoreo</strong>, que está disponible en la esquina superior izquierda. En el menú desplegable, haga clic en <strong>Explorador de costos</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/6390b1233d324e17a7d6cb33a9477ca9.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>La opción <strong>Explorador de costos</strong> aparece en la pantalla.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/1072ba57a2c84678a10e89556ba085a8.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Explorador de uso</strong>: aquí se puede acceder a una vista detallada del uso de un mes en particular.</li>\n<li>En el lado derecho del panel hay una opción para descargar el informe de uso.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/8b3bf9054cb04743906b6d75df45901f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aquí se muestra una descripción general de los recursos particulares utilizados por el usuario.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gestión de Nubes</a> con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Explorador de costos\n\n\n## Informes de costo y uso en el portal de administración de la nube Stackbill <span id=\"cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n- Haga clic en el botón desplegable **Facturación** debajo del ícono **Monitoreo**, que está disponible en la esquina superior izquierda. En el menú desplegable, haga clic en **Explorador de costos**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/6390b1233d324e17a7d6cb33a9477ca9.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- La opción **Explorador de costos** aparece en la pantalla.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/1072ba57a2c84678a10e89556ba085a8.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Explorador de uso**: aquí se puede acceder a una vista detallada del uso de un mes en particular.\n- En el lado derecho del panel hay una opción para descargar el informe de uso.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/8b3bf9054cb04743906b6d75df45901f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Aquí se muestra una descripción general de los recursos particulares utilizados por el usuario.\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo [Portal de Gestión de Nubes](https://localhost:8080/) con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.**','\0','Explorador de costos','guía-del-usuario/facturación/explorador-de-costos',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',69,'c01699f2-84f5-4e11-814a-4e94f572d6e4',NULL,3,NULL,175,0,'cms_72d6e4'),
(73,36,34,2,'2023-09-27 11:33:55','<h1>Explorador de custos</h1>\n<h2>Relatórios de custo e uso no portal de gerenciamento de nuvem Stackbill <span id=\"cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Clique no botão suspenso <strong>Faturamento</strong> abaixo do ícone <strong>Monitoramento</strong>, que está disponível no canto superior esquerdo. no menu suspenso, clique em <strong>Explorador de custos</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/6390b1233d324e17a7d6cb33a9477ca9.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>A opção <strong>Explorador de custos</strong> aparece na tela.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/1072ba57a2c84678a10e89556ba085a8.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Explorador de uso</strong> - Uma visão detalhada do uso de um determinado mês pode ser acessada aqui.</li>\n<li>No lado direito do painel existe a opção de baixar o relatório de utilização.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/8b3bf9054cb04743906b6d75df45901f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Uma visão geral dos recursos específicos usados pelo usuário é exibida aqui.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens</a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Explorador de custos\n\n\n## Relatórios de custo e uso no portal de gerenciamento de nuvem Stackbill <span id=\"cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\">\n\n- Clique no botão suspenso **Faturamento** abaixo do ícone **Monitoramento**, que está disponível no canto superior esquerdo. no menu suspenso, clique em **Explorador de custos**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/6390b1233d324e17a7d6cb33a9477ca9.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- A opção **Explorador de custos** aparece na tela.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/1072ba57a2c84678a10e89556ba085a8.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Explorador de uso** - Uma visão detalhada do uso de um determinado mês pode ser acessada aqui.\n- No lado direito do painel existe a opção de baixar o relatório de utilização.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/8b3bf9054cb04743906b6d75df45901f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Uma visão geral dos recursos específicos usados pelo usuário é exibida aqui.\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Sobre Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo [Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.**','\0','Explorador de custos','guia-de-usuario/cobrança/explorador-de-custos',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',69,'b4d294a5-a0a9-4ba7-84a1-53f71bc131cc',NULL,3,NULL,175,0,'cms_c131cc'),
(75,1,1,2,'2023-09-27 11:37:22','<h1><strong>Known Bugs</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Theme Color</strong> Conflict While login the portal</li>\n<li><strong>Promo code</strong> - Start &amp; End Date Calendar Open Issue in Add Promo code for Signup type</li>\n<li><strong>Organization</strong> - Empty Social Media field getting Undefined Error</li>\n<li>Custom field edit not working. When editing the custom field the custom field type always disabled the state</li>\n<li>The date format not working based on the configuration</li>\n<li>In the user panel, under the billing section, organization details display null in the invoices</li>\n<li>The maintenance Message screen display not working.</li>\n</ul>\n','',1,'# **Known Bugs**\r\n\r\n- **Theme Color** Conflict While login the portal\r\n- **Promo code** - Start & End Date Calendar Open Issue in Add Promo code for Signup type\r\n- **Organization** - Empty Social Media field getting Undefined Error\r\n- Custom field edit not working. When editing the custom field the custom field type always disabled the state\r\n- The date format not working based on the configuration\r\n- In the user panel, under the billing section, organization details display null in the invoices\r\n- The maintenance Message screen display not working.\r\n\r\n','\0','Known Bugs','user-guide/getting-started/known-bugs',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',75,'7625a22b-0c6c-43dc-8ef6-f55e7d174716',NULL,5,NULL,175,0,'cms_174716'),
(76,34,34,2,'2023-09-27 11:37:48','<h1>Saving Plans</h1>\n<h2>Savings Plan in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal <span id=\"savings-plan-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<p>Savings Plans in <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Stackbill</strong></a> are a flexible pricing model that offer low prices on resource usage, in exchange for a commitment to a consistent amount of usage (measured in ₹ /hour) for long term.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Billing</strong> dropdown button below the <strong>Monitoring</strong> icon, Which is available in the top left corner. from the dropdown, Click on <strong>Saving plan</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/94b40050cc32489682d0b52a60b9a469.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Saving plan</strong> screen appears.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/652700671fa246f08208195236b844a2.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Active plan</strong> - Here you can see how many <strong>Reserved plans are in active.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>savings</strong> - <strong>Saving option</strong> allows users to see how much money they have saved in comparison to a normal plan.</li>\n<li><strong>Plans expire this month</strong> - In this section, you can see the plans that <strong>going to expire on this month.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Current Active Plans</strong> - In this section shows the <strong>Current Active Plan and necessary details.</strong></li>\n<li>At the bottom of the page you can able to see an option called <strong>Purchase Saving Plan.</strong></li>\n<li>Click on it to <strong>Purchase a Saving plan</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/a2e307f4708c4814861aac544aae6a14.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Select the <strong>Offering plan</strong> as per the requirement.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/0edfec985359455ca990ed83714811f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Reserved Offering</strong> - In Stackbill there are two types offering avilable they are <strong>Standard</strong>, and <strong>Convertable</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Standard offering</strong> - In the <strong>standard offering</strong>, users can only use the policy in the standard format and cannot upgrade or downgrade it.</li>\n<li><strong>Convertable offering</strong> - Using <strong>Convertable offering</strong>, the user can upgrade the reserved instance policy at any time.</li>\n<li>Select the offering as per the requirement.</li>\n<li><strong>RI plan name</strong> - Here select the reserve instance policy duration.</li>\n<li><strong>Instance</strong> - <strong>Choose the instance</strong> to <strong>which the policy should be attached.</strong></li>\n<li>Finally click on <strong>Save Plan</strong>.</li>\n<li>Now the reserved instance policy has been configured successfully.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Saving Plans\n\n\n## Savings Plan in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal <span id=\"savings-plan-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\nSavings Plans in [**Stackbill**](https://localhost:8080/) are a flexible pricing model that offer low prices on resource usage, in exchange for a commitment to a consistent amount of usage (measured in ₹ /hour) for long term.\n\n- Click on the **Billing** dropdown button below the **Monitoring** icon, Which is available in the top left corner. from the dropdown, Click on **Saving plan**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/94b40050cc32489682d0b52a60b9a469.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Saving plan** screen appears.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/652700671fa246f08208195236b844a2.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Active plan** - Here you can see how many **Reserved plans are in active.**\n- **savings** - **Saving option** allows users to see how much money they have saved in comparison to a normal plan.\n- **Plans expire this month** - In this section, you can see the plans that **going to expire on this month.**\n- **Current Active Plans** - In this section shows the **Current Active Plan and necessary details.**\n- At the bottom of the page you can able to see an option called **Purchase Saving Plan.**\n- Click on it to **Purchase a Saving plan**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/a2e307f4708c4814861aac544aae6a14.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Select the **Offering plan** as per the requirement.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/0edfec985359455ca990ed83714811f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Reserved Offering** - In Stackbill there are two types offering avilable they are **Standard**, and **Convertable**.\n- **Standard offering** - In the **standard offering**, users can only use the policy in the standard format and cannot upgrade or downgrade it.\n- **Convertable offering** - Using **Convertable offering**, the user can upgrade the reserved instance policy at any time.\n- Select the offering as per the requirement.\n- **RI plan name** - Here select the reserve instance policy duration.\n- **Instance** - **Choose the instance** to **which the policy should be attached.**\n- Finally click on **Save Plan**.\n- Now the reserved instance policy has been configured successfully.\n\n\n-----------------------------------------------------\n\n\n**About Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**\n','\0','Saving Plans','user-guide/billing/saving-plans',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',76,'74649210-9416-4ba3-afdc-afe2b160d840',NULL,4,NULL,175,0,'cms_60d840'),
(77,4,4,2,'2023-09-27 11:39:33','<h1>Security Group Firewall <span id =\"Security-Group-Firewall\"></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>The purpose of <strong>Security groups in Stackbill </strong> is to isolate traffic to virtual machines.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Security groups are groups of virtual machines that filter their traffic based on ingress and egress rules.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>According to these rules, network traffic is filtered according to the IP address trying to communicate with the virtual machine.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The use of security groups is especially useful in zones using basic networking, since all guest VMs have their own network.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The KVM hypervisor is the only hypervisor that supports security groups in advanced zones.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Add security group in Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Network</strong> dropdown button below the compute icon, Which is available in the top left corner. from the dropdown, Click on <strong>Security Groups</strong> option.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8764cdfe3f35456a8dd11efa388236d1.png\"\nwidth=\"100%\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Security groups screen appears</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8298d9c8f3bd42e3a2507a4eba35be78.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>At the right side of the panel the user can able to see a button called <strong>Add</strong>, click on it.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8e36611a4ca54de2a4e013872e6be404.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Enter the name and give a short description</li>\n<li>And select the status.</li>\n<li>Finally, Click on <strong>Add</strong> button.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/dc1058918d7c463c8bf7f2fe803defe3.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Now the security group has been created successfully.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/fbefc9f202fa4ee8ad69f75c990b178b.png\" width=\"100%\">\n<ul>\n<li>In the <strong>Action</strong> section we can <strong>edit,manage,and delete</strong> the <strong>security group.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Security Group Firewall <span id =\"Security-Group-Firewall\"></span>\r\n\r\n\r\n- The purpose of **Security groups in Stackbill ** is to isolate traffic to virtual machines.\r\n\r\n- Security groups are groups of virtual machines that filter their traffic based on ingress and egress rules.\r\n\r\n- According to these rules, network traffic is filtered according to the IP address trying to communicate with the virtual machine.\r\n\r\n- The use of security groups is especially useful in zones using basic networking, since all guest VMs have their own network.\r\n\r\n- The KVM hypervisor is the only hypervisor that supports security groups in advanced zones.\r\n\r\n### Add security group in Stackbill \r\n\r\n- Click on the **Network** dropdown button below the compute icon, Which is available in the top left corner. from the dropdown, Click on **Security Groups** option.\r\n\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8764cdfe3f35456a8dd11efa388236d1.png\"\r\nwidth=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Security groups screen appears\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8298d9c8f3bd42e3a2507a4eba35be78.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- At the right side of the panel the user can able to see a button called **Add**, click on it.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8e36611a4ca54de2a4e013872e6be404.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Enter the name and give a short description \r\n- And select the status.\r\n- Finally, Click on **Add** button.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/dc1058918d7c463c8bf7f2fe803defe3.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Now the security group has been created successfully.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/fbefc9f202fa4ee8ad69f75c990b178b.png\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\r\n- In the **Action** section we can **edit,manage,and delete** the **security group.**\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n\r\n**About Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**','','Security Group Firewall','user-guide/network/security-group-firewall',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',77,'d4ff6e26-ba1a-408a-ba57-81bbaf3e3d65',NULL,3,'Adding Firewall',175,0,'cms_3e3d65'),
(78,2,1,2,'2023-09-27 11:39:49','<h1><strong>Errores Conocidos</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Color del Tema</strong> Conflictivo al iniciar sesión en el portal.</li>\n<li><strong>Código de Promoción</strong> - Problema de Apertura de Calendario de Fecha de Inicio y Fin en Agregar Código de Promoción para el Tipo de Registro.</li>\n<li><strong>Organización</strong> - El campo de Redes Sociales vacío muestra un Error Indefinido.</li>\n<li>No funciona la edición de campo personalizado. Al editar el campo personalizado, el tipo de campo personalizado siempre deshabilita el estado.</li>\n<li>El formato de fecha no funciona según la configuración.</li>\n<li>En el panel de usuario, en la sección de facturación, los detalles de la organización muestran nulos en las facturas.</li>\n<li>La pantalla de Mensaje de Mantenimiento no funciona.</li>\n</ul>\n','',2,'\r\n# **Errores Conocidos**\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Color del Tema** Conflictivo al iniciar sesión en el portal.\r\n- **Código de Promoción** - Problema de Apertura de Calendario de Fecha de Inicio y Fin en Agregar Código de Promoción para el Tipo de Registro.\r\n- **Organización** - El campo de Redes Sociales vacío muestra un Error Indefinido.\r\n- No funciona la edición de campo personalizado. Al editar el campo personalizado, el tipo de campo personalizado siempre deshabilita el estado.\r\n- El formato de fecha no funciona según la configuración.\r\n- En el panel de usuario, en la sección de facturación, los detalles de la organización muestran nulos en las facturas.\r\n- La pantalla de Mensaje de Mantenimiento no funciona.','\0','Errores conocidos','guía-del-usuario/empezando/errores-conocidos',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',75,'6e1115dd-ed67-4b59-a730-1610efd1b005',NULL,5,NULL,175,0,'cms_d1b005'),
(79,35,34,2,'2023-09-27 11:39:51','<h1>Planes de ahorro</h1>\n<h2>Plan de ahorro en el portal de administración de la nube Stackbill <span id=\"plan-de-ahorro-en-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<p>Los planes de ahorro en <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Stackbill</strong></a> son un modelo de precios flexible que ofrece precios bajos en el uso de recursos, a cambio de un compromiso de una cantidad constante de uso (medido en ₹ /hora) a largo plazo.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Haga clic en el botón desplegable <strong>Facturación</strong> debajo del ícono <strong>Monitoreo</strong>, que está disponible en la esquina superior izquierda. En el menú desplegable, haga clic en <strong>Plan de ahorro</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/94b40050cc32489682d0b52a60b9a469.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aparece la pantalla <strong>Plan de ahorro</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/652700671fa246f08208195236b844a2.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Plan activo</strong> - Aquí puedes ver cuántos <strong>planes reservados están activos.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>ahorros</strong> - La <strong>opción de ahorro</strong> permite a los usuarios ver cuánto dinero han ahorrado en comparación con un plan normal.</li>\n<li><strong>Los planes vencen este mes</strong> - En esta sección, puedes ver los planes que <strong>vencen este mes.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Planes activos actuales</strong> - En esta sección se muestra el <strong>Plan activo actual y los detalles necesarios.</strong></li>\n<li>En la parte inferior de la página puedes ver una opción llamada <strong>Comprar Plan de Ahorro.</strong></li>\n<li>Haga clic en él para <strong>Comprar un plan de ahorro</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/a2e307f4708c4814861aac544aae6a14.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Seleccione el <strong>Plan de oferta</strong> según el requisito.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/0edfec985359455ca990ed83714811f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Oferta reservada</strong> - En Stackbill hay dos tipos de ofertas disponibles: <strong>Estándar</strong> y <strong>Convertible</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Oferta estándar</strong>: en la <strong>oferta estándar</strong>, los usuarios solo pueden usar la política en el formato estándar y no pueden actualizarla ni degradarla.</li>\n<li><strong>Oferta convertible</strong> - Al utilizar <strong>Oferta convertible</strong>, el usuario puede actualizar la política de instancia reservada en cualquier momento.</li>\n<li>Seleccione la oferta según el requisito.</li>\n<li><strong>nombre del plan RI</strong>: aquí seleccione la duración de la política de la instancia de reserva.</li>\n<li><strong>Instancia</strong> - <strong>Elija la instancia</strong> a la que <strong>se debe adjuntar la política.</strong></li>\n<li>Finalmente haga clic en <strong>Guardar plan</strong>.</li>\n<li>Ahora la política de instancia reservada se ha configurado correctamente.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gestión de Nubes</a> con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Planes de ahorro\n\n\n## Plan de ahorro en el portal de administración de la nube Stackbill <span id=\"plan-de-ahorro-en-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\nLos planes de ahorro en [**Stackbill**](https://localhost:8080/) son un modelo de precios flexible que ofrece precios bajos en el uso de recursos, a cambio de un compromiso de una cantidad constante de uso (medido en ₹ /hora) a largo plazo.\n\n- Haga clic en el botón desplegable **Facturación** debajo del ícono **Monitoreo**, que está disponible en la esquina superior izquierda. En el menú desplegable, haga clic en **Plan de ahorro**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/94b40050cc32489682d0b52a60b9a469.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Aparece la pantalla **Plan de ahorro**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/652700671fa246f08208195236b844a2.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Plan activo** - Aquí puedes ver cuántos **planes reservados están activos.**\n- **ahorros** - La **opción de ahorro** permite a los usuarios ver cuánto dinero han ahorrado en comparación con un plan normal.\n- **Los planes vencen este mes** - En esta sección, puedes ver los planes que **vencen este mes.**\n- **Planes activos actuales** - En esta sección se muestra el **Plan activo actual y los detalles necesarios.**\n- En la parte inferior de la página puedes ver una opción llamada **Comprar Plan de Ahorro.**\n- Haga clic en él para **Comprar un plan de ahorro**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/a2e307f4708c4814861aac544aae6a14.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Seleccione el **Plan de oferta** según el requisito.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/0edfec985359455ca990ed83714811f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Oferta reservada** - En Stackbill hay dos tipos de ofertas disponibles: **Estándar** y **Convertible**.\n- **Oferta estándar**: en la **oferta estándar**, los usuarios solo pueden usar la política en el formato estándar y no pueden actualizarla ni degradarla.\n- **Oferta convertible** - Al utilizar **Oferta convertible**, el usuario puede actualizar la política de instancia reservada en cualquier momento.\n- Seleccione la oferta según el requisito.\n- **nombre del plan RI**: aquí seleccione la duración de la política de la instancia de reserva.\n- **Instancia** - **Elija la instancia** a la que **se debe adjuntar la política.**\n- Finalmente haga clic en **Guardar plan**.\n- Ahora la política de instancia reservada se ha configurado correctamente.\n\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo [Portal de Gestión de Nubes](https://localhost:8080/) con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.**','\0','Planes de ahorro','guía-del-usuario/facturación/planes-de-ahorro',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',76,'b22b8c84-ac19-4485-ae0f-5791cc475cbc',NULL,4,NULL,175,0,'cms_475cbc'),
(80,3,1,2,'2023-09-27 12:50:09','<h1><strong>Bugs Conhecidos</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Conflito de <strong>Cor do Tema</strong> ao fazer login no portal.</li>\n<li><strong>Código Promocional</strong> - Problema de Abertura do Calendário de Data de Início e Término ao Adicionar um Código Promocional para o Tipo de Inscrição.</li>\n<li><strong>Organização</strong> - Campo de Mídia Social Vazio gerando Erro Indefinido.</li>\n<li>A edição de campo personalizado não está funcionando. Ao editar o campo personalizado, o tipo de campo personalizado sempre desabilita o estado.</li>\n<li>O formato de data não está funcionando com base na configuração.</li>\n<li>No painel do usuário, na seção de faturamento, os detalhes da organização são exibidos como nulos nas faturas.</li>\n<li>A tela de Mensagem de Manutenção não está funcionando.</li>\n</ul>\n','',3,'\r\n# **Bugs Conhecidos**\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- Conflito de **Cor do Tema** ao fazer login no portal.\r\n- **Código Promocional** - Problema de Abertura do Calendário de Data de Início e Término ao Adicionar um Código Promocional para o Tipo de Inscrição.\r\n- **Organização** - Campo de Mídia Social Vazio gerando Erro Indefinido.\r\n- A edição de campo personalizado não está funcionando. Ao editar o campo personalizado, o tipo de campo personalizado sempre desabilita o estado.\r\n- O formato de data não está funcionando com base na configuração.\r\n- No painel do usuário, na seção de faturamento, os detalhes da organização são exibidos como nulos nas faturas.\r\n- A tela de Mensagem de Manutenção não está funcionando.','\0','Bugs Conhecidos','guia-de-usuario/começando/bugs-conhecidos',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',75,'57d7facb-421a-4002-af5b-6afe1a274be3',NULL,5,NULL,175,0,'cms_274be3'),
(81,36,34,2,'2023-09-27 12:51:20','<h1>Planos de economia</h1>\n<h2>Plano de economia no portal de gerenciamento Stackbill Cloud <span id=\"plano-de-poupança-no-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<p>Os Savings Plans no <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\"><strong>Stackbill</strong></a> são um modelo de preços flexível que oferece preços baixos no uso de recursos, em troca de um compromisso com uma quantidade consistente de uso (medido em ₹ /hora) para longo prazo.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Clique no botão suspenso <strong>Faturamento</strong> abaixo do ícone <strong>Monitoramento</strong>, que está disponível no canto superior esquerdo. no menu suspenso, clique em <strong>Plano de economia</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/94b40050cc32489682d0b52a60b9a469.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>A tela <strong>Salvando plano</strong> é exibida.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/652700671fa246f08208195236b844a2.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Plano ativo</strong> - Aqui você pode ver quantos <strong>Planos reservados estão ativos.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>economia</strong> - <strong>Opção de economia</strong> permite que os usuários vejam quanto dinheiro economizaram em comparação com um plano normal.</li>\n<li><strong>Os planos expiram este mês</strong> - Nesta seção você pode ver os planos que <strong>vão expirar neste mês.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Planos ativos atuais</strong> - Nesta seção mostra o <strong>Plano ativo atual e os detalhes necessários.</strong></li>\n<li>Na parte inferior da página você pode ver uma opção chamada <strong>Comprar Plano de Economia.</strong></li>\n<li>Clique nele para <strong>Adquirir um plano Saving</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/a2e307f4708c4814861aac544aae6a14.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Selecione o <strong>Plano de ofertas</strong> conforme o requisito.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/0edfec985359455ca990ed83714811f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Oferta Reservada</strong> - No Stackbill existem dois tipos de ofertas disponíveis: <strong>Padrão</strong> e <strong>Convertível</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Oferta padrão</strong> - Na <strong>oferta padrão</strong>, os usuários só podem usar a política no formato padrão e não podem fazer upgrade ou downgrade dela.</li>\n<li><strong>Oferta conversível</strong> - Usando a <strong>Oferta conversível</strong>, o usuário pode atualizar a política de instância reservada a qualquer momento.</li>\n<li>Selecione a oferta conforme a necessidade.</li>\n<li><strong>Nome do plano RI</strong> - Selecione aqui a duração da política da instância de reserva.</li>\n<li><strong>Instância</strong> - <strong>Escolha a instância</strong> à qual a política deve ser anexada.**</li>\n<li>Por fim, clique em <strong>Salvar plano</strong>.</li>\n<li>Agora a política de instância reservada foi configurada com sucesso.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens</a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Planos de economia\n\n\n## Plano de economia no portal de gerenciamento Stackbill Cloud <span id=\"plano-de-poupança-no-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\nOs Savings Plans no [**Stackbill**](https://localhost:8080/) são um modelo de preços flexível que oferece preços baixos no uso de recursos, em troca de um compromisso com uma quantidade consistente de uso (medido em ₹ /hora) para longo prazo.\n\n- Clique no botão suspenso **Faturamento** abaixo do ícone **Monitoramento**, que está disponível no canto superior esquerdo. no menu suspenso, clique em **Plano de economia**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/94b40050cc32489682d0b52a60b9a469.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- A tela **Salvando plano** é exibida.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/652700671fa246f08208195236b844a2.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Plano ativo** - Aqui você pode ver quantos **Planos reservados estão ativos.**\n- **economia** - **Opção de economia** permite que os usuários vejam quanto dinheiro economizaram em comparação com um plano normal.\n- **Os planos expiram este mês** - Nesta seção você pode ver os planos que **vão expirar neste mês.**\n- **Planos ativos atuais** - Nesta seção mostra o **Plano ativo atual e os detalhes necessários.**\n- Na parte inferior da página você pode ver uma opção chamada **Comprar Plano de Economia.**\n- Clique nele para **Adquirir um plano Saving**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/a2e307f4708c4814861aac544aae6a14.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Selecione o **Plano de ofertas** conforme o requisito.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Billing/0edfec985359455ca990ed83714811f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- **Oferta Reservada** - No Stackbill existem dois tipos de ofertas disponíveis: **Padrão** e **Convertível**.\n- **Oferta padrão** - Na **oferta padrão**, os usuários só podem usar a política no formato padrão e não podem fazer upgrade ou downgrade dela.\n- **Oferta conversível** - Usando a **Oferta conversível**, o usuário pode atualizar a política de instância reservada a qualquer momento.\n- Selecione a oferta conforme a necessidade.\n- **Nome do plano RI** - Selecione aqui a duração da política da instância de reserva.\n- **Instância** - **Escolha a instância** à qual a política deve ser anexada.**\n- Por fim, clique em **Salvar plano**.\n- Agora a política de instância reservada foi configurada com sucesso.\n\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Sobre Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo [Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.**','\0','Planos de economia','guia-de-usuario/cobrança/planos-de-economia',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',76,'1a6df9c0-9e5b-49e3-865d-c7e1158b42a1',NULL,4,NULL,175,0,'cms_8b42a1'),
(82,21,4,2,'2023-09-27 12:51:32','<h1>Firewall de Grupo de Seguridad <span id=\"agregar-grupos-de-seguridad-en-Stackbill-\"></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>El propósito de los <strong>Grupos de seguridad en Stackbill </strong> es aislar el tráfico hacia las máquinas virtuales.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Los grupos de seguridad son conjuntos de máquinas virtuales que filtran su tráfico en función de reglas de entrada y salida.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Según estas reglas, el tráfico de red se filtra según la dirección IP que intenta comunicarse con la máquina virtual.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>El uso de grupos de seguridad es especialmente útil en zonas que utilizan redes básicas, ya que todas las VM de invitados tienen su propia red.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>El hipervisor KVM es el único hipervisor que admite grupos de seguridad en zonas avanzadas.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Agregar un grupo de seguridad en Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Haz clic en el botón desplegable de <strong>Red</strong> debajo del ícono de cálculo, que está disponible en la esquina superior izquierda. En el menú desplegable, haz clic en la opción <strong>Grupos de seguridad</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8764cdfe3f35456a8dd11efa388236d1.png\" alt=\"Grupos de seguridad\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aparecerá la pantalla de <strong>Grupos de seguridad</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8298d9c8f3bd42e3a2507a4eba35be78.png\" alt=\"Pantalla de Grupos de seguridad\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>En el lado derecho del panel, el usuario puede ver un botón llamado <strong>Agregar</strong>, haz clic en él.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8e36611a4ca54de2a4e013872e6be404.png\" alt=\"Agregar Grupo de Seguridad\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ingresa el nombre y proporciona una breve descripción.</li>\n<li>Y selecciona el estado.</li>\n<li>Finalmente, haz clic en el botón <strong>Agregar</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/dc1058918d7c463c8bf7f2fe803defe3.png\" alt=\"Formulario de Agregar Grupo de Seguridad\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ahora el grupo de seguridad se ha creado con éxito.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/fbefc9f202fa4ee8ad69f75c990b178b.png\" alt=\"Grupo de Seguridad Creado\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>En la sección <strong>Acción</strong> podemos <strong>editar, gestionar y eliminar</strong> el <strong>grupo de seguridad.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gestión de Nube</a> autoservicio e intuitivo con amplias características que aprovechan Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en el estado del arte.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Firewall de Grupo de Seguridad <span id=\"agregar-grupos-de-seguridad-en-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\n- El propósito de los **Grupos de seguridad en Stackbill ** es aislar el tráfico hacia las máquinas virtuales.\r\n\r\n- Los grupos de seguridad son conjuntos de máquinas virtuales que filtran su tráfico en función de reglas de entrada y salida.\r\n\r\n- Según estas reglas, el tráfico de red se filtra según la dirección IP que intenta comunicarse con la máquina virtual.\r\n\r\n- El uso de grupos de seguridad es especialmente útil en zonas que utilizan redes básicas, ya que todas las VM de invitados tienen su propia red.\r\n\r\n- El hipervisor KVM es el único hipervisor que admite grupos de seguridad en zonas avanzadas.\r\n\r\n### Agregar un grupo de seguridad en Stackbill \r\n\r\n- Haz clic en el botón desplegable de **Red** debajo del ícono de cálculo, que está disponible en la esquina superior izquierda. En el menú desplegable, haz clic en la opción **Grupos de seguridad**.\r\n\r\n![Grupos de seguridad](https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8764cdfe3f35456a8dd11efa388236d1.png)\r\n  \r\n- Aparecerá la pantalla de **Grupos de seguridad**.\r\n\r\n![Pantalla de Grupos de seguridad](https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8298d9c8f3bd42e3a2507a4eba35be78.png)\r\n\r\n- En el lado derecho del panel, el usuario puede ver un botón llamado **Agregar**, haz clic en él.\r\n\r\n![Agregar Grupo de Seguridad](https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8e36611a4ca54de2a4e013872e6be404.png)\r\n\r\n- Ingresa el nombre y proporciona una breve descripción.\r\n- Y selecciona el estado.\r\n- Finalmente, haz clic en el botón **Agregar**.\r\n\r\n![Formulario de Agregar Grupo de Seguridad](https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/dc1058918d7c463c8bf7f2fe803defe3.png)\r\n\r\n- Ahora el grupo de seguridad se ha creado con éxito.\r\n\r\n![Grupo de Seguridad Creado](https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/fbefc9f202fa4ee8ad69f75c990b178b.png)\r\n\r\n- En la sección **Acción** podemos **editar, gestionar y eliminar** el **grupo de seguridad.**\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] es un completo [Portal de Gestión de Nube](https://localhost:8080/) autoservicio e intuitivo con amplias características que aprovechan Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en el estado del arte.**','','Cortafuegos del grupo de seguridad','guía-del-usuario/red/cortafuegos-del-grupo-de-seguridad',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',77,'bd3cb733-e5d8-4a11-8582-9bebda63a4b5',NULL,3,'Agregar firewall',175,0,'cms_63a4b5'),
(83,22,4,2,'2023-09-27 12:53:21','<h1>Firewall de Grupo de Segurança <span id=\"agregar-grupos-de-seguridad-en-Stackbill-\"></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>O objetivo dos <strong>Grupos de segurança no Stackbill </strong> é isolar o tráfego para máquinas virtuais.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Os grupos de segurança são conjuntos de máquinas virtuais que filtram seu tráfego com base em regras de entrada e saída.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>De acordo com essas regras, o tráfego de rede é filtrado de acordo com o endereço IP que está tentando se comunicar com a máquina virtual.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>O uso de grupos de segurança é especialmente útil em zonas que utilizam redes básicas, pois todas as VMs de convidados têm sua própria rede.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>O hipervisor KVM é o único hipervisor que oferece suporte a grupos de segurança em zonas avançadas.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Adicionar um grupo de segurança no Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Clique no botão suspenso <strong>Rede</strong> abaixo do ícone de cálculo, que está disponível no canto superior esquerdo. No menu suspenso, clique na opção <strong>Grupos de Segurança</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8764cdfe3f35456a8dd11efa388236d1.png\" alt=\"Grupos de Segurança\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A tela de grupos de segurança aparece</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8298d9c8f3bd42e3a2507a4eba35be78.png\" alt=\"Tela de Grupos de Segurança\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>No lado direito do painel, o usuário pode ver um botão chamado <strong>Adicionar</strong>, clique nele.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8e36611a4ca54de2a4e013872e6be404.png\" alt=\"Botão Adicionar\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Insira o nome e forneça uma breve descrição.</li>\n<li>E selecione o status.</li>\n<li>Finalmente, clique no botão <strong>Adicionar</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/dc1058918d7c463c8bf7f2fe803defe3.png\" alt=\"Formulário de Adicionar Grupo de Segurança\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Agora o grupo de segurança foi criado com sucesso.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/fbefc9f202fa4ee8ad69f75c990b178b.png\" alt=\"Grupo de Segurança Criado\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Na seção <strong>Ação</strong>, podemos <strong>editar, gerenciar e excluir</strong> o <strong>grupo de segurança.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre o Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem completo e intuitivo de autoatendimento com recursos extensos que alavancam o Apache CloudStack® com anos de expertise em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Firewall de Grupo de Segurança <span id=\"agregar-grupos-de-seguridad-en-Stackbill-\"></span>\r\n\r\n- O objetivo dos **Grupos de segurança no Stackbill ** é isolar o tráfego para máquinas virtuais.\r\n\r\n- Os grupos de segurança são conjuntos de máquinas virtuais que filtram seu tráfego com base em regras de entrada e saída.\r\n\r\n- De acordo com essas regras, o tráfego de rede é filtrado de acordo com o endereço IP que está tentando se comunicar com a máquina virtual.\r\n\r\n- O uso de grupos de segurança é especialmente útil em zonas que utilizam redes básicas, pois todas as VMs de convidados têm sua própria rede.\r\n\r\n- O hipervisor KVM é o único hipervisor que oferece suporte a grupos de segurança em zonas avançadas.\r\n\r\n### Adicionar um grupo de segurança no Stackbill \r\n\r\n- Clique no botão suspenso **Rede** abaixo do ícone de cálculo, que está disponível no canto superior esquerdo. No menu suspenso, clique na opção **Grupos de Segurança**.\r\n\r\n![Grupos de Segurança](https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8764cdfe3f35456a8dd11efa388236d1.png)\r\n  \r\n- A tela de grupos de segurança aparece\r\n\r\n![Tela de Grupos de Segurança](https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8298d9c8f3bd42e3a2507a4eba35be78.png)\r\n\r\n- No lado direito do painel, o usuário pode ver um botão chamado **Adicionar**, clique nele.\r\n\r\n![Botão Adicionar](https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/8e36611a4ca54de2a4e013872e6be404.png)\r\n\r\n- Insira o nome e forneça uma breve descrição.\r\n- E selecione o status.\r\n- Finalmente, clique no botão **Adicionar**.\r\n\r\n![Formulário de Adicionar Grupo de Segurança](https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/dc1058918d7c463c8bf7f2fe803defe3.png)\r\n\r\n- Agora o grupo de segurança foi criado com sucesso.\r\n\r\n![Grupo de Segurança Criado](https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/security-group/fbefc9f202fa4ee8ad69f75c990b178b.png)\r\n\r\n- Na seção **Ação**, podemos **editar, gerenciar e excluir** o **grupo de segurança.**\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n**Sobre o Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] é um Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvem completo e intuitivo de autoatendimento com recursos extensos que alavancam o Apache CloudStack® com anos de expertise em tecnologia de ponta.**','','Firewall do grupo de segurança','guia-de-usuario/rede/firewall-do-grupo-de-seguran-a',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',77,'57404aa9-288a-4e52-9002-c7d606143402',NULL,3,'Adicionando Firewall',175,0,'cms_143402'),
(84,34,34,2,'2023-09-27 12:58:07','<h1>Invoice</h1>\n<h2>Invoice in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal <span id=\"invoice-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The <strong>Billing</strong> option can be found on the left side of the portal.</li>\n<li>The screen displays a pop-up menu. To view or download the <strong>invoice</strong>, click on the <strong>Invoice</strong> option from the menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/2a2632423e38491183938b7a0f835e72.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Invoice</strong> screen appears.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/ce2978ef2e8340408ea4407f8c9305d6.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Step 1</strong> - <strong>Invoice No &amp; Client Name</strong> - you can find the invoice no and name of the client here.</li>\n<li><strong>Step 2</strong>  - <strong>Usage Cost &amp; Billing Period</strong> - total cost of virtual resources for a month can be found here.</li>\n<li><strong>Step 3</strong>  - Status - The month\'s payment status can be found here.</li>\n<li>On the right side of the panel, you can <strong>download the invoice in pdf and .xlsx format.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Invoice\n\n\n## Invoice in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal <span id=\"invoice-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n- The **Billing** option can be found on the left side of the portal.\n- The screen displays a pop-up menu. To view or download the **invoice**, click on the **Invoice** option from the menu.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/2a2632423e38491183938b7a0f835e72.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n\n-  **Invoice** screen appears.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/ce2978ef2e8340408ea4407f8c9305d6.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n-   **Step 1** - **Invoice No & Client Name** - you can find the invoice no and name of the client here.\n-   **Step 2**  - **Usage Cost & Billing Period** - total cost of virtual resources for a month can be found here.\n-   **Step 3**  - Status - The month\'s payment status can be found here.\n-   On the right side of the panel, you can **download the invoice in pdf and .xlsx format.**\n\n-----------------------------------------------------\n\n\n**About Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**','\0','Invoice','user-guide/billing/invoice',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',84,'f8c5f8e7-e112-47e0-b211-d197d621e3ad',NULL,5,NULL,175,0,'cms_21e3ad'),
(85,35,34,2,'2023-09-27 12:59:02','<h1>Factura</h1>\n<h2>Factura en el portal de administración de la nube Stackbill <span id=\"factura-en-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>La opción <strong>Facturación</strong> se puede encontrar en el lado izquierdo del portal.</li>\n<li>La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. Para ver o descargar la <strong>factura</strong>, haga clic en la opción <strong>Factura</strong> del menú.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/2a2632423e38491183938b7a0f835e72.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aparece la pantalla <strong>Factura</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/ce2978ef2e8340408ea4407f8c9305d6.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Paso 1</strong> - <strong>N.º de factura y nombre del cliente</strong>: puede encontrar el número de factura y el nombre del cliente aquí.</li>\n<li><strong>Paso 2</strong> - <strong>Costo de uso y período de facturación</strong>: el costo total de los recursos virtuales durante un mes se puede encontrar aquí.</li>\n<li><strong>Paso 3</strong> - Estado: el estado de pago del mes se puede encontrar aquí.</li>\n<li>En el lado derecho del panel, podrás <strong>descargar la factura en formato pdf y .xlsx.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gestión de Nubes</a> con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Factura\n\n\n## Factura en el portal de administración de la nube Stackbill <span id=\"factura-en-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n- La opción **Facturación** se puede encontrar en el lado izquierdo del portal.\n- La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. Para ver o descargar la **factura**, haga clic en la opción **Factura** del menú.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/2a2632423e38491183938b7a0f835e72.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n\n- Aparece la pantalla **Factura**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/ce2978ef2e8340408ea4407f8c9305d6.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- **Paso 1** - **N.º de factura y nombre del cliente**: puede encontrar el número de factura y el nombre del cliente aquí.\n- **Paso 2** - **Costo de uso y período de facturación**: el costo total de los recursos virtuales durante un mes se puede encontrar aquí.\n- **Paso 3** - Estado: el estado de pago del mes se puede encontrar aquí.\n- En el lado derecho del panel, podrás **descargar la factura en formato pdf y .xlsx.**\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo [Portal de Gestión de Nubes](https://localhost:8080/) con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.**','\0','Factura','guía-del-usuario/facturación/factura',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',84,'f966eb81-3df8-4d40-8451-784e6e9e6667',NULL,5,NULL,175,0,'cms_9e6667'),
(86,36,34,2,'2023-09-27 13:00:49','<h1>Fatura</h1>\n<h2>Fatura no portal de gerenciamento Stackbill Cloud <span id=\"invoice-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A opção <strong>Faturação</strong> pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.</li>\n<li>A tela exibe um menu pop-up. Para visualizar ou baixar a <strong>fatura</strong>, clique na opção <strong>Fatura</strong> do menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/2a2632423e38491183938b7a0f835e72.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>A tela <strong>Fatura</strong> é exibida.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/ce2978ef2e8340408ea4407f8c9305d6.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Etapa 1</strong> - <strong>Número da fatura e nome do cliente</strong> - você pode encontrar o número da fatura e o nome do cliente aqui.</li>\n<li><strong>Etapa 2</strong> - <strong>Custo de uso e período de cobrança</strong> - o custo total dos recursos virtuais por um mês pode ser encontrado aqui.</li>\n<li><strong>Etapa 3</strong> - Status - O status do pagamento do mês pode ser encontrado aqui.</li>\n<li>No lado direito do painel, você pode <strong>baixar a fatura em formato pdf e .xlsx.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens</a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Fatura\n\n\n## Fatura no portal de gerenciamento Stackbill Cloud <span id=\"invoice-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n- A opção **Faturação** pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.\n- A tela exibe um menu pop-up. Para visualizar ou baixar a **fatura**, clique na opção **Fatura** do menu.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/2a2632423e38491183938b7a0f835e72.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n\n- A tela **Fatura** é exibida.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/ce2978ef2e8340408ea4407f8c9305d6.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- **Etapa 1** - **Número da fatura e nome do cliente** - você pode encontrar o número da fatura e o nome do cliente aqui.\n- **Etapa 2** - **Custo de uso e período de cobrança** - o custo total dos recursos virtuais por um mês pode ser encontrado aqui.\n- **Etapa 3** - Status - O status do pagamento do mês pode ser encontrado aqui.\n- No lado direito do painel, você pode **baixar a fatura em formato pdf e .xlsx.**\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Sobre Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo [Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.**','\0','Fatura','guia-de-usuario/cobrança/fatura',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',84,'32868c0b-d7fe-4653-bb8f-db0f257054e0',NULL,5,NULL,175,0,'cms_7054e0'),
(87,14,14,2,'2023-09-27 13:03:08','<h1>Overview</h1>\n<h2>APPS - Marketplace</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>An app marketplace is an online platform that lists software applications for your virtual instance. User can access various products and services available through <strong>Stackbill Cloud Management Portal</strong> and use for their business needs.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</strong> will provide more than 250+ apps for their customers. Under marketplace there are different types of application available under popular categories like web servers, containers, Developer apps, etc..,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Each categories contains various apps such as Joomla, wordpress, LEMP, Django, NodeJS, etc..,</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Overview\r\n\r\n\r\n## APPS - Marketplace\r\n\r\n- An app marketplace is an online platform that lists software applications for your virtual instance. User can access various products and services available through **Stackbill Cloud Management Portal** and use for their business needs.\r\n\r\n- **Stackbill** will provide more than 250+ apps for their customers. Under marketplace there are different types of application available under popular categories like web servers, containers, Developer apps, etc..,\r\n\r\n- Each categories contains various apps such as Joomla, wordpress, LEMP, Django, NodeJS, etc..,\r\n\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n\r\n**About Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**','','Overview','user-guide/marketplace/overview',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',87,'d7d9dda4-45e2-4cad-82b1-cae0574c3ae6',NULL,1,'APPS - Marketplace',175,0,'cms_4c3ae6'),
(88,30,14,2,'2023-09-27 13:06:51','<h1>Visão Geral</h1>\n<h2>APPS - Marketplace</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Um marketplace de aplicativos é uma plataforma online que lista aplicativos de software para sua instância virtual. Os usuários podem acessar diversos produtos e serviços disponíveis através do <strong>Portal de Gerenciamento em Nuvem da Stackbill</strong> e utilizá-los para suas necessidades comerciais.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A <strong>Stackbill</strong> fornecerá mais de 250 aplicativos para seus clientes. No marketplace, existem diferentes tipos de aplicativos disponíveis em categorias populares, como servidores web, contêineres, aplicativos para desenvolvedores, etc.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Cada categoria contém vários aplicativos, como Joomla, WordPress, LEMP, Django, NodeJS, etc.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre a Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens</a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Visão Geral\r\n\r\n\r\n## APPS - Marketplace\r\n\r\n- Um marketplace de aplicativos é uma plataforma online que lista aplicativos de software para sua instância virtual. Os usuários podem acessar diversos produtos e serviços disponíveis através do **Portal de Gerenciamento em Nuvem da Stackbill** e utilizá-los para suas necessidades comerciais.\r\n\r\n- A **Stackbill** fornecerá mais de 250 aplicativos para seus clientes. No marketplace, existem diferentes tipos de aplicativos disponíveis em categorias populares, como servidores web, contêineres, aplicativos para desenvolvedores, etc.\r\n\r\n- Cada categoria contém vários aplicativos, como Joomla, WordPress, LEMP, Django, NodeJS, etc.\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n**Sobre a Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo [Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.**','','Visão geral','guia-de-usuario/mercado/vis-o-geral',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',87,'cf93a10f-502d-4504-a815-560385d019f0',NULL,1,'APLICATIVOS - Mercado',175,0,'cms_d019f0'),
(89,29,14,2,'2023-09-27 13:07:21','<h1>Descripción General</h1>\n<h2>APPS - Marketplace</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Un mercado de aplicaciones es una plataforma en línea que enumera aplicaciones de software para su instancia virtual. Los usuarios pueden acceder a varios productos y servicios disponibles a través del <strong>Portal de Gestión en la Nube de Stackbill</strong> y utilizarlos para sus necesidades comerciales.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</strong> proporcionará más de 250 aplicaciones para sus clientes. En el mercado, hay diferentes tipos de aplicaciones disponibles en categorías populares como servidores web, contenedores, aplicaciones para desarrolladores, etc.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Cada categoría contiene varias aplicaciones, como Joomla, WordPress, LEMP, Django, NodeJS, etc.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gestión de Nubes</a> con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Descripción General\r\n\r\n\r\n## APPS - Marketplace\r\n\r\n- Un mercado de aplicaciones es una plataforma en línea que enumera aplicaciones de software para su instancia virtual. Los usuarios pueden acceder a varios productos y servicios disponibles a través del **Portal de Gestión en la Nube de Stackbill** y utilizarlos para sus necesidades comerciales.\r\n\r\n- **Stackbill** proporcionará más de 250 aplicaciones para sus clientes. En el mercado, hay diferentes tipos de aplicaciones disponibles en categorías populares como servidores web, contenedores, aplicaciones para desarrolladores, etc.\r\n\r\n- Cada categoría contiene varias aplicaciones, como Joomla, WordPress, LEMP, Django, NodeJS, etc.\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo [Portal de Gestión de Nubes](https://localhost:8080/) con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.**','','Descripción general','guía-del-usuario/mercado/descripci-n-general',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',87,'419c08d8-7d2d-4ed6-9ae6-1f7809c586dc',NULL,1,'APLICACIONES - Mercado',175,0,'cms_c586dc'),
(90,14,14,2,'2023-09-27 13:14:34','<h1>Launching Apps</h1>\n<h2>Launching Apps in Stackbill </h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Marketplace</strong> option found on the left side of the panel <strong>click on it to view the marketplace.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/2026bd6d466c48e5aecc85b3a304e0a6.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Launch</strong> button as per the required software application.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/0e31f47874b1425abe20046d634fead1.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Once clicked on the <strong>Launch button</strong> it will be redirect to instance creation page along with pre-selected of software application.</li>\n<li>Select the required configurations like instance plan, CPU size, processors, and configure network and firewalls.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/64da2955c64a45659daf2eaa168cef4c.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Finally Click on <strong>Create Instance</strong>.</li>\n<li>Now the instance has been created successfully.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Launching Apps\r\n\r\n## Launching Apps in Stackbill \r\n\r\n- **Marketplace** option found on the left side of the panel **click on it to view the marketplace.**\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/2026bd6d466c48e5aecc85b3a304e0a6.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Click on the **Launch** button as per the required software application.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/0e31f47874b1425abe20046d634fead1.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Once clicked on the **Launch button** it will be redirect to instance creation page along with pre-selected of software application.\r\n- Select the required configurations like instance plan, CPU size, processors, and configure network and firewalls.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/64da2955c64a45659daf2eaa168cef4c.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Finally Click on **Create Instance**.\r\n- Now the instance has been created successfully.\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n\r\n**About Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**\r\n','\0','Launching Apps','user-guide/marketplace/launching-apps',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',90,'7ba00fdc-65c6-4337-b26e-fd680064273e',NULL,2,NULL,175,0,'cms_64273e'),
(91,34,34,2,'2023-09-27 13:15:57','<h1>Reporting</h1>\n<h2>Cost &amp; Usage Reports in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal <span id=\"cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Billing option can be found on the left side of the portal.</li>\n<li>The screen displays a pop-up menu. To view or download the invoice, click on the <strong>Invoice</strong> option from the menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/be4729eafbc245a48ffe13fa0c4281e9.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>The <strong>Report</strong> screen appears.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/7f53c6e11a6d40eba6faa4a548f9d711.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>You can see two option namely <strong>Usage summary</strong>, and <strong>usage detail</strong>.</li>\n<li>click on the <strong>Usage summary</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/69e29f814f9a44dd819a4a267e74d15b.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>You can <strong>see the virtual resource usage</strong> by entering a date in the form and to boxes on the usage summary screen.</li>\n<li>You can have a <strong>detailed usage report of the virtual resource</strong> below and you can be able to download the usage report.</li>\n<li>Click on the  <strong>Usage detail</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/30df93ce56bd4274b66d6674f8044b10.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>The usage report screen shows the usage of particular virtual resources in the portal.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Mention the <strong>date</strong> in the form and to boxes and click <strong>Generate to see the virtual resource usage</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/ce72f5bf16ff4aff82627a73bcca0364.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Now you can have a  <strong>pre defined usage report</strong>  of your virtual resources.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Reporting\n\n\n## Cost & Usage Reports in Stackbill Cloud Management Portal <span id=\"cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n-  The Billing option can be found on the left side of the portal.\n-   The screen displays a pop-up menu. To view or download the invoice, click on the **Invoice** option from the menu.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/be4729eafbc245a48ffe13fa0c4281e9.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n\n-   The **Report** screen appears.\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/7f53c6e11a6d40eba6faa4a548f9d711.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n-   You can see two option namely **Usage summary**, and **usage detail**.\n-   click on the **Usage summary**\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/69e29f814f9a44dd819a4a267e74d15b.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n-   You can **see the virtual resource usage** by entering a date in the form and to boxes on the usage summary screen.\n-   You can have a **detailed usage report of the virtual resource** below and you can be able to download the usage report.\n-   Click on the  **Usage detail**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/30df93ce56bd4274b66d6674f8044b10.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n-   The usage report screen shows the usage of particular virtual resources in the portal.\n    \n-   Mention the **date** in the form and to boxes and click **Generate to see the virtual resource usage**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/ce72f5bf16ff4aff82627a73bcca0364.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n-   Now you can have a  **pre defined usage report**  of your virtual resources.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------\n\n\n**About Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**','\0','Reporting','user-guide/billing/reporting',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',91,'c19e1ffc-1a6b-4f51-858a-259305e954e9',NULL,6,NULL,175,0,'cms_e954e9'),
(92,35,34,2,'2023-09-27 13:16:52','<h1>Informes</h1>\n<h2>Informes de costo y uso en el portal de administración de la nube Stackbill <span id=\"cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"><span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>La opción Facturación la puedes encontrar en el lado izquierdo del portal.</li>\n<li>La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. Para ver o descargar la factura, haga clic en la opción <strong>Factura</strong> del menú.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/be4729eafbc245a48ffe13fa0c4281e9.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aparece la pantalla <strong>Informe</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/7f53c6e11a6d40eba6faa4a548f9d711.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Puede ver dos opciones: <strong>Resumen de uso</strong> y <strong>detalle de uso</strong>.</li>\n<li>haga clic en <strong>Resumen de uso</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/69e29f814f9a44dd819a4a267e74d15b.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Puede <strong>ver el uso de recursos virtuales</strong> ingresando una fecha en el formulario y en los cuadros en la pantalla de resumen de uso.</li>\n<li>Puede tener un <strong>informe de uso detallado del recurso virtual</strong> a continuación y podrá descargar el informe de uso.</li>\n<li>Haga clic en <strong>Detalle de uso</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/30df93ce56bd4274b66d6674f8044b10.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>La pantalla de informe de uso muestra el uso de recursos virtuales particulares en el portal.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Mencione la <strong>fecha</strong> en el formulario y en los cuadros y haga clic en <strong>Generar para ver el uso de recursos virtuales</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/ce72f5bf16ff4aff82627a73bcca0364.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Ahora puedes tener un <strong>reporte de uso predefinido</strong> de tus recursos virtuales.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gestión de Nubes</a> con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Informes\n\n\n## Informes de costo y uso en el portal de administración de la nube Stackbill <span id=\"cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"><span>\n\n- La opción Facturación la puedes encontrar en el lado izquierdo del portal.\n- La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. Para ver o descargar la factura, haga clic en la opción **Factura** del menú.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/be4729eafbc245a48ffe13fa0c4281e9.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n\n- Aparece la pantalla **Informe**.\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/7f53c6e11a6d40eba6faa4a548f9d711.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- Puede ver dos opciones: **Resumen de uso** y **detalle de uso**.\n- haga clic en **Resumen de uso**\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/69e29f814f9a44dd819a4a267e74d15b.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- Puede **ver el uso de recursos virtuales** ingresando una fecha en el formulario y en los cuadros en la pantalla de resumen de uso.\n- Puede tener un **informe de uso detallado del recurso virtual** a continuación y podrá descargar el informe de uso.\n- Haga clic en **Detalle de uso**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/30df93ce56bd4274b66d6674f8044b10.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- La pantalla de informe de uso muestra el uso de recursos virtuales particulares en el portal.\n    \n- Mencione la **fecha** en el formulario y en los cuadros y haga clic en **Generar para ver el uso de recursos virtuales**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/ce72f5bf16ff4aff82627a73bcca0364.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- Ahora puedes tener un **reporte de uso predefinido** de tus recursos virtuales.\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo [Portal de Gestión de Nubes](https://localhost:8080/) con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.**','\0','Informes','guía-del-usuario/facturación/informes',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',91,'5055d353-5cee-4412-9ad5-46a539e9782f',NULL,6,NULL,175,0,'cms_e9782f'),
(93,36,34,2,'2023-09-27 13:17:31','<h1>Comunicando</h1>\n<h2>Relatórios de custo e uso no portal de gerenciamento de nuvem Stackbill <span id=\"cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A opção Faturamento pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.</li>\n<li>A tela exibe um menu pop-up. Para visualizar ou baixar a fatura, clique na opção <strong>Fatura</strong> do menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/be4729eafbc245a48ffe13fa0c4281e9.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>A tela <strong>Relatório</strong> é exibida.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/7f53c6e11a6d40eba6faa4a548f9d711.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Você pode ver duas opções: <strong>Resumo de uso</strong> e <strong>Detalhes de uso</strong>.</li>\n<li>clique em <strong>Resumo de uso</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/69e29f814f9a44dd819a4a267e74d15b.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Você pode <strong>ver o uso de recursos virtuais</strong> inserindo uma data no formulário e nas caixas da tela de resumo de uso.</li>\n<li>Você pode ter um <strong>relatório de uso detalhado do recurso virtual</strong> abaixo e fazer o download do relatório de uso.</li>\n<li>Clique em <strong>Detalhes de uso</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/30df93ce56bd4274b66d6674f8044b10.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>A tela do relatório de uso mostra o uso de determinados recursos virtuais no portal.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Mencione a <strong>data</strong> no formulário e nas caixas e clique em <strong>Gerar para ver o uso do recurso virtual</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/ce72f5bf16ff4aff82627a73bcca0364.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Agora você pode ter um <strong>relatório de utilização pré-definido</strong> dos seus recursos virtuais.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens</a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Comunicando\n\n\n## Relatórios de custo e uso no portal de gerenciamento de nuvem Stackbill <span id=\"cost--usage-reports-in-Stackbill-cloud-management-portal\"></span>\n\n- A opção Faturamento pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.\n- A tela exibe um menu pop-up. Para visualizar ou baixar a fatura, clique na opção **Fatura** do menu.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/be4729eafbc245a48ffe13fa0c4281e9.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n\n- A tela **Relatório** é exibida.\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/7f53c6e11a6d40eba6faa4a548f9d711.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- Você pode ver duas opções: **Resumo de uso** e **Detalhes de uso**.\n- clique em **Resumo de uso**\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/69e29f814f9a44dd819a4a267e74d15b.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- Você pode **ver o uso de recursos virtuais** inserindo uma data no formulário e nas caixas da tela de resumo de uso.\n- Você pode ter um **relatório de uso detalhado do recurso virtual** abaixo e fazer o download do relatório de uso.\n- Clique em **Detalhes de uso**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/30df93ce56bd4274b66d6674f8044b10.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- A tela do relatório de uso mostra o uso de determinados recursos virtuais no portal.\n    \n- Mencione a **data** no formulário e nas caixas e clique em **Gerar para ver o uso do recurso virtual**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/Reports/ce72f5bf16ff4aff82627a73bcca0364.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- Agora você pode ter um **relatório de utilização pré-definido** dos seus recursos virtuais.\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Sobre Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo [Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.**','\0','Comunicando','guia-de-usuario/cobrança/comunicando',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',91,'f4f3b331-8fc8-4f49-be46-ccfe5dfbc7f2',NULL,6,NULL,175,0,'cms_fbc7f2'),
(94,37,37,2,'2023-09-27 13:23:04','<h1>Introduction</h1>\n<p>In the organization section in <strong>Stackbill </strong> user can view the flow of the <strong>user profile, user manager, RBAC, quota limit, maintenance, and my Activity.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>User profile</strong>: This refers to the information associated with a user account, such as their Change Password, Payment Settings, Credits &amp; Promo code, Notification settings any other relevant details.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>User manager</strong>: This refers to the tool or interface used to manage user accounts, including adding new users, modifying existing users, and deleting users.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>RBAC</strong>: This stands for <strong>Role-Based Access Control</strong>, which is a method of granting different levels of access to resources based on a user\'s role or job function.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Quota limit</strong>: This refers to a limit placed on the amount of resources (such as storage space and bandwidth etc..,) that a user is allowed to consume.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>My Activity</strong>: This refers to a feature that allows users to view their activity in the <strong>Stackbill Portal.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/organization/User-Profile#setting-up-profile-in-Stackbill-\">User profile</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/organization/User-Profile#add-user-in-Stackbill-\">User Manager</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/organization/User-Profile#setting-up-role-privileges-in-Stackbill-\">RBAC</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/organization/User-Profile#quota-manager-in-Stackbill-\">Quota Limit</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/organization/User-Profile#my-activity-in-Stackbill-\">My Activity</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Introduction\n\n\nIn the organization section in **Stackbill ** user can view the flow of the **user profile, user manager, RBAC, quota limit, maintenance, and my Activity.**\n\n- **User profile**: This refers to the information associated with a user account, such as their Change Password, Payment Settings, Credits & Promo code, Notification settings any other relevant details.\n- **User manager**: This refers to the tool or interface used to manage user accounts, including adding new users, modifying existing users, and deleting users.\n- **RBAC**: This stands for **Role-Based Access Control**, which is a method of granting different levels of access to resources based on a user\'s role or job function.\n- **Quota limit**: This refers to a limit placed on the amount of resources (such as storage space and bandwidth etc..,) that a user is allowed to consume.\n- **My Activity**: This refers to a feature that allows users to view their activity in the **Stackbill Portal.**\n\n\n- [User profile](/help/docs/user-guide/organization/User-Profile#setting-up-profile-in-Stackbill-)\n- [User Manager](/help/docs/user-guide/organization/User-Profile#add-user-in-Stackbill-)\n- [RBAC](/help/docs/user-guide/organization/User-Profile#setting-up-role-privileges-in-Stackbill-)\n- [Quota Limit](/help/docs/user-guide/organization/User-Profile#quota-manager-in-Stackbill-)\n- [My Activity](/help/docs/user-guide/organization/User-Profile#my-activity-in-Stackbill-)\n\n-----------------------------------------------------\n\n\n**About Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**','\0','Introduction','user-guide/organization/introduction',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',94,'d4d899b9-8eab-4e4d-87e7-2468794cb40f',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_4cb40f'),
(95,39,37,2,'2023-09-27 13:24:00','<h1>Introducción</h1>\n<p>En la sección de organización en <strong>Stackbill </strong>, el usuario puede ver el flujo del <strong>perfil de usuario, administrador de usuarios, RBAC, límite de cuota, mantenimiento y mi actividad.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Perfil de usuario</strong>: esto se refiere a la información asociada con una cuenta de usuario, como su cambio de contraseña, configuración de pago, créditos y código promocional, configuración de notificación y otros detalles relevantes.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Administrador de usuarios</strong>: se refiere a la herramienta o interfaz utilizada para administrar cuentas de usuario, incluida la adición de nuevos usuarios, la modificación de usuarios existentes y la eliminación de usuarios.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>RBAC</strong>: Esto significa <strong>Control de acceso basado en roles</strong>, que es un método para otorgar diferentes niveles de acceso a recursos según el rol o función laboral de un usuario.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Límite de cuota</strong>: esto se refiere a un límite impuesto a la cantidad de recursos (como espacio de almacenamiento y ancho de banda, etc.) que un usuario puede consumir.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Mi actividad</strong>: esto se refiere a una función que permite a los usuarios ver su actividad en el <strong>Portal Stackbill.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/organización/perfil-del-usuario#configurando-perfil-en-LaNube-\">Perfil de usuario</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/organización/perfil-del-usuario#agregar-usuario-en-LaNube-\">Administrador de usuarios</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/organización/perfil-del-usuario#configuración-de-privilegios-de-rol-en-LaNube-\">RBAC</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/organización/perfil-del-usuario#administrador-de-cuotas-en-la-nube-\">Límite de cuota</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/organización/perfil-del-usuario#mi-actividad-en-Stackbill-\">Mi actividad</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo e intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de gestión de la nube</a> con amplias funciones que aprovechan Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia de última generación.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Introducción\n\n\nEn la sección de organización en **Stackbill **, el usuario puede ver el flujo del **perfil de usuario, administrador de usuarios, RBAC, límite de cuota, mantenimiento y mi actividad.**\n\n- **Perfil de usuario**: esto se refiere a la información asociada con una cuenta de usuario, como su cambio de contraseña, configuración de pago, créditos y código promocional, configuración de notificación y otros detalles relevantes.\n- **Administrador de usuarios**: se refiere a la herramienta o interfaz utilizada para administrar cuentas de usuario, incluida la adición de nuevos usuarios, la modificación de usuarios existentes y la eliminación de usuarios.\n- **RBAC**: Esto significa **Control de acceso basado en roles**, que es un método para otorgar diferentes niveles de acceso a recursos según el rol o función laboral de un usuario.\n- **Límite de cuota**: esto se refiere a un límite impuesto a la cantidad de recursos (como espacio de almacenamiento y ancho de banda, etc.) que un usuario puede consumir.\n- **Mi actividad**: esto se refiere a una función que permite a los usuarios ver su actividad en el **Portal Stackbill.**\n\n\n- [Perfil de usuario](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/organización/perfil-del-usuario#configurando-perfil-en-LaNube-)\n- [Administrador de usuarios](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/organización/perfil-del-usuario#agregar-usuario-en-LaNube-)\n- [RBAC](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/organización/perfil-del-usuario#configuración-de-privilegios-de-rol-en-LaNube-)\n- [Límite de cuota](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/organización/perfil-del-usuario#administrador-de-cuotas-en-la-nube-)\n- [Mi actividad](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/organización/perfil-del-usuario#mi-actividad-en-Stackbill-)\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] es un completo e intuitivo [Portal de gestión de la nube](https://localhost:8080/) con amplias funciones que aprovechan Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia de última generación.**','\0','Introducción','guía-del-usuario/organización/introducci-n',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',94,'9b1409d6-a01a-46f4-a9b8-a2496ebd3e53',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_bd3e53'),
(96,38,37,2,'2023-09-27 13:25:29','<h1>Introdução</h1>\n<p>Na seção de organização no <strong>Stackbill </strong> o usuário pode visualizar o fluxo do <strong>perfil do usuário, gerenciador de usuários, RBAC, limite de cota, manutenção e minha atividade.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Perfil do usuário</strong>: refere-se às informações associadas a uma conta de usuário, como alteração de senha, configurações de pagamento, créditos e código promocional, configurações de notificação e quaisquer outros detalhes relevantes.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Gerenciador de usuários</strong>: refere-se à ferramenta ou interface usada para gerenciar contas de usuários, incluindo adição de novos usuários, modificação de usuários existentes e exclusão de usuários.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>RBAC</strong>: significa <strong>Role-Based Access Control</strong>, que é um método de conceder diferentes níveis de acesso a recursos com base na função ou função de um usuário.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Limite de cota</strong>: Refere-se a um limite colocado na quantidade de recursos (como espaço de armazenamento e largura de banda, etc.) que um usuário pode consumir.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Minha atividade</strong>: refere-se a um recurso que permite aos usuários visualizar suas atividades no <strong>Portal Stackbill.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/organização/perfil-de-usuário#configurando-perfil-no-Cloud-\">Perfil do usuário</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/organização/perfil-de-usuário#add-user-in-Stackbill-\">Gerenciador de usuários</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/organização/perfil-de-usuário#definindo-privilégios-de-função-no-Cloud-\">RBAC</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/organização/perfil-de-usuário#gerenciador-de-cotas-na-nuvem-\">Limite de cota</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/organização/perfil-de-usuário#minha-atividade-na-nuvem-\">Minha atividade</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de gerenciamento de nuvem</a> completo e intuitivo de autoatendimento com amplos recursos que aproveitam Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência de última geração.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Introdução\n\n\nNa seção de organização no **Stackbill ** o usuário pode visualizar o fluxo do **perfil do usuário, gerenciador de usuários, RBAC, limite de cota, manutenção e minha atividade.**\n\n- **Perfil do usuário**: refere-se às informações associadas a uma conta de usuário, como alteração de senha, configurações de pagamento, créditos e código promocional, configurações de notificação e quaisquer outros detalhes relevantes.\n- **Gerenciador de usuários**: refere-se à ferramenta ou interface usada para gerenciar contas de usuários, incluindo adição de novos usuários, modificação de usuários existentes e exclusão de usuários.\n- **RBAC**: significa **Role-Based Access Control**, que é um método de conceder diferentes níveis de acesso a recursos com base na função ou função de um usuário.\n- **Limite de cota**: Refere-se a um limite colocado na quantidade de recursos (como espaço de armazenamento e largura de banda, etc.) que um usuário pode consumir.\n- **Minha atividade**: refere-se a um recurso que permite aos usuários visualizar suas atividades no **Portal Stackbill.**\n\n\n- [Perfil do usuário](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/organização/perfil-de-usuário#configurando-perfil-no-Cloud-)\n- [Gerenciador de usuários](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/organização/perfil-de-usuário#add-user-in-Stackbill-)\n- [RBAC](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/organização/perfil-de-usuário#definindo-privilégios-de-função-no-Cloud-)\n- [Limite de cota](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/organização/perfil-de-usuário#gerenciador-de-cotas-na-nuvem-)\n- [Minha atividade](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/organização/perfil-de-usuário#minha-atividade-na-nuvem-)\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Sobre Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] é um [Portal de gerenciamento de nuvem](https://localhost:8080/) completo e intuitivo de autoatendimento com amplos recursos que aproveitam Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência de última geração.**','\0','Introdução','guia-de-usuario/organização/introdu-o',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',94,'6f26755d-7cdc-47fa-843c-ae7355c89636',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_c89636'),
(97,1,1,2,'2023-09-27 13:37:25','<h1><strong>What\'s New</strong></h1>\n<p>In the provided below document, <strong><a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Stackbill </a> users can explore the most recent release in Stackbill .</strong></p>\n<h2>Stackbill\'s Native Helpdesk</h2>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/b5c05e1a1e6b406bbe12068870b245d3.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<p>In the dynamic landscape of the <strong>public cloud service industry</strong>, customer support plays a pivotal role in nurturing a <strong>strong customer-provider relationship</strong>. Acknowledging the significance of a robust helpdesk, <strong>Stackbill </strong> has introduced its own integrated helpdesk, empowering cloud tenants to seamlessly communicate with their cloud providers through the user portal.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Stackbill helpdesk acts as a bridge, connecting tenants</strong> cloud requirements with the expertise of cloud admins, who are dedicated to understanding and delivering effective solutions promptly and efficiently.</p>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/6cff4ab4df504095afa1698e6eb6bb56.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<p>Through the helpdesk, tenants can effortlessly raise support issues with the cloud provider and even attach relevant documents and screenshots to expedite problem resolution. Moreover, tenants can stay updated with email notifications when the support team responds to their requests.</p>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/015b17dc04fd477099ccf52b275d92c3.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<p>Taking self-help to the next level, tenants can also leverage the Knowledgebase and FAQs to resolve common issues independently before seeking further assistance from the customer support team. This approach enables tenants to address basic problems on their own and reach out to support only when necessary, fostering a more streamlined support process.</p>\n<p>With <strong>Stackbill\'s Integrated Helpdesk</strong>, the <strong>public cloud service experience</strong> becomes more <strong>user-friendly and customer-oriented, leading to enhanced satisfaction and efficient problem-solving.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Features of Stackbill Native Helpdesk:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add support Agents and assign roles</li>\n<li>Track response time, resolution time and support agents performance</li>\n<li>Generate monthly reports to analyze the service health.</li>\n<li>Email notifications for support team and tenants</li>\n<li>Supports attachments in different format with the support request</li>\n<li>Escalate the support requests internally</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Configure customized Sliders in Stackbill User panel login page.</h2>\n<p>Below is a guide to <strong>setting up customized sliders on Stackbill login page.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Using the credentials, <strong>log in to the admin panel</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/f01a0fe6fc8d472790393fd9ebf36bcd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>An option called <strong>Configuration</strong> can be found at the left side of the panel. Click on it to view the drop-down menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/20193669927445a4a0d38ddf9ca52aa6.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>From the drop down select on the <strong>General</strong> option.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/547fda7d18a641038ed8ee156cdcca0d.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>General configurations</strong> screens appears.</li>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Sliders option.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/5ba04bbc60bd40218030ac711e342610.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>The Slider option appears on the screen. Click on the <strong>Add Slider</strong> option on the right side of the panel.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/2719a295dc8d47f39ad3871d89320824.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Page Type</strong> - Select the Page Type</li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::info\nNote: As per the current release user can configure customized slide\nonly on the login page.\n:::</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Name</strong> - Specify a name in the name box.</li>\n<li><strong>Description</strong> - Specify a description on the description box.</li>\n<li><strong>Interval</strong> - Set the interval in milliseconds (i.e., how many seconds the slide should move).</li>\n<li>Attach the sIides and logo as per your requirement within the specified dimension mentioned.</li>\n<li>Finally, Click on Save button.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/6a1519d3150246c49e29ebd80564e77b.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Another slide can be added using the same format. The new slide will appear below the existing slide.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/3fb21c6d36984907899fcb2c4710d531.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<p>:::success\n<strong>Now the custom slides has been updated successfully.</strong>\n:::</p>\n<h2>Integrate Social Media Backlinks on the User Panel Footer.</h2>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/a263443eb46449eeb7e50a39838b1672.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<p>Below is a guide to <strong>setting up Social Media Backlinks on the User Panel.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Using the credentials, log in to the admin panel</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/f01a0fe6fc8d472790393fd9ebf36bcd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>An option called Configuration can be found at the left side of the panel. Click on it to view the drop-down menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/20193669927445a4a0d38ddf9ca52aa6.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>From the drop down select on the <strong>General</strong> option.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>From the general option click on the Organization Details option.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/ecce78b276434eac814d6846564ac17f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Organization Details</strong> screens appears</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/6240f15e3e194fbbac652e5339a98402.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>On the <strong>social media category</strong> the administrator can configure their social media backlinks which may appears on the footer of the user panel of the portal.</li>\n<li>Finally, Click on the <strong>update button</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/4a993c9fab30403198dcb013bccb051b.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Social media links have now been configured successfully and can be verified from the user panel.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/3d809aff86694c398e022d71f552de84.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<h2>Grouping Templates in Stackbill </h2>\n<p>Below is a guide to Grouping Templates in Stackbill .</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Using the credentials, log in to the admin panel</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/f01a0fe6fc8d472790393fd9ebf36bcd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>An option called <strong>Service</strong> can be found at the left side of the panel. Click on it to view the drop-down menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/bd661f9fd7a2480d9ccefbb5af1bf0de.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>From the drop down click on the <strong>Offering Category</strong> option.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/3fbf077eb7574246a619a5960662d829.png\" width=\"40%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>From the Offering Category option user can able to see a <strong>filter option. - Click on the dropdown icon to view the offering.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/2c37ae1734794134b4b47f252c59a180.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>From dropdown select <strong>VM Grouping option</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/c166673ebc0a46449424d35a8cea1946.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>VM Grouping screen appears.</li>\n<li>At right side of the panel admin can able to see a option called <strong>Add category</strong>. Click on it to create a new category.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/4a2123543357445db19f53605f113545.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<p><strong>Create category screen appears</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Name</strong> - Specify a name for the category.</li>\n<li><strong>Type</strong> - Select the type as VM Grouping. and select on which type the category offering should be created either in OS or marketplace. select as per the requirement, for the demonstration let select OS type.</li>\n<li>Upload the icon for the offerings you are creating as per the mentioned dimension.</li>\n<li><strong>Notes</strong> - Specify a notes in the notes column.</li>\n<li>Finally, Click <strong>Add</strong> button.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/1b2aae68e06c42c9bfe38c1f25cec45b.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Now the offering has been created successfully.</li>\n<li>On the right side of the panel there is a icon called <strong>Template Grouping Configuration.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/a63e3b4f43974f36bea2b914d30c4957.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Click on it to add OS flavors into the offering.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/5d1db422bd1e4a1c9053bd3dd86c2d6a.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Select the OS flavors as per the requirement and click Update button.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Now the Template grouping has been added successfully.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/8a079e930dc046f9847792d343309fc6.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Login to user panel to view <strong>the template grouping</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/b5301f7d51654699bcb0eef5db9e7eef.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Now the VM Grouping has been added successfully.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Sub domain support in Stackbill </h2>\n<p>Welcome to sub domain configuration guide.</p>\n<p>This guide is designed to assist admin in configuring their subdomains for the user panel.</p>\n<h3>Enabling subdomain option to user panel</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Login into the admin portal using the login credentials</li>\n<li>Admin panel dashboard appears on the screen.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/e50dd8346d8542918e04cb122e8d270f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>At left side of the panel the user can be able to see an option called <strong>Configuration option</strong>, click on it to view the dropdown.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/941a2d2a55f44606bd6bce9d1c997658.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>From the dropdown, click on the <strong>general</strong> option and select <strong>feature configuration</strong> from the list.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/1b433b0294da4f17b39de708135a66f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>After clicking the <strong>feature configuration</strong> at the right side of the panel, the user can see an option for <strong>quick search</strong>. On the quick search, enter the <strong>subdomain</strong> and click search.</li>\n<li>The <strong>subdomain</strong> option will now appear, click on it.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/01124b33970a4cf68c8378ae3216d138.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<p>:::info\n<strong>Note : The subdomain option will appear on the user panel when the Value option is true.</strong>\n:::</p>\n<p>This guide is designed to assist users to create New Subdomain.</p>\n<h2>Subdomain Structure</h2>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/2c1e408eb7eb44068891632137ab3776.jpg\" width=\"90%\" />\n<h3>Creating New Subdomain</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Login into the <strong>user portal</strong> using the login credentials</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/e91e908ea0844cb3b5e05e813a90bf4a.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>User portal appears on the screen.</li>\n<li>On the left side of the portal user can able to see a option called <strong>Company</strong>,click on it to view the list of option.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/8227795b6abe4dfba7d15194d70aeda6.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>From list select <strong>sub domain</strong>.</li>\n<li>Subdomain screen appears.</li>\n<li>At right side of the panel the user can able to see a option called <strong>Add subdomain option</strong>, click on it to create new subdomain.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/c94891e40cb34979b35493eee34e6cc2.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Fill the details on reqired field and click <strong>Add</strong> button, to create a new subdomain.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/6af7d0a63ca24daa9efc6965ce256e49.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Domain</strong> - Select the parent domain within which the new domain should be created</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/93665088da5a4ffe8178c312d6945c35.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Finally, click ok button.</li>\n<li>On the list page, the user can see the newly added subdomain.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/60ac08cfc1014d1c978d4acb78e8d4d0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>On the right side of the panel, Under <strong>Actions</strong>, the user can <strong>edit, disable, delete, and login as a user</strong> of the subdomain.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/ea49474494e14533b0c45fa262aff34d.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Edit</strong> - Users or parent domain can edit the basic data like name,address,mobile number,mail id,and much more.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/43bd62dd36924d6fb5a18a408b3a62ce.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Disable Subdomain</strong> - By using the <strong>disable option</strong>, the parent domain can disable the subdomain created below it.</li>\n<li>When you click on the <strong>disable subdomain</strong> button, you will be notified as a <strong>confirmation screen with instructions</strong>. Please read them carefully and proceed accordingly.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::info\n<strong>When you disable the parent domain, corresponding subdomain also will be disable automattically.</strong>\n:::</p>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/cc198e35a0dd4e0abd0e337fd374b7ea.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>To delete a subdomain, click the <strong>delete</strong> button in the action option.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/9aedc7e5029643419566304b96506b45.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Once you click on the <strong>delete subdoamin</strong> option you will be notified as a <strong>confirmation screen with instructions</strong>. Please read them carefully and proceed accordingly.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/4b369254048f448b9e994bb39e6be081.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Finally, click Ok to delete the subdomain.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/a9ec7bd85f574236afe0043949d4b65d.png\" width=\"70%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>By clicking the <strong>Login as a user button</strong>, the parent domain can login as its subdomain user.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Manage Subdomain quota</h3>\n<p>:::info</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>The resources quota for <strong>parent domain</strong> is allocated by the <strong>root admin</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The reources quota for <strong>Subdomain</strong> is allocated by the <strong>parent domain</strong>\n:::</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Login into the <strong>user portal</strong> using the login credentials</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/33e629ad5817453e85d2f42e8fb36c70.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>User portal appears on the screen.</li>\n<li>On the left side of the portal user can able to see a option called <strong>Company</strong>,click on it to view the list of option.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/c389673443f649c199f549980c2e1b68.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>From the dropdown select <strong>Manage Subdomain quota</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/2f0a7dbfe8df4df1a523ab952c391ed5.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Manage Subdomain quota</strong> screen appears.</li>\n<li>Click on the <strong>subdomain</strong> to view the list of subdomain from the dropdown.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/55697cadb24a451ea2d234c62b62d397.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Select the <strong>subdomain</strong> to view the resources quota.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/e9c2967e89ac438cafb4ba863ba71127.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Here the parent domain can allocate the resouces to the subdomains as per the requirement.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Subdomain Usage Summary</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Login into the <strong>user portal</strong> using the login credentials</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/33e629ad5817453e85d2f42e8fb36c70.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>User portal appears on the screen.</li>\n<li>On the left side of the portal user can able to see a option called <strong>Billing</strong>, click on it to view the list of option.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/7d46b24684834835ac1ad6fe2498ea29.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>From the dropdown select <strong>Subdomain usage summary</strong>, click on it.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/5fc6fe20a3db474787f92792e04afc96.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Subdomain usage summary</strong> screen appears</li>\n<li>Specify a date in from and to input fields and click <strong>generate</strong> button.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/17287a8e329644eaa7c2b48cb70f2310.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Subdomain usage reports appear on the screen and the parent domain can download the reports as <strong>XLSX or PDF</strong> documents</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Billing configuration on subdomains</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Login into the <strong>user portal</strong> using the login credentials</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/e91e908ea0844cb3b5e05e813a90bf4a.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>User portal appears on the screen.</li>\n<li>On the left side of the portal user can able to see a option called <strong>Company</strong>,click on it to view the list of option.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/28d9b03dba6042b0895fd654a2e19bfb.png\" width=\"60%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>From the dropdown click on <strong>User</strong> option.</li>\n<li>User screen appears.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/22bb2c27fa50451687308e37f1b4a111.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>At right side of the panel user can able to see a option to edit.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/e219ca5757404ba4b751069db6473a1a.png\" width=\"40%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>click on the <strong>edit</strong> button on the <strong>action</strong> menu.</li>\n<li>Edit user screen appears.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/d5e9312b6e3d415d87893ccf913ba401.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<p>:::info\n<strong>By enabling the group subdomain billing option, the parent domain can bill the root domain for subdomain billing usages</strong>.\n:::</p>\n<ul>\n<li>When the <strong>group subdomain billing option</strong> is enabled, the <strong>parent domain can pay for the usage of the entire subdomain</strong>.</li>\n<li>Finally, Click on <strong>update</strong> button to update the changes.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/bb3eb6d19b204d5b9175e10696886a2c.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<p>:::info\n<strong>By disabling the group subdomain billing option, the subdomain can pay the billing directly to the root domain</strong>.\n:::</p>\n<h2>Admin Notification alerts.</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Using the credentials, <strong>log in to the admin panel</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/f01a0fe6fc8d472790393fd9ebf36bcd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>An option called <strong>Configuration</strong> can be found at the left side of the panel. Click on it to view the drop-down menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/0508122c31b94e0db09394b64664f1b3.png\" width=\"50%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>From the dropdown click on <strong>Notification</strong> option.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/b77c0a2fc5d2420db67668369c38bbc8.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Notification screen appears.</li>\n<li>Here is the steps to configure admin notification for instance creation / deletion.</li>\n<li>Click on the <strong>admin notification for instance creation / deletion</strong> option.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/99f20cde5d6a46cd8c4ae048203ec0ca.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Admin notification for instance creation / deletion option appears on the screen.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/ece5ae57e8564890944113e30d469777.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Language</strong> - Select the language as per the requirement.</li>\n<li><strong>Upload Template</strong> - Upload the email template using this option</li>\n<li><strong>Subject for instance creation</strong> - Specify the subject content for instance creation mail.</li>\n<li><strong>Subject for instance deletion</strong> - Specify the subject content for instance deletion mail.</li>\n<li><strong>To</strong> - Specify the <strong>TO</strong> address and can add <strong>CC</strong> address in the CC field.</li>\n<li><strong>Turn ON/OFF</strong> - By enabling <strong>ON</strong> button the notification will send to the concern person.By enabling <strong>Off</strong> button the notification will not send to the concern person.</li>\n<li>Finally, Click <strong>Update</strong> button.</li>\n<li>Now the configuration made successfull.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Steps to configure admin notification for new user signup.</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Click on the <strong>admin notification for for new user signup</strong> option.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/e54f51161571465bb8cff28bcc372664.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Admin notification for new user signup screen appears.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/be78b86c5948486ea469c817520f81b5.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Language</strong> - Select the language as per the requirement.</li>\n<li><strong>Upload Template</strong> - Upload the email template using this option</li>\n<li><strong>Subject</strong> - Specify the subject content for new account signup mail.</li>\n<li><strong>To</strong> - Specify the <strong>TO</strong> address and can add <strong>CC</strong> address in the CC field.</li>\n<li><strong>Turn ON/OFF</strong> - By enabling <strong>ON</strong> button the notification will send to the concern person.By enabling <strong>Off</strong> button the notification will not send to the concern person.</li>\n<li>Finally, Click <strong>Update</strong> button.</li>\n<li>Now the configuration made successfull.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Auto Configuration of Firewall rules.</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Login into user panel using your credentials.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/b7ed168456604a8ba087920ecec9c81d.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>At left side of the panel user can able to see a option called <strong>Network</strong>. Click on it to view the dropdown.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/98ea5d4151ad4786bc12b86d5cd23829.png\" width=\"40%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>From the dropdown select <strong>Security groups</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Security group</strong> screen appears.At right side of the panel user can able to see a option <strong>ADD</strong> button click on it.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/478f03a68520484ea072b6116ed964a1.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Add security group</strong> screen appears.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/699e1c17f5834cf7850a12db2f5a51e8.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Name</strong> - Specify a name for the security that has been creating.</li>\n<li><strong>Description</strong> - Specify a short notes on description field.</li>\n<li>Select the status, Finally click on <strong>Add</strong> button.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/ac43f459373142cb9f65700ab66b6a26.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Now the <strong>security group</strong> has been created sucessfully.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/ac1d7524378d4c069b3c6dab262b3acc.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>From the <strong>Action menu</strong> on the right side of the panel, users can manage security groups by clicking on the <strong>manage</strong> icon.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/6e4396ffd1bc4a95ac2b29780591bda1.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Add a firewall rule by clicking on the <strong>Add Rule</strong> part</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/897362708f69488eb7b0e97a40a820de.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Fill the required fields and click <strong>Add Rule</strong> button.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/536605f558ca4721a0003e94cdaf466c.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Firewall rule has been created successfully.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/ec452f71d628442aa561a7b657f8f016.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Go to the instance creation page to check the Auto Configuration of Firewall rules.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Now the the Auto Configuration of Firewall rules has been created successfully when launching a VM in Stackbill .</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>ACS Native Autoscaling / Stackbill Autoscaling</h2>\n<p>In Stackbill , users have the flexibility to choose between two types of autoscaling based on their preferences one is ACS native autoscaling and Stackbill Autoscaling. They can easily enable their preferred option by following the guide below.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Login into admin panel using credentials.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/7a4e39a0383a48da8105fea1750db5c5.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>At left side of the panel user can able to see a option called <strong>configuration</strong>. Click on it to view the dropdown.</li>\n<li>From the dropdown select <strong>General</strong> option and click on <strong>Feature Configuration</strong> option.</li>\n<li>Feature configuration screen appears.At right side of the panel user can able to see a option for search option.</li>\n<li>On the search option type <strong>Autoscaling</strong> and click search button.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/96eb2bbd07e143aba9ca228d07079ecf.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Autoscaling configuration appears on the screen.</li>\n<li>Click on the edit option available on the action menu to edit the autoscaling configuration.</li>\n<li>If the user enter the value as <strong>Native</strong> ACS Native autoscaling enables to the user portal.</li>\n<li>If the user enter the value as <strong>Stackbill</strong> Stackbill autoscaling enables to the user panel.</li>\n</ul>\n','',1,'# **What\'s New**\r\n\r\nIn the provided below document, **[Stackbill ](https://localhost:8080/) users can explore the most recent release in Stackbill .**\r\n\r\n## Stackbill\'s Native Helpdesk\r\n\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/b5c05e1a1e6b406bbe12068870b245d3.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nIn the dynamic landscape of the **public cloud service industry**, customer support plays a pivotal role in nurturing a **strong customer-provider relationship**. Acknowledging the significance of a robust helpdesk, **Stackbill ** has introduced its own integrated helpdesk, empowering cloud tenants to seamlessly communicate with their cloud providers through the user portal.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe **Stackbill helpdesk acts as a bridge, connecting tenants** cloud requirements with the expertise of cloud admins, who are dedicated to understanding and delivering effective solutions promptly and efficiently.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/6cff4ab4df504095afa1698e6eb6bb56.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nThrough the helpdesk, tenants can effortlessly raise support issues with the cloud provider and even attach relevant documents and screenshots to expedite problem resolution. Moreover, tenants can stay updated with email notifications when the support team responds to their requests.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/015b17dc04fd477099ccf52b275d92c3.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nTaking self-help to the next level, tenants can also leverage the Knowledgebase and FAQs to resolve common issues independently before seeking further assistance from the customer support team. This approach enables tenants to address basic problems on their own and reach out to support only when necessary, fostering a more streamlined support process.\r\n\r\nWith **Stackbill\'s Integrated Helpdesk**, the **public cloud service experience** becomes more **user-friendly and customer-oriented, leading to enhanced satisfaction and efficient problem-solving.**\r\n \r\n**Features of Stackbill Native Helpdesk:**\r\n\r\n- Add support Agents and assign roles\r\n- Track response time, resolution time and support agents performance\r\n- Generate monthly reports to analyze the service health.\r\n- Email notifications for support team and tenants\r\n- Supports attachments in different format with the support request\r\n- Escalate the support requests internally\r\n\r\n\r\n## Configure customized Sliders in Stackbill User panel login page.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n Below is a guide to **setting up customized sliders on Stackbill login page.**\r\n \r\n- Using the credentials, **log in to the admin panel**\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/f01a0fe6fc8d472790393fd9ebf36bcd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- An option called **Configuration** can be found at the left side of the panel. Click on it to view the drop-down menu.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/20193669927445a4a0d38ddf9ca52aa6.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n-  From the drop down select on the **General** option.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/547fda7d18a641038ed8ee156cdcca0d.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- **General configurations** screens appears.\r\n- Click on the **Sliders option.**\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/5ba04bbc60bd40218030ac711e342610.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- The Slider option appears on the screen. Click on the **Add Slider** option on the right side of the panel.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/2719a295dc8d47f39ad3871d89320824.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Page Type** - Select the Page Type \r\n\r\n:::info\r\nNote: As per the current release user can configure customized slide\r\nonly on the login page.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n- **Name** - Specify a name in the name box.\r\n- **Description** - Specify a description on the description box.\r\n- **Interval** - Set the interval in milliseconds (i.e., how many seconds the slide should move).\r\n- Attach the sIides and logo as per your requirement within the specified dimension mentioned.\r\n- Finally, Click on Save button.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/6a1519d3150246c49e29ebd80564e77b.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Another slide can be added using the same format. The new slide will appear below the existing slide.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/3fb21c6d36984907899fcb2c4710d531.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n:::success\r\n**Now the custom slides has been updated successfully.**\r\n:::\r\n\r\n\r\n## Integrate Social Media Backlinks on the User Panel Footer.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/a263443eb46449eeb7e50a39838b1672.png\" width=\"70%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nBelow is a guide to **setting up Social Media Backlinks on the User Panel.**\r\n\r\n- Using the credentials, log in to the admin panel\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/f01a0fe6fc8d472790393fd9ebf36bcd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- An option called Configuration can be found at the left side of the panel. Click on it to view the drop-down menu.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/20193669927445a4a0d38ddf9ca52aa6.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n-  From the drop down select on the **General** option.\r\n\r\n- From the general option click on the Organization Details option.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/ecce78b276434eac814d6846564ac17f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Organization Details** screens appears\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/6240f15e3e194fbbac652e5339a98402.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- On the **social media category** the administrator can configure their social media backlinks which may appears on the footer of the user panel of the portal.\r\n- Finally, Click on the **update button** \r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/4a993c9fab30403198dcb013bccb051b.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Social media links have now been configured successfully and can be verified from the user panel.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/3d809aff86694c398e022d71f552de84.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Grouping Templates in Stackbill \r\n\r\nBelow is a guide to Grouping Templates in Stackbill .\r\n\r\n- Using the credentials, log in to the admin panel\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/f01a0fe6fc8d472790393fd9ebf36bcd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- An option called **Service** can be found at the left side of the panel. Click on it to view the drop-down menu.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/bd661f9fd7a2480d9ccefbb5af1bf0de.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n-  From the drop down click on the **Offering Category** option.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/3fbf077eb7574246a619a5960662d829.png\" width=\"40%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- From the Offering Category option user can able to see a **filter option. - Click on the dropdown icon to view the offering.**\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/2c37ae1734794134b4b47f252c59a180.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- From dropdown select **VM Grouping option**\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/c166673ebc0a46449424d35a8cea1946.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- VM Grouping screen appears. \r\n- At right side of the panel admin can able to see a option called **Add category**. Click on it to create a new category.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/4a2123543357445db19f53605f113545.png\" width=\"70%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n**Create category screen appears**\r\n- **Name** - Specify a name for the category.\r\n- **Type** - Select the type as VM Grouping. and select on which type the category offering should be created either in OS or marketplace. select as per the requirement, for the demonstration let select OS type.\r\n- Upload the icon for the offerings you are creating as per the mentioned dimension.\r\n- **Notes** - Specify a notes in the notes column.\r\n- Finally, Click **Add** button.\r\n\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/1b2aae68e06c42c9bfe38c1f25cec45b.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Now the offering has been created successfully.\r\n- On the right side of the panel there is a icon called **Template Grouping Configuration.**\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/a63e3b4f43974f36bea2b914d30c4957.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n- Click on it to add OS flavors into the offering.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/5d1db422bd1e4a1c9053bd3dd86c2d6a.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Select the OS flavors as per the requirement and click Update button.\r\n\r\n- Now the Template grouping has been added successfully.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/8a079e930dc046f9847792d343309fc6.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Login to user panel to view **the template grouping**\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/b5301f7d51654699bcb0eef5db9e7eef.png\" width=\"70%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- Now the VM Grouping has been added successfully.\r\n\r\n## Sub domain support in Stackbill \r\n\r\nWelcome to sub domain configuration guide.\r\n\r\nThis guide is designed to assist admin in configuring their subdomains for the user panel.\r\n\r\n### Enabling subdomain option to user panel\r\n\r\n- Login into the admin portal using the login credentials\r\n- Admin panel dashboard appears on the screen.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/e50dd8346d8542918e04cb122e8d270f.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- At left side of the panel the user can be able to see an option called **Configuration option**, click on it to view the dropdown.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/941a2d2a55f44606bd6bce9d1c997658.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- From the dropdown, click on the **general** option and select **feature configuration** from the list.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/1b433b0294da4f17b39de708135a66f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- After clicking the **feature configuration** at the right side of the panel, the user can see an option for **quick search**. On the quick search, enter the **subdomain** and click search.\r\n- The **subdomain** option will now appear, click on it.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/01124b33970a4cf68c8378ae3216d138.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n:::info\r\n **Note : The subdomain option will appear on the user panel when the Value option is true.**\r\n:::\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis guide is designed to assist users to create New Subdomain.\r\n\r\n## Subdomain Structure\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/2c1e408eb7eb44068891632137ab3776.jpg\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n### Creating New Subdomain\r\n\r\n- Login into the **user portal** using the login credentials\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/e91e908ea0844cb3b5e05e813a90bf4a.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- User portal appears on the screen.\r\n- On the left side of the portal user can able to see a option called **Company**,click on it to view the list of option.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/8227795b6abe4dfba7d15194d70aeda6.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- From list select **sub domain**.\r\n- Subdomain screen appears.\r\n- At right side of the panel the user can able to see a option called **Add subdomain option**, click on it to create new subdomain.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/c94891e40cb34979b35493eee34e6cc2.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Fill the details on reqired field and click **Add** button, to create a new subdomain.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/6af7d0a63ca24daa9efc6965ce256e49.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Domain** - Select the parent domain within which the new domain should be created\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/93665088da5a4ffe8178c312d6945c35.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Finally, click ok button.\r\n- On the list page, the user can see the newly added subdomain.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/60ac08cfc1014d1c978d4acb78e8d4d0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- On the right side of the panel, Under **Actions**, the user can **edit, disable, delete, and login as a user** of the subdomain.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/ea49474494e14533b0c45fa262aff34d.png\" width=\"60%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Edit** - Users or parent domain can edit the basic data like name,address,mobile number,mail id,and much more.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/43bd62dd36924d6fb5a18a408b3a62ce.png\" width=\"70%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Disable Subdomain** - By using the **disable option**, the parent domain can disable the subdomain created below it.\r\n- When you click on the **disable subdomain** button, you will be notified as a **confirmation screen with instructions**. Please read them carefully and proceed accordingly.\r\n\r\n:::info\r\n**When you disable the parent domain, corresponding subdomain also will be disable automattically.**\r\n:::\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/cc198e35a0dd4e0abd0e337fd374b7ea.png\" width=\"70%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- To delete a subdomain, click the **delete** button in the action option.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/9aedc7e5029643419566304b96506b45.png\" width=\"70%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Once you click on the **delete subdoamin** option you will be notified as a **confirmation screen with instructions**. Please read them carefully and proceed accordingly.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/4b369254048f448b9e994bb39e6be081.png\" width=\"70%\" />\r\n\r\n- Finally, click Ok to delete the subdomain.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/a9ec7bd85f574236afe0043949d4b65d.png\" width=\"70%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- By clicking the **Login as a user button**, the parent domain can login as its subdomain user.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Manage Subdomain quota\r\n\r\n:::info\r\n- The resources quota for **parent domain** is allocated by the **root admin**\r\n- The reources quota for **Subdomain** is allocated by the **parent domain**\r\n::: \r\n\r\n\r\n- Login into the **user portal** using the login credentials\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/33e629ad5817453e85d2f42e8fb36c70.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- User portal appears on the screen.\r\n- On the left side of the portal user can able to see a option called **Company**,click on it to view the list of option.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/c389673443f649c199f549980c2e1b68.png\" width=\"60%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- From the dropdown select **Manage Subdomain quota**.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/2f0a7dbfe8df4df1a523ab952c391ed5.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Manage Subdomain quota** screen appears.\r\n- Click on the **subdomain** to view the list of subdomain from the dropdown.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/55697cadb24a451ea2d234c62b62d397.png\" width=\"60%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Select the **subdomain** to view the resources quota.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/e9c2967e89ac438cafb4ba863ba71127.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Here the parent domain can allocate the resouces to the subdomains as per the requirement.\r\n\r\n## Subdomain Usage Summary\r\n\r\n- Login into the **user portal** using the login credentials\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/33e629ad5817453e85d2f42e8fb36c70.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- User portal appears on the screen.\r\n- On the left side of the portal user can able to see a option called **Billing**, click on it to view the list of option.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/7d46b24684834835ac1ad6fe2498ea29.png\" width=\"60%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- From the dropdown select **Subdomain usage summary**, click on it.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/5fc6fe20a3db474787f92792e04afc96.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Subdomain usage summary** screen appears \r\n- Specify a date in from and to input fields and click **generate** button.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/17287a8e329644eaa7c2b48cb70f2310.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Subdomain usage reports appear on the screen and the parent domain can download the reports as **XLSX or PDF** documents\r\n\r\n## Billing configuration on subdomains\r\n\r\n- Login into the **user portal** using the login credentials\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/e91e908ea0844cb3b5e05e813a90bf4a.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- User portal appears on the screen.\r\n- On the left side of the portal user can able to see a option called **Company**,click on it to view the list of option.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/28d9b03dba6042b0895fd654a2e19bfb.png\" width=\"60%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- From the dropdown click on **User** option.\r\n- User screen appears.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/22bb2c27fa50451687308e37f1b4a111.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- At right side of the panel user can able to see a option to edit.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/e219ca5757404ba4b751069db6473a1a.png\" width=\"40%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- click on the **edit** button on the **action** menu.\r\n- Edit user screen appears.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/d5e9312b6e3d415d87893ccf913ba401.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n:::info\r\n**By enabling the group subdomain billing option, the parent domain can bill the root domain for subdomain billing usages**.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n- When the **group subdomain billing option** is enabled, the **parent domain can pay for the usage of the entire subdomain**.\r\n- Finally, Click on **update** button to update the changes.\r\n\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/bb3eb6d19b204d5b9175e10696886a2c.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n:::info\r\n**By disabling the group subdomain billing option, the subdomain can pay the billing directly to the root domain**.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n\r\n## Admin Notification alerts.\r\n\r\n- Using the credentials, **log in to the admin panel**\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/f01a0fe6fc8d472790393fd9ebf36bcd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- An option called **Configuration** can be found at the left side of the panel. Click on it to view the drop-down menu.\r\n\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/0508122c31b94e0db09394b64664f1b3.png\" width=\"50%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- From the dropdown click on **Notification** option.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/b77c0a2fc5d2420db67668369c38bbc8.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Notification screen appears.\r\n- Here is the steps to configure admin notification for instance creation / deletion.\r\n- Click on the **admin notification for instance creation / deletion** option.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/99f20cde5d6a46cd8c4ae048203ec0ca.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n \r\n\r\n- Admin notification for instance creation / deletion option appears on the screen.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/ece5ae57e8564890944113e30d469777.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Language** - Select the language as per the requirement.\r\n- **Upload Template** - Upload the email template using this option\r\n- **Subject for instance creation** - Specify the subject content for instance creation mail.\r\n- **Subject for instance deletion** - Specify the subject content for instance deletion mail.\r\n- **To** - Specify the **TO** address and can add **CC** address in the CC field.\r\n- **Turn ON/OFF** - By enabling **ON** button the notification will send to the concern person.By enabling **Off** button the notification will not send to the concern person.\r\n- Finally, Click **Update** button.\r\n- Now the configuration made successfull.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Steps to configure admin notification for new user signup.\r\n\r\n- Click on the **admin notification for for new user signup** option.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/e54f51161571465bb8cff28bcc372664.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- Admin notification for new user signup screen appears.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/be78b86c5948486ea469c817520f81b5.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- **Language** - Select the language as per the requirement.\r\n- **Upload Template** - Upload the email template using this option\r\n- **Subject** - Specify the subject content for new account signup mail.\r\n- **To** - Specify the **TO** address and can add **CC** address in the CC field.\r\n- **Turn ON/OFF** - By enabling **ON** button the notification will send to the concern person.By enabling **Off** button the notification will not send to the concern person.\r\n- Finally, Click **Update** button.\r\n- Now the configuration made successfull.\r\n\r\n## Auto Configuration of Firewall rules.\r\n\r\n- Login into user panel using your credentials.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/b7ed168456604a8ba087920ecec9c81d.png\" width=\"90%\" />\r\n\r\n- At left side of the panel user can able to see a option called **Network**. Click on it to view the dropdown.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/98ea5d4151ad4786bc12b86d5cd23829.png\" width=\"40%\" />\r\n\r\n- From the dropdown select **Security groups**.\r\n- **Security group** screen appears.At right side of the panel user can able to see a option **ADD** button click on it.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/478f03a68520484ea072b6116ed964a1.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- **Add security group** screen appears.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/699e1c17f5834cf7850a12db2f5a51e8.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- **Name** - Specify a name for the security that has been creating.\r\n- **Description** - Specify a short notes on description field.\r\n- Select the status, Finally click on **Add** button.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/ac43f459373142cb9f65700ab66b6a26.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- Now the **security group** has been created sucessfully.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/ac1d7524378d4c069b3c6dab262b3acc.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- From the **Action menu** on the right side of the panel, users can manage security groups by clicking on the **manage** icon.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/6e4396ffd1bc4a95ac2b29780591bda1.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- Add a firewall rule by clicking on the **Add Rule** part\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/897362708f69488eb7b0e97a40a820de.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- Fill the required fields and click **Add Rule** button.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/536605f558ca4721a0003e94cdaf466c.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- Firewall rule has been created successfully.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/ec452f71d628442aa561a7b657f8f016.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- Go to the instance creation page to check the Auto Configuration of Firewall rules.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- Now the the Auto Configuration of Firewall rules has been created successfully when launching a VM in Stackbill .\r\n\r\n\r\n## ACS Native Autoscaling / Stackbill Autoscaling\r\n\r\nIn Stackbill , users have the flexibility to choose between two types of autoscaling based on their preferences one is ACS native autoscaling and Stackbill Autoscaling. They can easily enable their preferred option by following the guide below.\r\n\r\n- Login into admin panel using credentials.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/7a4e39a0383a48da8105fea1750db5c5.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- At left side of the panel user can able to see a option called **configuration**. Click on it to view the dropdown.\r\n- From the dropdown select **General** option and click on **Feature Configuration** option.\r\n- Feature configuration screen appears.At right side of the panel user can able to see a option for search option.\r\n- On the search option type **Autoscaling** and click search button.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/getting-started/96eb2bbd07e143aba9ca228d07079ecf.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n- Autoscaling configuration appears on the screen.\r\n- Click on the edit option available on the action menu to edit the autoscaling configuration.\r\n- If the user enter the value as **Native** ACS Native autoscaling enables to the user portal.\r\n- If the user enter the value as **Stackbill** Stackbill autoscaling enables to the user panel.','\0','What\'s New','user-guide/getting-started/what-s-new',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',97,'15fbaa76-5988-4cdb-b8ff-55958eda9aea',NULL,6,NULL,175,0,'cms_da9aea'),
(98,29,14,2,'2023-09-27 13:41:08','<h1>Lanzamiento de Aplicaciones</h1>\n<h2>Lanzamiento de Aplicaciones en Stackbill </h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Opción de <strong>Marketplace</strong> que se encuentra en el lado izquierdo del panel, <strong>haz clic en ella para ver el marketplace</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/2026bd6d466c48e5aecc85b3a304e0a6.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Haz clic en el botón <strong>Lanzar</strong> según la aplicación de software requerida.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/0e31f47874b1425abe20046d634fead1.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Una vez que hayas hecho clic en el <strong>botón de Lanzar</strong>, serás redirigido a la página de creación de instancias junto con la preselección de la aplicación de software.</li>\n<li>Selecciona las configuraciones requeridas como plan de instancia, tamaño de CPU, procesadores y configura la red y los firewalls.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/64da2955c64a45659daf2eaa168cef4c.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Finalmente, haz clic en <strong>Crear Instancia</strong>.</li>\n<li>Ahora la instancia ha sido creada con éxito.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gestión de Nubes</a> con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Lanzamiento de Aplicaciones\r\n\r\n## Lanzamiento de Aplicaciones en Stackbill \r\n\r\n- Opción de **Marketplace** que se encuentra en el lado izquierdo del panel, **haz clic en ella para ver el marketplace**.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/2026bd6d466c48e5aecc85b3a304e0a6.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Haz clic en el botón **Lanzar** según la aplicación de software requerida.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/0e31f47874b1425abe20046d634fead1.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Una vez que hayas hecho clic en el **botón de Lanzar**, serás redirigido a la página de creación de instancias junto con la preselección de la aplicación de software.\r\n- Selecciona las configuraciones requeridas como plan de instancia, tamaño de CPU, procesadores y configura la red y los firewalls.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/64da2955c64a45659daf2eaa168cef4c.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Finalmente, haz clic en **Crear Instancia**.\r\n- Ahora la instancia ha sido creada con éxito.\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo [Portal de Gestión de Nubes](https://localhost:8080/) con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.**','\0','Lanzar aplicaciones','guía-del-usuario/mercado/lanzar-aplicaciones',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',90,'c6759156-6b61-4dd6-a07d-d16a3ec9acb0',NULL,2,NULL,175,0,'cms_c9acb0'),
(99,37,37,2,'2023-09-27 13:41:37','<h1>User Profile</h1>\n<h2>Setting up Profile in Stackbill </h2>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/75cd60f186a84c45b1c161f78b61c8b7.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Company</strong> option can be found on the left side of the portal.</li>\n<li>The screen displays a pop-up menu. From the pop uu click on <strong>Profile</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/e140457c763e4bb1a6ff8a3401e79d1a.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>My Profile</strong> option appears on the screen.</li>\n<li>The user can view or edit their personal information here.</li>\n<li>Users can <strong>upload their company logo or profile here.</strong></li>\n<li>Finally,Click on the <strong>Save Changes</strong> button below the portal once the changes have been made.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Changing login password in Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>On the left side of the pop-up menu, users can change their password by clicking on the <strong>Change Password</strong> option.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/25e2d3fcb905474096793316d440e1db.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Old Password</strong> - Enter your Old password.</li>\n<li><strong>New password</strong>- Enter <strong>The new password</strong> in the <strong>new password field.</strong></li>\n<li>Re-Type the <strong>new password in the Confirm password field</strong>.</li>\n<li>Finally, Click the <strong>Update</strong> button.</li>\n<li>Now the New password has been updated successfully.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Payment Configuration on Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>On the left side of the pop-up menu, Click on the <strong>Payment Configuration</strong> button to configure payment gateways.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/b356ccede6fa4f1aa32032aab835b26f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Here user can Choose their <strong>payment gateways</strong> for the <strong>payment process.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::info</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Stackbill is a plug-and-play solution that <strong>supports all kinds of payment gateways.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>All kind of payment gateways can be intregrated with Stackbill by <strong>API</strong> concept.\n:::</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>By Default Stackbill has two payment gateways they are <strong>Paypal, and Razorpay.</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Credits and promocodes in Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>On the left side of the pop-up menu, Click on the <strong>Credits and promocodes</strong> button to view the credits and promocode offers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Here the user can see the <strong>total credit</strong> which was assigned by the <strong>admin.</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/e94dbdf1e6bd482587150be955cd1b89.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>In this section, the user can view their <strong>total credit limit</strong>, <strong>how much has been consumed, and the balance available credit limit for the next month.</strong></li>\n<li>Below, Admins can assign users offers and promo codes here so that users can see if they have any.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Request API Access in Stackbill </h3>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/442c90dc9d014bf7804f1cd502aafae4.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>To view the API Documentation, Click On the <strong>Request API Access</strong>.</li>\n<li>So that the request will sent to the admin through the email.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Notification Settings in Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>On the left side of the pop-up menu, Click on the <strong>Notification settings</strong> button to set notifications.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/235bd7f886d547ab8d60a16fdacee64f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>The user can enable the <strong>Send Email Maintenance and Outage Notifications button</strong> to receive notifications regarding <strong>maintenance and outages.</strong></li>\n<li>Enable the <strong>Invoice remainder</strong> option, the user will <strong>receive a notification for the invoice.</strong></li>\n<li>Enabling the <strong>Payment overdue</strong> option will allow the user to <strong>receive a notification for the overdue</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Account Delete Request in Stackbill .</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>On the left side of the pop-up menu, Click on the <strong>Delete Account</strong> button to <strong>Delete Account in Stackbill .</strong></li>\n<li>We recommend that you to follow these steps before deleting your account.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/3a8fa7874312456e88fbd1213e94f9e1.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Account delete screen appears on the screen.</li>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Request for account delete</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>** img 888 **</p>\n<ul>\n<li>So here user can able to see the resources which has been attached to the particular account.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Add User in Stackbill  <span id=\"add-user-in-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Company</strong> option can be found on the left side of the portal.</li>\n<li>The screen displays a pop-up menu. From the pop up click on <strong>user</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/c6820df9657f45949aeca9feb4dd09fd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Add users</strong> page appears on the screen.</li>\n<li>To add a user, click the <strong>Add user.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/5461b54a3f614bb8a4e05f0ddeb5e2ac.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fill all the required information on the menu.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/2a78ee4ac86f4a529be36b6b72e78e99.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Finally, click <strong>Add button.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/31ce8460aefd44b4bd1ec01a47cb2e66.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<p>:::success</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Now the new user has been created successfully.</strong>\n:::</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Setting up Role Privileges in Stackbill  <span id=\"setting-up-role-privileges-in-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<p><strong>Stackbill Role-based access control (RBAC)</strong> restricts network access based on a person\'s role within an organization and has become one of the main methods for advanced access control. The roles in RBAC refer to the levels of access that employees have to the network.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Typically there is a <strong>default role which is named domain admin.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Company</strong> option can be found on the left side of the portal.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The screen displays a pop-up menu. From the pop up click on <strong>Role Privileges</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/02d49e0174394035972bd91e2aac4361.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RBAC</strong> screen appears.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/f3a5dde83fd646c7bba1d835952f4c56.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>At left side of the panel the user has a option to create new role.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/696580c7f276451e85a6a6bb3afc23c6.png\" width=\"50%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Click on <strong>Create New Role</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/8117648d181c4abfb836d4bee7b6f6f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Assign access rights to users so that they can access resources.</li>\n<li>Once every process done, click on the <strong>Update</strong> button.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/2e123525cea2416692f52aae8355a21c.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<p>:::success</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Now the Role Privelage has set successfully.</strong>\n:::</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Quota Manager in Stackbill  <span id=\"quota-manager-in-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The <strong>Company</strong> option can be found on the left side of the portal.</li>\n<li>The screen displays a pop-up menu. To view the Quota, click on the <strong>Quota Limit</strong> option from the menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/e99091a55dbf4ea2a376821e5e6c29a4.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Now Quota Limit page appears on the screen.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/be98deaa399e40718c9243ce6c6555e2.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>The user can see a detailed view of the resources that have been allocated by the administrator.</li>\n<li>Users can request an upgrade from their Admin if they need to upgrade any resources.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>My Activity in Stackbill  <span id=\"my-activity-in-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The <strong>Company</strong> option can be found on the left side of the portal.</li>\n<li>The screen displays a pop-up menu. To view the recent activities, click on the <strong>My Activity</strong> option from the menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/e1efbee9432c4d00845aaaea64881778.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Here user can be able to see their recent activities.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/59d157a102b74e51bd30017ccacdbe0e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Here the user can be able to see the Alerts.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/d1e7ceab44f744be8cd03d8862f58b8a.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<hr />\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# User Profile\n\n\n## Setting up Profile in Stackbill \n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/75cd60f186a84c45b1c161f78b61c8b7.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- **Company** option can be found on the left side of the portal.\n- The screen displays a pop-up menu. From the pop uu click on **Profile**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/e140457c763e4bb1a6ff8a3401e79d1a.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- **My Profile** option appears on the screen.\n- The user can view or edit their personal information here.\n- Users can **upload their company logo or profile here.**\n- Finally,Click on the **Save Changes** button below the portal once the changes have been made.\n\n\n### Changing login password in Stackbill \n\n- On the left side of the pop-up menu, users can change their password by clicking on the **Change Password** option.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/25e2d3fcb905474096793316d440e1db.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- **Old Password** - Enter your Old password.\n- **New password**- Enter **The new password** in the **new password field.**\n- Re-Type the **new password in the Confirm password field**.\n- Finally, Click the **Update** button.\n- Now the New password has been updated successfully.\n\n### Payment Configuration on Stackbill \n\n- On the left side of the pop-up menu, Click on the **Payment Configuration** button to configure payment gateways.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/b356ccede6fa4f1aa32032aab835b26f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Here user can Choose their **payment gateways** for the **payment process.**\n\n:::info\n- Stackbill is a plug-and-play solution that **supports all kinds of payment gateways.**\n- All kind of payment gateways can be intregrated with Stackbill by **API** concept.\n:::\n\n- By Default Stackbill has two payment gateways they are **Paypal, and Razorpay.**\n\n### Credits and promocodes in Stackbill \n\n- On the left side of the pop-up menu, Click on the **Credits and promocodes** button to view the credits and promocode offers.\n\n- Here the user can see the **total credit** which was assigned by the **admin.**\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/e94dbdf1e6bd482587150be955cd1b89.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- In this section, the user can view their **total credit limit**, **how much has been consumed, and the balance available credit limit for the next month.**\n- Below, Admins can assign users offers and promo codes here so that users can see if they have any.\n\n### Request API Access in Stackbill \n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/442c90dc9d014bf7804f1cd502aafae4.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- To view the API Documentation, Click On the **Request API Access**.\n- So that the request will sent to the admin through the email.\n\n### Notification Settings in Stackbill \n\n- On the left side of the pop-up menu, Click on the **Notification settings** button to set notifications.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/235bd7f886d547ab8d60a16fdacee64f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- The user can enable the **Send Email Maintenance and Outage Notifications button** to receive notifications regarding **maintenance and outages.**\n- Enable the **Invoice remainder** option, the user will **receive a notification for the invoice.**\n- Enabling the **Payment overdue** option will allow the user to **receive a notification for the overdue**\n\n### Account Delete Request in Stackbill .\n\n- On the left side of the pop-up menu, Click on the **Delete Account** button to **Delete Account in Stackbill .**\n- We recommend that you to follow these steps before deleting your account.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/3a8fa7874312456e88fbd1213e94f9e1.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Account delete screen appears on the screen.\n- Click on the **Request for account delete**.\n\n\n** img 888 ** \n\n- So here user can able to see the resources which has been attached to the particular account.\n\n\n## Add User in Stackbill  <span id=\"add-user-in-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n- **Company** option can be found on the left side of the portal.\n- The screen displays a pop-up menu. From the pop up click on **user**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/c6820df9657f45949aeca9feb4dd09fd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- **Add users** page appears on the screen.\n- To add a user, click the **Add user.**\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/5461b54a3f614bb8a4e05f0ddeb5e2ac.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- **Fill all the required information on the menu.**\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/2a78ee4ac86f4a529be36b6b72e78e99.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Finally, click **Add button.**\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/31ce8460aefd44b4bd1ec01a47cb2e66.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n:::success\n- **Now the new user has been created successfully.**\n:::\n\n## Setting up Role Privileges in Stackbill  <span id=\"setting-up-role-privileges-in-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n**Stackbill Role-based access control (RBAC)** restricts network access based on a person\'s role within an organization and has become one of the main methods for advanced access control. The roles in RBAC refer to the levels of access that employees have to the network.\n\n- Typically there is a **default role which is named domain admin.**\n\n- **Company** option can be found on the left side of the portal.\n- The screen displays a pop-up menu. From the pop up click on **Role Privileges**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/02d49e0174394035972bd91e2aac4361.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- **RBAC** screen appears.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/f3a5dde83fd646c7bba1d835952f4c56.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- At left side of the panel the user has a option to create new role.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/696580c7f276451e85a6a6bb3afc23c6.png\" width=\"50%\" />\n\n- Click on **Create New Role**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/8117648d181c4abfb836d4bee7b6f6f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Assign access rights to users so that they can access resources.\n- Once every process done, click on the **Update** button.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/2e123525cea2416692f52aae8355a21c.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n:::success\n- **Now the Role Privelage has set successfully.**\n:::\n\n## Quota Manager in Stackbill  <span id=\"quota-manager-in-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n-  The **Company** option can be found on the left side of the portal.\n-   The screen displays a pop-up menu. To view the Quota, click on the **Quota Limit** option from the menu.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/e99091a55dbf4ea2a376821e5e6c29a4.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n-   Now Quota Limit page appears on the screen.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/be98deaa399e40718c9243ce6c6555e2.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n-   The user can see a detailed view of the resources that have been allocated by the administrator.\n-   Users can request an upgrade from their Admin if they need to upgrade any resources.\n\n## My Activity in Stackbill  <span id=\"my-activity-in-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n-  The **Company** option can be found on the left side of the portal.\n-   The screen displays a pop-up menu. To view the recent activities, click on the **My Activity** option from the menu.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/e1efbee9432c4d00845aaaea64881778.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n\n-   Here user can be able to see their recent activities.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/59d157a102b74e51bd30017ccacdbe0e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n-   Here the user can be able to see the Alerts.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/d1e7ceab44f744be8cd03d8862f58b8a.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n-----------------------------------------------------\n\n\n**About Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**','\0','User Profile','user-guide/organization/user-profile',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',99,'11e5a741-4750-4d89-bb8d-6a7b6101e422',NULL,2,NULL,175,0,'cms_01e422'),
(100,38,37,2,'2023-09-27 13:43:02','<h1>Perfil de usuário</h1>\n<h2>Configurando perfil no Stackbill </h2>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/75cd60f186a84c45b1c161f78b61c8b7.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>A opção <strong>Empresa</strong> pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.</li>\n<li>A tela exibe um menu pop-up. No pop-up, clique em <strong>Perfil</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/e140457c763e4bb1a6ff8a3401e79d1a.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>A opção <strong>Meu perfil</strong> aparece na tela.</li>\n<li>O usuário pode visualizar ou editar suas informações pessoais aqui.</li>\n<li>Os usuários podem <strong>fazer upload do logotipo ou perfil da empresa aqui.</strong></li>\n<li>Por fim, clique no botão <strong>Salvar alterações</strong> abaixo do portal assim que as alterações forem feitas.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Alterando a senha de login no Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No lado esquerdo do menu pop-up, o usuário pode alterar sua senha clicando na opção <strong>Alterar senha</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/25e2d3fcb905474096793316d440e1db.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Senha antiga</strong> - Digite sua senha antiga.</li>\n<li><strong>Nova senha</strong>- Digite <strong>A nova senha</strong> no campo <strong>nova senha.</strong></li>\n<li>Digite novamente a <strong>nova senha no campo Confirmar senha</strong>.</li>\n<li>Por fim, clique no botão <strong>Atualizar</strong>.</li>\n<li>Agora a nova senha foi atualizada com sucesso.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Configuração de pagamento no Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No lado esquerdo do menu pop-up, clique no botão <strong>Configuração de pagamento</strong> para configurar os gateways de pagamento.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/b356ccede6fa4f1aa32032aab835b26f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aqui o usuário pode escolher seus <strong>gates de pagamento</strong> para o <strong>processo de pagamento.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::informações</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Stackbill é uma solução plug-and-play que <strong>suporta todos os tipos de gateways de pagamento.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Todos os tipos de gateways de pagamento podem ser integrados ao Stackbill pelo conceito <strong>API</strong>.\n:::</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Por padrão, Stackbill tem dois gateways de pagamento: <strong>Paypal e Razorpay.</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Créditos e códigos promocionais no Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>No lado esquerdo do menu pop-up, clique no botão <strong>Créditos e códigos promocionais</strong> para visualizar os créditos e ofertas de códigos promocionais.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Aqui o usuário pode ver o <strong>crédito total</strong> que foi atribuído pelo <strong>admin.</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/e94dbdf1e6bd482587150be955cd1b89.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Nesta seção o usuário pode visualizar seu <strong>limite de crédito total</strong>, <strong>quanto foi consumido e o limite de crédito do saldo disponível para o próximo mês.</strong></li>\n<li>Abaixo, os administradores podem atribuir ofertas e códigos promocionais aos usuários aqui para que os usuários possam ver se possuem algum.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Solicitar acesso à API no Stackbill </h3>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/442c90dc9d014bf7804f1cd502aafae4.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Para visualizar a documentação da API, clique em <strong>Solicitar acesso à API</strong>.</li>\n<li>Para que a solicitação seja enviada ao administrador através do email.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Configurações de notificação no Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No lado esquerdo do menu pop-up, clique no botão <strong>Configurações de notificação</strong> para definir notificações.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/235bd7f886d547ab8d60a16fdacee64f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>O usuário pode ativar o botão <strong>Enviar notificações de manutenção e interrupções por e-mail</strong> para receber notificações sobre <strong>manutenção e interrupções.</strong></li>\n<li>Habilite a opção <strong>Resto da fatura</strong>, o usuário <strong>receberá uma notificação da fatura.</strong></li>\n<li>Ativar a opção <strong>Pagamento em atraso</strong> permitirá que o usuário <strong>receba uma notificação sobre o atraso</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Solicitação de exclusão de conta no Stackbill .</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No lado esquerdo do menu pop-up, clique no botão <strong>Excluir conta</strong> para <strong>Excluir conta no Stackbill .</strong></li>\n<li>Recomendamos que você siga estas etapas antes de excluir sua conta.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/3a8fa7874312456e88fbd1213e94f9e1.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>A tela de exclusão de conta aparece na tela.</li>\n<li>Clique em <strong>Solicitação de exclusão de conta</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>img 888</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Então aqui o usuário pode ver os recursos que foram anexados à conta específica.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Adicionar usuário no Stackbill  <span id=\"adicionar-usuário-no-Cloud-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A opção <strong>Empresa</strong> pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.</li>\n<li>A tela exibe um menu pop-up. No pop-up, clique em <strong>usuário</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/c6820df9657f45949aeca9feb4dd09fd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>A página <strong>Adicionar usuários</strong> aparece na tela.</li>\n<li>Para adicionar um usuário, clique em <strong>Adicionar usuário.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/5461b54a3f614bb8a4e05f0ddeb5e2ac.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Preencha todas as informações solicitadas no menu.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/2a78ee4ac86f4a529be36b6b72e78e99.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Por fim, clique no botão <strong>Adicionar.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/31ce8460aefd44b4bd1ec01a47cb2e66.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n:::sucesso\n- **Agora o novo usuário foi criado com sucesso.**\n:::\n<h2>Configurando privilégios de função no Stackbill  <span id=\"configurando-privilégios-de-função-no-Cloud-\"></span></h2>\n<p><strong>Stackbill Role-based access control (RBAC)</strong> restringe o acesso à rede com base na função de uma pessoa dentro de uma organização e se tornou um dos principais métodos para controle de acesso avançado. As funções no RBAC referem-se aos níveis de acesso que os funcionários têm à rede.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Normalmente há uma <strong>função padrão chamada administrador de domínio.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A opção <strong>Empresa</strong> pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A tela exibe um menu pop-up. No pop-up, clique em <strong>Privilégios de função</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/02d49e0174394035972bd91e2aac4361.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>A tela <strong>RBAC</strong> é exibida.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/f3a5dde83fd646c7bba1d835952f4c56.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>No lado esquerdo do painel o usuário tem a opção de criar uma nova função.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/696580c7f276451e85a6a6bb3afc23c6.png\" width=\"50%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Clique em <strong>Criar nova função</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/8117648d181c4abfb836d4bee7b6f6f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Atribuir direitos de acesso aos usuários para que possam acessar os recursos.</li>\n<li>Depois de concluído todo processo, clique no botão <strong>Atualizar</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/2e123525cea2416692f52aae8355a21c.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<p>:::sucesso</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Agora o privilégio da função foi definido com sucesso.</strong>\n:::</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Gerenciador de cotas no Stackbill  <span id=\"gerenciador-de-cotas-na-nuvem-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A opção <strong>Empresa</strong> pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.</li>\n<li>A tela exibe um menu pop-up. Para visualizar a Cota, clique na opção <strong>Limite de Cota</strong> do menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/e99091a55dbf4ea2a376821e5e6c29a4.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Agora a página Limite de cota aparece na tela.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/be98deaa399e40718c9243ce6c6555e2.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>O usuário pode ter uma visão detalhada dos recursos que foram alocados pelo administrador.</li>\n<li>Os usuários podem solicitar uma atualização ao administrador se precisarem atualizar algum recurso.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Minha atividade no Stackbill  <span id=\"minha-atividade-na-nuvem-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A opção <strong>Empresa</strong> pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.</li>\n<li>A tela exibe um menu pop-up. Para visualizar as atividades recentes, clique na opção <strong>Minha atividade</strong> no menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/e1efbee9432c4d00845aaaea64881778.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aqui o usuário pode ver suas atividades recentes.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/59d157a102b74e51bd30017ccacdbe0e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aqui o usuário poderá ver os Alertas.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/d1e7ceab44f744be8cd03d8862f58b8a.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de gerenciamento de nuvem</a> completo e intuitivo de autoatendimento com amplos recursos que aproveitam Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência de última geração.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Perfil de usuário\n\n\n## Configurando perfil no Stackbill \n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/75cd60f186a84c45b1c161f78b61c8b7.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- A opção **Empresa** pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.\n- A tela exibe um menu pop-up. No pop-up, clique em **Perfil**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/e140457c763e4bb1a6ff8a3401e79d1a.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- A opção **Meu perfil** aparece na tela.\n- O usuário pode visualizar ou editar suas informações pessoais aqui.\n- Os usuários podem **fazer upload do logotipo ou perfil da empresa aqui.**\n- Por fim, clique no botão **Salvar alterações** abaixo do portal assim que as alterações forem feitas.\n\n\n### Alterando a senha de login no Stackbill \n\n- No lado esquerdo do menu pop-up, o usuário pode alterar sua senha clicando na opção **Alterar senha**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/25e2d3fcb905474096793316d440e1db.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- **Senha antiga** - Digite sua senha antiga.\n- **Nova senha**- Digite **A nova senha** no campo **nova senha.**\n- Digite novamente a **nova senha no campo Confirmar senha**.\n- Por fim, clique no botão **Atualizar**.\n- Agora a nova senha foi atualizada com sucesso.\n\n### Configuração de pagamento no Stackbill \n\n- No lado esquerdo do menu pop-up, clique no botão **Configuração de pagamento** para configurar os gateways de pagamento.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/b356ccede6fa4f1aa32032aab835b26f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Aqui o usuário pode escolher seus **gates de pagamento** para o **processo de pagamento.**\n\n:::informações\n- Stackbill é uma solução plug-and-play que **suporta todos os tipos de gateways de pagamento.**\n- Todos os tipos de gateways de pagamento podem ser integrados ao Stackbill pelo conceito **API**.\n:::\n\n- Por padrão, Stackbill tem dois gateways de pagamento: **Paypal e Razorpay.**\n\n### Créditos e códigos promocionais no Stackbill \n\n- No lado esquerdo do menu pop-up, clique no botão **Créditos e códigos promocionais** para visualizar os créditos e ofertas de códigos promocionais.\n\n- Aqui o usuário pode ver o **crédito total** que foi atribuído pelo **admin.**\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/e94dbdf1e6bd482587150be955cd1b89.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Nesta seção o usuário pode visualizar seu **limite de crédito total**, **quanto foi consumido e o limite de crédito do saldo disponível para o próximo mês.**\n- Abaixo, os administradores podem atribuir ofertas e códigos promocionais aos usuários aqui para que os usuários possam ver se possuem algum.\n\n### Solicitar acesso à API no Stackbill \n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/442c90dc9d014bf7804f1cd502aafae4.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Para visualizar a documentação da API, clique em **Solicitar acesso à API**.\n- Para que a solicitação seja enviada ao administrador através do email.\n\n### Configurações de notificação no Stackbill \n\n- No lado esquerdo do menu pop-up, clique no botão **Configurações de notificação** para definir notificações.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/235bd7f886d547ab8d60a16fdacee64f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- O usuário pode ativar o botão **Enviar notificações de manutenção e interrupções por e-mail** para receber notificações sobre **manutenção e interrupções.**\n- Habilite a opção **Resto da fatura**, o usuário **receberá uma notificação da fatura.**\n- Ativar a opção **Pagamento em atraso** permitirá que o usuário **receba uma notificação sobre o atraso**\n\n### Solicitação de exclusão de conta no Stackbill .\n\n- No lado esquerdo do menu pop-up, clique no botão **Excluir conta** para **Excluir conta no Stackbill .**\n- Recomendamos que você siga estas etapas antes de excluir sua conta.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/3a8fa7874312456e88fbd1213e94f9e1.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- A tela de exclusão de conta aparece na tela.\n- Clique em **Solicitação de exclusão de conta**.\n\n\n**img 888**\n\n- Então aqui o usuário pode ver os recursos que foram anexados à conta específica.\n\n\n## Adicionar usuário no Stackbill  <span id=\"adicionar-usuário-no-Cloud-\"></span>\n\n- A opção **Empresa** pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.\n- A tela exibe um menu pop-up. No pop-up, clique em **usuário**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/c6820df9657f45949aeca9feb4dd09fd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- A página **Adicionar usuários** aparece na tela.\n- Para adicionar um usuário, clique em **Adicionar usuário.**\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/5461b54a3f614bb8a4e05f0ddeb5e2ac.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- **Preencha todas as informações solicitadas no menu.**\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/2a78ee4ac86f4a529be36b6b72e78e99.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Por fim, clique no botão **Adicionar.**\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/31ce8460aefd44b4bd1ec01a47cb2e66.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n:::sucesso\n- **Agora o novo usuário foi criado com sucesso.**\n:::\n\n## Configurando privilégios de função no Stackbill  <span id=\"configurando-privilégios-de-função-no-Cloud-\"></span>\n\n**Stackbill Role-based access control (RBAC)** restringe o acesso à rede com base na função de uma pessoa dentro de uma organização e se tornou um dos principais métodos para controle de acesso avançado. As funções no RBAC referem-se aos níveis de acesso que os funcionários têm à rede.\n\n- Normalmente há uma **função padrão chamada administrador de domínio.**\n\n- A opção **Empresa** pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.\n- A tela exibe um menu pop-up. No pop-up, clique em **Privilégios de função**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/02d49e0174394035972bd91e2aac4361.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- A tela **RBAC** é exibida.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/f3a5dde83fd646c7bba1d835952f4c56.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- No lado esquerdo do painel o usuário tem a opção de criar uma nova função.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/696580c7f276451e85a6a6bb3afc23c6.png\" width=\"50%\" />\n\n- Clique em **Criar nova função**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/8117648d181c4abfb836d4bee7b6f6f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Atribuir direitos de acesso aos usuários para que possam acessar os recursos.\n- Depois de concluído todo processo, clique no botão **Atualizar**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/2e123525cea2416692f52aae8355a21c.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n\n:::sucesso\n- **Agora o privilégio da função foi definido com sucesso.**\n:::\n\n## Gerenciador de cotas no Stackbill  <span id=\"gerenciador-de-cotas-na-nuvem-\"></span>\n\n- A opção **Empresa** pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.\n- A tela exibe um menu pop-up. Para visualizar a Cota, clique na opção **Limite de Cota** do menu.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/e99091a55dbf4ea2a376821e5e6c29a4.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Agora a página Limite de cota aparece na tela.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/be98deaa399e40718c9243ce6c6555e2.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- O usuário pode ter uma visão detalhada dos recursos que foram alocados pelo administrador.\n- Os usuários podem solicitar uma atualização ao administrador se precisarem atualizar algum recurso.\n\n## Minha atividade no Stackbill  <span id=\"minha-atividade-na-nuvem-\"></span>\n\n- A opção **Empresa** pode ser encontrada no lado esquerdo do portal.\n- A tela exibe um menu pop-up. Para visualizar as atividades recentes, clique na opção **Minha atividade** no menu.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/e1efbee9432c4d00845aaaea64881778.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n\n- Aqui o usuário pode ver suas atividades recentes.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/59d157a102b74e51bd30017ccacdbe0e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Aqui o usuário poderá ver os Alertas.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/d1e7ceab44f744be8cd03d8862f58b8a.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Sobre Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] é um [Portal de gerenciamento de nuvem](https://localhost:8080/) completo e intuitivo de autoatendimento com amplos recursos que aproveitam Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência de última geração.**','\0','Perfil de usuário','guia-de-usuario/organização/perfil-de-usu-rio',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',99,'654bfb49-b5fd-4843-bede-c809a6c25556',NULL,2,NULL,175,0,'cms_c25556'),
(101,39,37,2,'2023-09-27 13:44:15','<h1>Perfil del usuario</h1>\n<h2>Configurar perfil en Stackbill </h2>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/75cd60f186a84c45b1c161f78b61c8b7.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>La opción <strong>Empresa</strong> se puede encontrar en el lado izquierdo del portal.</li>\n<li>La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. Desde la ventana emergente, haga clic en <strong>Perfil</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/e140457c763e4bb1a6ff8a3401e79d1a.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>La opción <strong>Mi perfil</strong> aparece en la pantalla.</li>\n<li>El usuario puede ver o editar su información personal aquí.</li>\n<li>Los usuarios pueden <strong>cargar el logotipo o perfil de su empresa aquí.</strong></li>\n<li>Finalmente, haga clic en el botón <strong>Guardar cambios</strong> debajo del portal una vez que se hayan realizado los cambios.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Cambiar la contraseña de inicio de sesión en Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>En el lado izquierdo del menú emergente, los usuarios pueden cambiar su contraseña haciendo clic en la opción <strong>Cambiar contraseña</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/25e2d3fcb905474096793316d440e1db.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Contraseña anterior</strong> - Ingrese su contraseña anterior.</li>\n<li><strong>Nueva contraseña</strong>- Ingrese <strong>La nueva contraseña</strong> en el campo <strong>nueva contraseña.</strong></li>\n<li>Vuelva a escribir la <strong>nueva contraseña en el campo Confirmar contraseña</strong>.</li>\n<li>Finalmente, haga clic en el botón <strong>Actualizar</strong>.</li>\n<li>Ahora la nueva contraseña se ha actualizado correctamente.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Configuración de pago en Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>En el lado izquierdo del menú emergente, haga clic en el botón <strong>Configuración de pago</strong> para configurar las pasarelas de pago.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/b356ccede6fa4f1aa32032aab835b26f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aquí el usuario puede elegir sus <strong>pasarelas de pago</strong> para el <strong>proceso de pago.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::información</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Stackbill es una solución plug-and-play que <strong>admite todo tipo de pasarelas de pago</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Se pueden integrar todo tipo de pasarelas de pago con Stackbill mediante el concepto <strong>API</strong>.\n:::</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>De forma predeterminada, Stackbill tiene dos pasarelas de pago: <strong>Paypal y Razorpay.</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Créditos y códigos promocionales en Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>En el lado izquierdo del menú emergente, haga clic en el botón <strong>Créditos y códigos promocionales</strong> para ver las ofertas de créditos y códigos promocionales.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Aquí el usuario puede ver el <strong>crédito total</strong> que fue asignado por el <strong>admin.</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/e94dbdf1e6bd482587150be955cd1b89.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>En esta sección, el usuario puede ver su <strong>límite de crédito total</strong>, <strong>cuánto ha consumido y el saldo límite de crédito disponible para el próximo mes.</strong></li>\n<li>A continuación, los administradores pueden asignar ofertas y códigos promocionales a los usuarios aquí para que los usuarios puedan ver si tienen alguno.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Solicitar acceso a API en Stackbill </h3>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/442c90dc9d014bf7804f1cd502aafae4.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Para ver la documentación de la API, haga clic en <strong>Solicitar acceso a la API</strong>.</li>\n<li>Para que la solicitud se envíe al administrador a través del correo electrónico.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Configuración de notificaciones en Stackbill </h3>\n<ul>\n<li>En el lado izquierdo del menú emergente, haga clic en el botón <strong>Configuración de notificaciones</strong> para configurar las notificaciones.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/235bd7f886d547ab8d60a16fdacee64f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>El usuario puede habilitar el botón <strong>Enviar notificaciones de mantenimiento e interrupciones por correo electrónico</strong> para recibir notificaciones sobre <strong>mantenimiento e interrupciones.</strong></li>\n<li>Habilite la opción <strong>Restante de factura</strong>, el usuario <strong>recibirá una notificación de la factura.</strong></li>\n<li>Habilitar la opción <strong>Pago vencido</strong> permitirá al usuario <strong>recibir una notificación por el pago vencido</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Solicitud de eliminación de cuenta en Stackbill .</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>En el lado izquierdo del menú emergente, haga clic en el botón <strong>Eliminar cuenta</strong> para <strong>Eliminar cuenta en Stackbill .</strong></li>\n<li>Le recomendamos que siga estos pasos antes de eliminar su cuenta.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/3a8fa7874312456e88fbd1213e94f9e1.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aparece la pantalla de eliminación de cuenta en la pantalla.</li>\n<li>Haga clic en <strong>Solicitud de eliminación de cuenta</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>** img 888 **</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aquí el usuario puede ver los recursos que se han adjuntado a la cuenta en particular.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Agregar usuario en Stackbill  <span id=\"agregar-usuario-en-LaNube-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>La opción <strong>Empresa</strong> se puede encontrar en el lado izquierdo del portal.</li>\n<li>La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. En la ventana emergente, haga clic en <strong>usuario</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/c6820df9657f45949aeca9feb4dd09fd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>La página <strong>Agregar usuarios</strong> aparece en la pantalla.</li>\n<li>Para agregar un usuario, haga clic en <strong>Agregar usuario.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/5461b54a3f614bb8a4e05f0ddeb5e2ac.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Complete toda la información requerida en el menú.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/2a78ee4ac86f4a529be36b6b72e78e99.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Finalmente, haga clic en <strong>Botón Agregar.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/31ce8460aefd44b4bd1ec01a47cb2e66.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<p>:::éxito</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ahora el nuevo usuario se ha creado correctamente.</strong>\n:::</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Configuración de privilegios de rol en Stackbill  <span id=\"configuración-de-privilegios-de-rol-en-LaNube-\"></span></h2>\n<p><strong>El control de acceso basado en roles (RBAC) de Stackbill</strong> restringe el acceso a la red según el rol de una persona dentro de una organización y se ha convertido en uno de los principales métodos para el control de acceso avanzado. Los roles en RBAC se refieren a los niveles de acceso que tienen los empleados a la red.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Normalmente hay una <strong>rol predeterminada que se llama administrador de dominio.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>La opción <strong>Empresa</strong> se puede encontrar en el lado izquierdo del portal.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. En la ventana emergente, haga clic en <strong>Privilegios de rol</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/02d49e0174394035972bd91e2aac4361.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aparece la pantalla <strong>RBAC</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/f3a5dde83fd646c7bba1d835952f4c56.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>En el lado izquierdo del panel, el usuario tiene la opción de crear un nuevo rol.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/696580c7f276451e85a6a6bb3afc23c6.png\" width=\"50%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Haga clic en <strong>Crear nuevo rol</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/8117648d181c4abfb836d4bee7b6f6f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Asignar derechos de acceso a los usuarios para que puedan acceder a los recursos.</li>\n<li>Una vez finalizado cada proceso, haga clic en el botón <strong>Actualizar</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/2e123525cea2416692f52aae8355a21c.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n<p>:::éxito</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ahora el privilegio de rol se ha establecido correctamente.</strong>\n:::</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Administrador de cuotas en Stackbill  <span id=\"administrador-de-cuotas-en-la-nube-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>La opción <strong>Empresa</strong> se encuentra en el lado izquierdo del portal.</li>\n<li>La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. Para ver la cuota, haga clic en la opción <strong>Límite de cuota</strong> del menú.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/e99091a55dbf4ea2a376821e5e6c29a4.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Ahora aparece la página Límite de cuota en la pantalla.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/be98deaa399e40718c9243ce6c6555e2.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>El usuario puede ver una vista detallada de los recursos que han sido asignados por el administrador.</li>\n<li>Los usuarios pueden solicitar una actualización a su administrador si necesitan actualizar algún recurso.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Mi actividad en Stackbill  <span id=\"mi-actividad-en-Stackbill-\"></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>La opción <strong>Empresa</strong> se encuentra en el lado izquierdo del portal.</li>\n<li>La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. Para ver las actividades recientes, haga clic en la opción <strong>Mi actividad</strong> del menú.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/e1efbee9432c4d00845aaaea64881778.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aquí el usuario puede ver sus actividades recientes.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/59d157a102b74e51bd30017ccacdbe0e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Aquí el usuario podrá ver las Alertas.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/d1e7ceab44f744be8cd03d8862f58b8a.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de gestión de la nube</a> intuitivo y de autoservicio completo con amplias funciones que aprovechan Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia de última generación.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Perfil del usuario\n\n\n## Configurar perfil en Stackbill \n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/75cd60f186a84c45b1c161f78b61c8b7.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- La opción **Empresa** se puede encontrar en el lado izquierdo del portal.\n- La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. Desde la ventana emergente, haga clic en **Perfil**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/e140457c763e4bb1a6ff8a3401e79d1a.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- La opción **Mi perfil** aparece en la pantalla.\n- El usuario puede ver o editar su información personal aquí.\n- Los usuarios pueden **cargar el logotipo o perfil de su empresa aquí.**\n- Finalmente, haga clic en el botón **Guardar cambios** debajo del portal una vez que se hayan realizado los cambios.\n\n\n### Cambiar la contraseña de inicio de sesión en Stackbill \n\n- En el lado izquierdo del menú emergente, los usuarios pueden cambiar su contraseña haciendo clic en la opción **Cambiar contraseña**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/25e2d3fcb905474096793316d440e1db.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- **Contraseña anterior** - Ingrese su contraseña anterior.\n- **Nueva contraseña**- Ingrese **La nueva contraseña** en el campo **nueva contraseña.**\n- Vuelva a escribir la **nueva contraseña en el campo Confirmar contraseña**.\n- Finalmente, haga clic en el botón **Actualizar**.\n- Ahora la nueva contraseña se ha actualizado correctamente.\n\n### Configuración de pago en Stackbill \n\n- En el lado izquierdo del menú emergente, haga clic en el botón **Configuración de pago** para configurar las pasarelas de pago.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/b356ccede6fa4f1aa32032aab835b26f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Aquí el usuario puede elegir sus **pasarelas de pago** para el **proceso de pago.**\n\n:::información\n- Stackbill es una solución plug-and-play que **admite todo tipo de pasarelas de pago**.\n- Se pueden integrar todo tipo de pasarelas de pago con Stackbill mediante el concepto **API**.\n:::\n\n- De forma predeterminada, Stackbill tiene dos pasarelas de pago: **Paypal y Razorpay.**\n\n### Créditos y códigos promocionales en Stackbill \n\n- En el lado izquierdo del menú emergente, haga clic en el botón **Créditos y códigos promocionales** para ver las ofertas de créditos y códigos promocionales.\n\n- Aquí el usuario puede ver el **crédito total** que fue asignado por el **admin.**\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/e94dbdf1e6bd482587150be955cd1b89.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- En esta sección, el usuario puede ver su **límite de crédito total**, **cuánto ha consumido y el saldo límite de crédito disponible para el próximo mes.**\n- A continuación, los administradores pueden asignar ofertas y códigos promocionales a los usuarios aquí para que los usuarios puedan ver si tienen alguno.\n\n### Solicitar acceso a API en Stackbill \n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/442c90dc9d014bf7804f1cd502aafae4.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Para ver la documentación de la API, haga clic en **Solicitar acceso a la API**.\n- Para que la solicitud se envíe al administrador a través del correo electrónico.\n\n### Configuración de notificaciones en Stackbill \n\n- En el lado izquierdo del menú emergente, haga clic en el botón **Configuración de notificaciones** para configurar las notificaciones.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/235bd7f886d547ab8d60a16fdacee64f.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- El usuario puede habilitar el botón **Enviar notificaciones de mantenimiento e interrupciones por correo electrónico** para recibir notificaciones sobre **mantenimiento e interrupciones.**\n- Habilite la opción **Restante de factura**, el usuario **recibirá una notificación de la factura.**\n- Habilitar la opción **Pago vencido** permitirá al usuario **recibir una notificación por el pago vencido**\n\n### Solicitud de eliminación de cuenta en Stackbill .\n\n- En el lado izquierdo del menú emergente, haga clic en el botón **Eliminar cuenta** para **Eliminar cuenta en Stackbill .**\n- Le recomendamos que siga estos pasos antes de eliminar su cuenta.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/3a8fa7874312456e88fbd1213e94f9e1.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Aparece la pantalla de eliminación de cuenta en la pantalla.\n- Haga clic en **Solicitud de eliminación de cuenta**.\n\n\n** img 888 **\n\n- Aquí el usuario puede ver los recursos que se han adjuntado a la cuenta en particular.\n\n\n## Agregar usuario en Stackbill  <span id=\"agregar-usuario-en-LaNube-\"></span>\n\n- La opción **Empresa** se puede encontrar en el lado izquierdo del portal.\n- La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. En la ventana emergente, haga clic en **usuario**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/c6820df9657f45949aeca9feb4dd09fd.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- La página **Agregar usuarios** aparece en la pantalla.\n- Para agregar un usuario, haga clic en **Agregar usuario.**\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/5461b54a3f614bb8a4e05f0ddeb5e2ac.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- **Complete toda la información requerida en el menú.**\n\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/2a78ee4ac86f4a529be36b6b72e78e99.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Finalmente, haga clic en **Botón Agregar.**\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/31ce8460aefd44b4bd1ec01a47cb2e66.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n:::éxito\n- **Ahora el nuevo usuario se ha creado correctamente.**\n:::\n\n## Configuración de privilegios de rol en Stackbill  <span id=\"configuración-de-privilegios-de-rol-en-LaNube-\"></span>\n\n**El control de acceso basado en roles (RBAC) de Stackbill** restringe el acceso a la red según el rol de una persona dentro de una organización y se ha convertido en uno de los principales métodos para el control de acceso avanzado. Los roles en RBAC se refieren a los niveles de acceso que tienen los empleados a la red.\n\n- Normalmente hay una **rol predeterminada que se llama administrador de dominio.**\n\n- La opción **Empresa** se puede encontrar en el lado izquierdo del portal.\n- La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. En la ventana emergente, haga clic en **Privilegios de rol**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/02d49e0174394035972bd91e2aac4361.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Aparece la pantalla **RBAC**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/f3a5dde83fd646c7bba1d835952f4c56.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- En el lado izquierdo del panel, el usuario tiene la opción de crear un nuevo rol.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/696580c7f276451e85a6a6bb3afc23c6.png\" width=\"50%\" />\n\n- Haga clic en **Crear nuevo rol**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/8117648d181c4abfb836d4bee7b6f6f0.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n- Asignar derechos de acceso a los usuarios para que puedan acceder a los recursos.\n- Una vez finalizado cada proceso, haga clic en el botón **Actualizar**.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/my-organization/2e123525cea2416692f52aae8355a21c.png\" width=\"90%\" />\n\n:::éxito\n- **Ahora el privilegio de rol se ha establecido correctamente.**\n:::\n\n## Administrador de cuotas en Stackbill  <span id=\"administrador-de-cuotas-en-la-nube-\"></span>\n\n- La opción **Empresa** se encuentra en el lado izquierdo del portal.\n- La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. Para ver la cuota, haga clic en la opción **Límite de cuota** del menú.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/e99091a55dbf4ea2a376821e5e6c29a4.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Ahora aparece la página Límite de cuota en la pantalla.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/be98deaa399e40718c9243ce6c6555e2.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n- El usuario puede ver una vista detallada de los recursos que han sido asignados por el administrador.\n- Los usuarios pueden solicitar una actualización a su administrador si necesitan actualizar algún recurso.\n\n## Mi actividad en Stackbill  <span id=\"mi-actividad-en-Stackbill-\"></span>\n\n- La opción **Empresa** se encuentra en el lado izquierdo del portal.\n- La pantalla muestra un menú emergente. Para ver las actividades recientes, haga clic en la opción **Mi actividad** del menú.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/e1efbee9432c4d00845aaaea64881778.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n\n- Aquí el usuario puede ver sus actividades recientes.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/59d157a102b74e51bd30017ccacdbe0e.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n- Aquí el usuario podrá ver las Alertas.\n\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/QuotaLimit/d1e7ceab44f744be8cd03d8862f58b8a.png\" width=\"80%\" />\n\n-------------------------------------------------- ---\n\n\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\n\n**[Stackbill] es un [Portal de gestión de la nube](https://localhost:8080/) intuitivo y de autoservicio completo con amplias funciones que aprovechan Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia de última generación.**','\0','Perfil del usuario','guía-del-usuario/organización/perfil-del-usuario',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',99,'f9f67068-4eec-4289-86ae-8c1a20792a9a',NULL,2,NULL,175,0,'cms_792a9a'),
(102,30,14,2,'2023-09-28 05:52:55','<h1>Lançamento de Aplicativos</h1>\n<h2>Lançando Aplicativos no Stackbill </h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Opção de <strong>Marketplace</strong> localizada no lado esquerdo do painel, <strong>clique nela para acessar o marketplace</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/2026bd6d466c48e5aecc85b3a304e0a6.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Clique no botão <strong>Lançar</strong> correspondente à aplicação de software desejada.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/0e31f47874b1425abe20046d634fead1.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Após clicar no <strong>botão de Lançar</strong>, você será redirecionado para a página de criação de instâncias, com a aplicação de software pré-selecionada.</li>\n<li>Selecione as configurações necessárias, como o plano de instância, tamanho da CPU, número de processadores, e configure a rede e os firewalls.</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/64da2955c64a45659daf2eaa168cef4c.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n<ul>\n<li>Por fim, clique em <strong>Criar Instância</strong>.</li>\n<li>Agora a instância foi criada com sucesso.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre o Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens</a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Lançamento de Aplicativos\r\n\r\n## Lançando Aplicativos no Stackbill \r\n\r\n- Opção de **Marketplace** localizada no lado esquerdo do painel, **clique nela para acessar o marketplace**.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/2026bd6d466c48e5aecc85b3a304e0a6.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Clique no botão **Lançar** correspondente à aplicação de software desejada.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/0e31f47874b1425abe20046d634fead1.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Após clicar no **botão de Lançar**, você será redirecionado para a página de criação de instâncias, com a aplicação de software pré-selecionada.\r\n- Selecione as configurações necessárias, como o plano de instância, tamanho da CPU, número de processadores, e configure a rede e os firewalls.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://localhost:8080/apidocs/resources/marketplace/64da2955c64a45659daf2eaa168cef4c.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Por fim, clique em **Criar Instância**.\r\n- Agora a instância foi criada com sucesso.\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n**Sobre o Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo [Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.**','\0','Iniciando aplicativos','guia-de-usuario/mercado/iniciando-aplicativos',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',90,'f3a7b8e8-531e-4f09-87bf-ea0c02f7eb28',NULL,2,NULL,175,0,'cms_f7eb28'),
(103,31,31,2,'2023-09-28 06:03:07','<h1>Introduction</h1>\n<p><strong>Stackbill Monitoring</strong> refers to the <strong>process of tracking and measuring the performance and health of cloud-based resources, such as virtual machines, databases, applications, and services.</strong> <strong>Monitoring</strong> is essential to ensure that cloud resources are available, responsive, and performing optimally, and to identify and resolve any issues or failures that may impact the availability or performance of the services provided to users.</p>\n<p><strong>Monitoring typically involves collecting and analyzing data from various sources, such as logs, metrics,</strong> and events generated by cloud resources, <strong>Stackbill monitoring</strong> offer a wide range of features and capabilities, such as real-time dashboards, alerts, and automated remediation, to help organizations monitor, analyze, and respond to issues in a timely and efficient manner.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/monitoring/Dashboard-Overview#dashboard-overview-in-Stackbill-\">Dashboard Overview</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/monitoring/Adding-Instance#install-monitoring-agent-to-an-instance\">Adding Instance</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/monitoring/Adding-Instance#setting-up-monitoring-alerts-in-Stackbill-\">Setting up Monitoring Alerts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/monitoring/Adding-Instance#manage-notification-in-Stackbill-\">Manage Notification in Stackbill </a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>About Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> is a complete self-service intuitive <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Cloud Management Portal</a> with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.</strong></p>\n','',1,'# Introduction\r\n\r\n**Stackbill Monitoring** refers to the **process of tracking and measuring the performance and health of cloud-based resources, such as virtual machines, databases, applications, and services.** **Monitoring** is essential to ensure that cloud resources are available, responsive, and performing optimally, and to identify and resolve any issues or failures that may impact the availability or performance of the services provided to users.\r\n\r\n**Monitoring typically involves collecting and analyzing data from various sources, such as logs, metrics,** and events generated by cloud resources, **Stackbill monitoring** offer a wide range of features and capabilities, such as real-time dashboards, alerts, and automated remediation, to help organizations monitor, analyze, and respond to issues in a timely and efficient manner.\r\n\r\n\r\n- [Dashboard Overview](/help/docs/user-guide/monitoring/Dashboard-Overview#dashboard-overview-in-Stackbill-)\r\n- [Adding Instance](/help/docs/user-guide/monitoring/Adding-Instance#install-monitoring-agent-to-an-instance)\r\n  - [Setting up Monitoring Alerts](/help/docs/user-guide/monitoring/Adding-Instance#setting-up-monitoring-alerts-in-Stackbill-)\r\n  - [Manage Notification in Stackbill ](/help/docs/user-guide/monitoring/Adding-Instance#manage-notification-in-Stackbill-)\r\n\r\n  -----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n\r\n**About Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] is a complete self-service intuitive [Cloud Management Portal](https://localhost:8080/) with extensive features leveraging Apache CloudStack® with state of art years of expertise.**','','Introduction','user-guide/monitoring/introduction',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',103,'cb18f788-2646-4cec-8902-751d947be438',NULL,1,'How to enable monitoring',175,0,'cms_7be438'),
(104,32,31,2,'2023-09-28 06:06:46','<h1>Introducción</h1>\n<p><strong>El Monitoreo de Stackbill</strong> se refiere al <strong>proceso de seguimiento y medición del rendimiento y la salud de los recursos basados en la nube, como máquinas virtuales, bases de datos, aplicaciones y servicios.</strong> El <strong>monitoreo</strong> es esencial para asegurar que los recursos en la nube estén disponibles, sean receptivos y funcionen de manera óptima, y para identificar y resolver cualquier problema o falla que pueda afectar la disponibilidad o el rendimiento de los servicios proporcionados a los usuarios.</p>\n<p><strong>El monitoreo generalmente implica la recopilación y análisis de datos de diversas fuentes, como registros, métricas</strong> y eventos generados por los recursos en la nube. <strong>El monitoreo de Stackbill</strong> ofrece una amplia gama de características y capacidades, como paneles en tiempo real, alertas y solución automatizada, para ayudar a las organizaciones a monitorear, analizar y responder a problemas de manera oportuna y eficiente.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/supervisión/descripción-general-del-panel#resumen-del-panel-en-Stackbill-\">Resumen del Panel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/supervisión/agregar-instancia#instalar-agente-de-monitoreo-en-una-instancia\">Agregar Instancia</a>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/supervisión/agregar-instancia#configuración-de-alertas-de-monitoreo-en-Stackbill-\">Configuración de Alertas de Monitoreo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/supervisión/agregar-instancia#gestión-de-notificaciones-en-Stackbill-\">Gestión de Notificaciones en Stackbill </a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Acerca de Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gestión de Nubes</a> con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.</strong></p>\n','',2,'# Introducción\r\n\r\n**El Monitoreo de Stackbill** se refiere al **proceso de seguimiento y medición del rendimiento y la salud de los recursos basados en la nube, como máquinas virtuales, bases de datos, aplicaciones y servicios.** El **monitoreo** es esencial para asegurar que los recursos en la nube estén disponibles, sean receptivos y funcionen de manera óptima, y para identificar y resolver cualquier problema o falla que pueda afectar la disponibilidad o el rendimiento de los servicios proporcionados a los usuarios.\r\n\r\n**El monitoreo generalmente implica la recopilación y análisis de datos de diversas fuentes, como registros, métricas** y eventos generados por los recursos en la nube. **El monitoreo de Stackbill** ofrece una amplia gama de características y capacidades, como paneles en tiempo real, alertas y solución automatizada, para ayudar a las organizaciones a monitorear, analizar y responder a problemas de manera oportuna y eficiente.\r\n\r\n- [Resumen del Panel](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/supervisión/descripción-general-del-panel#resumen-del-panel-en-Stackbill-)\r\n- [Agregar Instancia](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/supervisión/agregar-instancia#instalar-agente-de-monitoreo-en-una-instancia)\r\n  - [Configuración de Alertas de Monitoreo](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/supervisión/agregar-instancia#configuración-de-alertas-de-monitoreo-en-Stackbill-)\r\n  - [Gestión de Notificaciones en Stackbill ](/help/docs/guía-del-usuario/supervisión/agregar-instancia#gestión-de-notificaciones-en-Stackbill-)\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n**Acerca de Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] es un completo portal de autoatención intuitivo [Portal de Gestión de Nubes](https://localhost:8080/) con funciones extensas que aprovecha Apache CloudStack® con años de experiencia en tecnología de vanguardia.**','','Introducción','guía-del-usuario/supervisión/introducci-n',1,2,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',103,'7d6f66fa-03dc-44b8-877c-b26a2cef67e8',NULL,1,'Cómo habilitar el monitoreo',175,0,'cms_ef67e8'),
(105,33,31,2,'2023-09-28 06:08:11','<h1>Introdução</h1>\n<p><strong>O Monitoramento do Stackbill</strong> refere-se ao <strong>processo de rastreamento e medição do desempenho e da saúde de recursos baseados em nuvem, como máquinas virtuais, bancos de dados, aplicativos e serviços.</strong> O <strong>monitoramento</strong> é essencial para garantir que os recursos em nuvem estejam disponíveis, responsivos e funcionando de maneira otimizada, e para identificar e resolver quaisquer problemas ou falhas que possam afetar a disponibilidade ou o desempenho dos serviços fornecidos aos usuários.</p>\n<p><strong>O monitoramento geralmente envolve a coleta e análise de dados de diversas fontes, como logs, métricas</strong> e eventos gerados pelos recursos em nuvem. <strong>O monitoramento do Stackbill</strong> oferece uma ampla gama de recursos e capacidades, como painéis em tempo real, alertas e soluções automatizadas, para ajudar as organizações a monitorar, analisar e responder a problemas de maneira oportuna e eficiente.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/monitoramento/visão-geral-do-painel#visão-geral-do-painel-no-Stackbill-\">Visão Geral do Painel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/monitoramento/adicionando-instância#adicionando-instância-instale-o-agente-de-monitoramento-em-uma-instância\">Adicionando Instância</a>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/monitoramento/adicionando-instância#configurando-alertas-de-monitoramento-no-Stackbill-\">Configurando Alertas de Monitoramento</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/monitoramento/adicionando-instância#gerenciando-notificações-no-Stackbill-\">Gerenciando Notificações no Stackbill </a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Sobre o Stackbill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stackbill</a> é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo <a href=\"https://localhost:8080/\">Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens</a> com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.</strong></p>\n','',3,'# Introdução\r\n\r\n**O Monitoramento do Stackbill** refere-se ao **processo de rastreamento e medição do desempenho e da saúde de recursos baseados em nuvem, como máquinas virtuais, bancos de dados, aplicativos e serviços.** O **monitoramento** é essencial para garantir que os recursos em nuvem estejam disponíveis, responsivos e funcionando de maneira otimizada, e para identificar e resolver quaisquer problemas ou falhas que possam afetar a disponibilidade ou o desempenho dos serviços fornecidos aos usuários.\r\n\r\n**O monitoramento geralmente envolve a coleta e análise de dados de diversas fontes, como logs, métricas** e eventos gerados pelos recursos em nuvem. **O monitoramento do Stackbill** oferece uma ampla gama de recursos e capacidades, como painéis em tempo real, alertas e soluções automatizadas, para ajudar as organizações a monitorar, analisar e responder a problemas de maneira oportuna e eficiente.\r\n\r\n- [Visão Geral do Painel](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/monitoramento/visão-geral-do-painel#visão-geral-do-painel-no-Stackbill-)\r\n- [Adicionando Instância](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/monitoramento/adicionando-instância#adicionando-instância-instale-o-agente-de-monitoramento-em-uma-instância)\r\n  - [Configurando Alertas de Monitoramento](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/monitoramento/adicionando-instância#configurando-alertas-de-monitoramento-no-Stackbill-)\r\n  - [Gerenciando Notificações no Stackbill ](/help/docs/guia-de-usuario/monitoramento/adicionando-instância#gerenciando-notificações-no-Stackbill-)\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n**Sobre o Stackbill**\r\n\r\n**[Stackbill] é um completo portal de autoatendimento intuitivo [Portal de Gerenciamento de Nuvens](https://localhost:8080/) com recursos extensos, aproveitando o Apache CloudStack® com anos de experiência em tecnologia de ponta.**','','Introdução','guia-de-usuario/monitoramento/introdu-o',1,3,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',103,'801993e6-ee0a-4e58-8231-72e2653174dd',NULL,1,'Como habilitar o monitoramento',175,0,'cms_3174dd'),
(107,5,5,2,'2023-09-28 06:13:11','<h1>Introduction</h1>\n<p><strong>CloudPortal</strong> provides block-level storage volumes to use with our virtual instances. These volumes can be attached to your virtual instance which makes its data and file system available for your nodes. If your instance is running on Linux or windows, then you can mount this volume and format the storage based on your file system.</p>\n<p><strong>CloudPortal</strong> block storage can be useful when your storage needs get increased more than your computing demands, Since these block storage volumes are directly connected to your virtual instance.</p>\n<h2>Storage And Snapshot in CloudPortal Cloud Management Portal</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#adding-a-volume-in-CloudPortal-\">Adding a Volume</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#how-to-format-and-make-available-a--volume-in-windows-machine\">How to format and make available a volume in Windows Machine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#upload-a-volume\">How to format and make available a volume in Linux Machine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#upload-a-volume\">Upload a Volume</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#attach-a-volume\">Attach a volume</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#how-to-take-volume-snapshot\">How to take volume snapshot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#configuring-recurring-snapshot\">Configuring Recurring snapshot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#resize-your-volume\">Resize your volume</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#creating-template-for-a-volume\">creating template for a volume</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/extend-the-root-volume#in-this-tutorial-well-show-you-how-to-extend-windows-vms-root-volume\">Extend the root volume</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/attach-data-volume#steps-to-attach-a-data-volume-in-windows-vm\">Attach a data volume</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/extend-the-data-volume#in-this-tutorial-well-show-you-how-to-extend-windows-vms-data-volume\">Extend the data volume</a></li>\n</ul>\n','',1,'# Introduction\n\n**CloudPortal** provides block-level storage volumes to use with our virtual instances. These volumes can be attached to your virtual instance which makes its data and file system available for your nodes. If your instance is running on Linux or windows, then you can mount this volume and format the storage based on your file system.\n\n**CloudPortal** block storage can be useful when your storage needs get increased more than your computing demands, Since these block storage volumes are directly connected to your virtual instance.\n\n## Storage And Snapshot in CloudPortal Cloud Management Portal\n\n- [Adding a Volume](/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#adding-a-volume-in-CloudPortal-)\n- [How to format and make available a volume in Windows Machine](/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#how-to-format-and-make-available-a--volume-in-windows-machine)\n- [How to format and make available a volume in Linux Machine](/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#upload-a-volume)\n- [Upload a Volume](/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#upload-a-volume)\n- [Attach a volume](/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#attach-a-volume)\n- [How to take volume snapshot](/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#how-to-take-volume-snapshot)\n- [Configuring Recurring snapshot](/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#configuring-recurring-snapshot)\n- [Resize your volume](/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#resize-your-volume)\n- [creating template for a volume](/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/volume#creating-template-for-a-volume)\n- [Extend the root volume](/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/extend-the-root-volume#in-this-tutorial-well-show-you-how-to-extend-windows-vms-root-volume)\n- [Attach a data volume](/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/attach-data-volume#steps-to-attach-a-data-volume-in-windows-vm)\n- [Extend the data volume](/help/docs/user-guide/storage-snapshots/extend-the-data-volume#in-this-tutorial-well-show-you-how-to-extend-windows-vms-data-volume)','\0','Introduction','user-guide/storage-snapshots/introduction',1,1,1,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',107,'267c84e4-88a4-4d67-be41-dffb43c039cd',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_c039cd'),
(108,94,94,2,'2023-09-28 06:33:46','<h1>Get started With API</h1>\n<p>Let\'s discover <strong>Docusaurus in less than 5 minutes</strong>.</p>\n','',1,'\n# Get started With API\n\nLet\'s discover **Docusaurus in less than 5 minutes**.\n','\0','APIs','apis/api-docs/apis',1,19,19,176,'2026-09-25 16:18:15',108,'6c76a166-8be5-4cdf-ad1e-2e72de653dca',NULL,1,NULL,175,0,'cms_653dca'),
